/* GENERATED by tools/build_langs.js from js/i18n/zh-Hant/*.js: do not edit by hand. */
(window.PL_LANG_Q = window.PL_LANG_Q || []).push([{"Welcome to Amity Square! In the square, the Pokémon at the front of your team walks with you.":"歡迎來到互動廣場！在廣場裡，隊伍最前面的寶可夢會陪你一起散步。","So that everyone stays safe, only these Pokémon may come in: {list}.":"為了大家的安全，只有這些寶可夢可以進去：{list}。","I am sorry, {mon} cannot come into the square. Please put one of the Pokémon listed here at the front of your team.":"抱歉，{mon}不能進廣場。請把名單上的寶可夢放在隊伍的最前面。","{mon} seems to have found something in the grass!":"{mon}好像在草叢裡找到了什麼東西！","Good day! I walk here every day, and every day I find more berries than I can carry. Here, have one.":"你好！我每天都來這裡散步，每天撿到的樹果多得拿不動。來，送你一顆。","Come back tomorrow, and I will have another berry for you.":"明天再來吧，我會再給你一顆樹果。","My Pikachu and I come here every morning. It always finds something before I do!":"我每天早上都和皮卡丘來這裡。牠總是比我先找到東西！","It flicks its ears and squeaks happily.":"牠抖了抖耳朵，開心地叫了一聲。","Buneary keeps one ear rolled up when it is happy. Today both ears are rolled up!":"捲捲耳開心的時候會捲起一隻耳朵。今天兩隻都捲起來了！","It bounces up and down on the spot.":"牠在原地蹦蹦跳跳。","Happiny carries a round white stone everywhere. It thinks it is an Egg, bless it.":"小福蛋走到哪裡都抱著一塊圓圓的白石頭。牠以為那是蛋呢，真可愛。","It hugs its round white stone and smiles at you.":"牠抱著圓圓的白石頭，對你笑了笑。","Amity Square. Walk with your Pokémon and enjoy the flowers. Please do not battle here.":"互動廣場。和你的寶可夢一起散步、賞花吧。請不要在這裡對戰。","The Battle Arcade. A roulette before every battle: anything can happen!":"對戰輪盤。每場對戰前先轉輪盤：什麼都可能發生！","Lower HP":"降低HP","Freeze":"冰凍","Get Berries":"獲取樹果","Get Items":"獲取道具","Level Up":"等級提升","Sandstorm":"沙暴","Swap Teams":"寶可夢交換","Speed Up":"加速","Slow Down":"緩慢","Get 1 BP":"獲取1BP","Get 3 BP":"獲取3BP","No Battle":"無對戰","No Event":"無項目","Your Pokémon lost some HP!":"你的寶可夢的HP減少了！","The opponent's Pokémon lost some HP!":"對手的寶可夢的HP減少了！","Your Pokémon were poisoned!":"你的寶可夢中毒了！","The opponent's Pokémon were poisoned!":"對手的寶可夢中毒了！","Your Pokémon were paralyzed!":"你的寶可夢麻痺了！","The opponent's Pokémon were paralyzed!":"對手的寶可夢麻痺了！","Your Pokémon were burned!":"你的寶可夢灼傷了！","The opponent's Pokémon were burned!":"對手的寶可夢灼傷了！","One of the opponent's Pokémon fell asleep!":"對手的一隻寶可夢睡著了！","One of the opponent's Pokémon was frozen solid!":"對手的一隻寶可夢凍住了！","The opponent's Pokémon got Berries to hold!":"對手的寶可夢拿到了樹果！","The opponent's Pokémon got items to hold!":"對手的寶可夢拿到了道具！","Your Pokémon grew three levels for this battle!":"你的寶可夢在這場對戰中提升了三級！","The opponent's Pokémon grew three levels for this battle!":"對手的寶可夢在這場對戰中提升了三級！","The sunlight will be harsh in this battle!":"這場對戰會是大晴天！","It will rain in this battle!":"這場對戰會下雨！","A sandstorm will rage in this battle!":"這場對戰會颳沙暴！","It will hail in this battle!":"這場對戰會下冰雹！","A deep fog will cover this battle!":"這場對戰會起濃霧！","The dimensions will be twisted at the start of this battle!":"這場對戰一開始時空就會扭曲！","Swap! You will battle with the opponent's Pokémon, and the opponent with yours!":"交換！你要用對手的寶可夢對戰，對手則用你的！","The roulette will spin faster!":"輪盤會轉得更快！","The roulette will spin slower!":"輪盤會轉得更慢！","Next time, the roulette will move at random!":"下一次輪盤會亂跳！","No battle! Battle No. {n} counts as won.":"無對戰！第 {n} 場算你贏。","No event this time.":"這次什麼都沒有。","Let's see what the roulette has in store for us!":"來看看輪盤為我們準備了什麼吧！","Luck is part of skill. That's what I tell myself.":"運氣也是實力的一部分。我是這麼告訴自己的。","Whatever the panel says, I'm ready!":"不管停在哪一格，我都準備好了！","Round and round it goes. Let's battle!":"轉啊轉的。開始對戰吧！","The roulette was on your side.":"輪盤站在你那邊。","Luck had nothing to do with it, did it?":"跟運氣沒關係吧？","Spun out...":"轉暈了……","Not my lucky day.":"今天不是我的幸運日。","Twenty wins in a row! I'm Dahlia, the Arcade Star. Shall we see whose luck burns brighter?":"連勝二十場！我是輪盤女神大麗。來看看誰的運氣更旺吧？","Forty-eight wins! You really know how to ride your luck. Let's make this one count!":"四十八連勝！你真懂得乘著運氣往前衝。這一場可要好好打！","What a thrill! Fortune smiles on those who battle with heart.":"太刺激了！幸運會眷顧用心對戰的人。","Amazing! Nobody has ever spun my roulette like that.":"太厲害了！從來沒有人能這樣轉動我的輪盤。","Battle No. {n}: stop the roulette!":"第 {n} 場：停下輪盤！","Welcome to the Battle Arcade! This counter is for double battles.":"歡迎來到對戰輪盤！這裡是雙打的櫃檯。","Welcome to the Battle Arcade! This counter is for single battles.":"歡迎來到對戰輪盤！這裡是單打的櫃檯。","Enter three Pokémon. Here they do not hold their own items, and they are healed after every battle.":"請報名三隻寶可夢。在這裡牠們不能帶自己的道具，每場對戰後都會回滿。","Before each battle the roulette spins. Stop it, and the panel it lands on changes the battle: for you, for your opponent, or for both.":"每場對戰前輪盤都會轉動。停下它，停住的那一格會改變這場對戰：對你、對對手，或對雙方。","Battle well and the panels favor your opponent more often. Win seven in a row to finish a round and earn Battle Points.":"對戰打得好，格子就更常落在對手身上。連贏七場完成一輪，就能拿到對戰點數。","The Arcade Star has come to battle you herself!":"輪盤女神親自來和你對戰了！","The roulette stopped on {panel} ({who})!":"輪盤停在了{panel}（{who}）！","The roulette stopped on {panel}!":"輪盤停在了{panel}！","Dahlia recognizes your skill. You earned the Silver Print!":"大麗認可了你的實力。你得到了銀色印記！","Dahlia recognizes your skill. You earned the Gold Print!":"大麗認可了你的實力。你得到了金色印記！","The Arcade Star, Dahlia, battles Trainers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row. The roulette spins for her too!":"輪盤女神大麗會和單打連勝到第 21 場和第 49 場的訓練家對戰。輪盤也會為她轉動！","The better you battle, the more panels land on your opponent and the field. Battle slowly, and they land on you.":"對戰打得越好，格子越常落在對手和場地上。打得慢吞吞，就會落在你身上。","Past the mist, a still lake fills the cave under Mt. Coronet. Now and then something splashes far out on the water.":"穿過霧氣，一座平靜的湖泊填滿了天冠山底下的洞窟。遠處的水面上不時有什麼東西濺起水花。","Below Victory Road the cave opens onto a cold, dark lake. The water is so still that it looks like a second ceiling.":"冠軍之路的下方，洞窟通向一座又冷又暗的湖。湖水靜得像是另一片洞頂。","Travelers say there is another lake like this one, deep in Victory Road, past where most Trainers ever go.":"旅行者們說，冠軍之路的深處也有一座這樣的湖，在大多數訓練家都沒去過的地方。","Travelers say there is another lake like this one under Mt. Coronet, below the tunnel of Route 211.":"旅行者們說，天冠山底下、211號道路的隧道下方，也有一座這樣的湖。","Two lakes under two mountains, and you have stood on the shore of both.":"兩座山底下的兩座湖，你都站在它們的岸邊看過了。","You caught a Feebas here? Then the lake trusts you. I have been fishing it for three days and seen nothing but Magikarp.":"你在這裡釣到了醜醜魚？看來這座湖信任你。我已經釣了三天，除了鯉魚王什麼都沒見到。","Feebas live in this lake, they say. But only on a few spots of the water, and the spots change every day.":"聽說這座湖裡住著醜醜魚。不過只在水面上的幾個地方，而且那幾個地方每天都會變。","Any rod will do. Cast once on every spot you can reach, and keep going. That is all the advice I have.":"用哪根釣竿都行。能到的每個地方都甩一次竿，一直釣下去。我能給的建議就這些了。","Welcome to the Battleground! Gym Leaders and strong Trainers from all over Sinnoh come here to battle, a few of them each day.":"歡迎來到對決場！神奧各地的道館館主和強大的訓練家都會來這裡對戰，每天來幾位。","Here today: {a}, {b}, {c} and {d}. Talk to whoever you like. Each of them battles you once a day.":"今天來的是：{a}、{b}、{c}和{d}。想和誰對戰就去找誰。每人每天只和你對戰一次。","Every morning I run over here to see who has come. It is better than anything on TV!":"我每天早上都跑來看今天來了誰。比電視上的節目都好看！","I left the mine in good hands for the day. My Pokémon have been digging deeper than ever. Want to see?":"我把礦山交給可靠的人照看一天。我的寶可夢挖得比以前更深了。想見識一下嗎？","Ha! You dug right through us again.":"哈！又被你一口氣挖穿了。","The mine will still be there tomorrow, and so will I. Probably.":"礦山明天還在，我也還在。大概吧。","The flowers here are tough, like the Trainers. Let us see how much you have grown!":"這裡的花和訓練家一樣頑強。讓我看看你成長了多少！","You have grown more than my whole garden.":"你成長得比我整個花園還快。","I bring seeds from Eterna every time I come. Nothing grows in the Survival Area yet, but I will not give up.":"我每次來都會帶百代市的種子。生存區現在還什麼都長不出來，但我不會放棄的。","I walked here barefoot from Veilstone to toughen my feet. Now let me toughen my fists on you!":"我從帷幕市光著腳走來，為了練腳力。現在讓我拿你來練拳頭吧！","My feet are tough. My fists still have work to do.":"腳是練硬了，拳頭還得再練。","Lucario and I train on the rocks out back every morning. You are welcome to join us.":"我和路卡利歐每天早上都在後面的岩石上修行。歡迎你一起來。","WAHAHAHA! Crasher Wake makes a splash even in a dry town like this one! Ready?":"哇哈哈哈！就算在這麼乾燥的小鎮，吉憲也能掀起浪花！準備好了嗎？","WAHAHA! Soaked through, and loving it!":"哇哈哈！渾身濕透，痛快！","There is no sea here, but there is a sea in my heart! Also, Route 226 is right there.":"這裡沒有海，可我心裡有一片海！再說，226號水路就在旁邊。","Ah, the Champion! My ghosts have been dancing all morning. Will you dance with them?":"啊，是冠軍！我的幽靈們跳了一上午的舞。要和牠們一起跳嗎？","Magnifique! You lead the dance now.":"太精彩了！現在由你來領舞。","The Battleground has a wonderful echo. My ghosts adore it.":"對決場裡的回聲好美。我的幽靈們都很喜歡。","BWAHAHAHA! I left a note on the Gym door and sailed straight here. Let us see if you are still made of steel!":"哇哈哈哈！我在道館門上留了張紙條就坐船過來了。讓我看看你是不是還像鋼鐵一樣硬！","BWAHAHA! Steel bends, but it does not break. Neither do I!":"哇哈哈！鋼鐵會彎，但不會斷。我也一樣！","Do not tell Roark I said so, but you are the best Trainer I have ever faced.":"別告訴瓢太是我說的，你是我遇到過的最強的訓練家。","It is so hot here! My team is about to melt, so I need to cool off with a battle!":"這裡好熱！我的隊伍都快化了，得打一場來降降溫！","I feel much cooler now. Beaten, but cooler!":"現在涼快多了。輸是輸了，但涼快！","Snowpoint misses you, you know. Come and have a snowball fight sometime.":"雪峰市的大家都很想你。有空來打雪仗吧。","I heard you would be here. That is the only reason I came. Do not hold back.":"聽說你會來，我才來的。別手下留情。","That woke me up. Thank you.":"這下我清醒了。謝謝。","Flint dragged me here the first time. Now I come on my own.":"第一次是大葉硬拉我來的。現在我自己會來。","We walked through Eterna Forest together, remember? I have trained so much since then!":"我們一起走過百代森林，還記得嗎？那以後我練了好多！","You are still so strong. I am happy for you.":"你還是那麼強。我替你高興。","My Blissey looks after everyone here. Even the people who beat me.":"我的幸福蛋會照顧這裡的每一個人。連打敗我的人也照顧。","The aura in this room is fierce today. Mine and Lucario's, against yours.":"今天這個房間裡的波導很激烈。我和路卡利歐的波導，對上你的。","Your aura has grown. I can feel it from here.":"你的波導變強了。我在這裡都能感覺到。","Byron says hello. He always says hello. Loudly.":"東瓜讓我向你問好。他總是問好，而且嗓門很大。","Welcome to Grandfather's Battleground! On the mountain we fought side by side. Today, we fight each other!":"歡迎來到爺爺的對決場！在山上我們並肩作戰，今天我們來一決勝負！","Wow! Grandfather was watching, too. Now I will never hear the end of it!":"哇！爺爺也在看。這下他要念叨我一輩子了！","Heatran still sleeps under the mountain. I go and say hello sometimes. From far away.":"席多藍恩還睡在山底下。我有時會去打個招呼，遠遠地。","Oh, and a girl called Mira has started coming too. She says a Champion once led her out of a cave.":"對了，一個叫麥兒的女孩也開始來了。她說曾經有一位冠軍帶她走出了洞窟。","I said I would battle you one day, remember? I have not been lost once since then. Not even once!":"我說過總有一天要和你對戰的，還記得嗎？從那以後我一次都沒迷過路。一次都沒有！","I lost the battle, but I did not get lost. That is progress!":"對戰輸了，可我沒迷路。這就是進步！","Next time I go into a cave, I am taking a map. And a Champion.":"下次進洞窟，我要帶地圖。還要帶一位冠軍。","...I came, like I said I would. Arcanine wanted a real battle. So do I.":"……我說過會來，就來了。風速狗想要一場真正的對戰。我也是。","...You are still the strongest person I know.":"……你還是我認識的人裡最強的。","I went back to the stone. Still nothing there. I will keep going back.":"我又去了石碑那裡。還是什麼都沒有。我會一直去的。","Rodolfo":"羅多爾福","Ashlee":"阿什莉","Audrey":"奧黛麗","Geoffrey":"傑弗里","Deanna":"迪安娜","{player}! I knew you would get on that ship! Welcome to the Battle Zone!":"{player}！我就知道你會上那條船！歡迎來到對戰特區！","This whole island is for Trainers who want to get stronger. Come on, come on! There is something you have to see!":"這整座島都是給想變強的訓練家準備的。快來快來！有樣東西你一定要看！","So the Champion found us. I thought you might turn up, {player}.":"冠軍找到我們了。我就猜你會來，{player}。","They are building a Battle Frontier behind us. It is not open yet, so there is nothing to do. You know what happens when he has nothing to do.":"我們身後正在建對戰開拓區。還沒開張，所以沒什麼可做的。你知道他沒事做的時候會怎樣。","I get bored.":"我會無聊。","Wait! Two against two! {player} and me against you two, right now! You will never be bored again!":"等等！二對二！我和{player}對你們兩個，現在就打！保證你再也不無聊！","...That might keep me awake.":"……這倒能讓我醒著。","Ha! That is the spirit! Let us burn!":"哈！這才對嘛！燒起來吧！","Hold on, let me fix up your team first. No excuses!":"等一下，我先幫你的隊伍恢復。不許找藉口！","Not bad. You two make a strange pair, and a dangerous one.":"不錯。你們倆真是奇怪又危險的搭檔。","We are going to want a rematch! Past Route 225 there is a town called the Survival Area, with a Battleground for Trainers like us. Look for us there one day.":"我們還要再打一場！過了225號道路有個地方叫生存區，那裡有給我們這種訓練家準備的對決場。改天來那兒找我們。","We did it, {player}! I am going on ahead to the Survival Area. Do not be late, or I am fining you!":"我們贏了，{player}！我先去生存區了。不許遲到，不然罰款！","That was a good fire. Come and find us at the Battleground when it opens.":"燒得真痛快。對決場開張後來找我們吧。","Let us burn!":"燒起來吧！","I am not bored. It is a strange feeling.":"我不無聊了。這感覺真奇怪。","Ready to go back to Snowpoint City?":"要回雪峰市嗎？","The ship sailed back across the northern sea...":"船穿過北方的海回去了……","A good Trainer aims for the weak spot. I never hit anything else.":"好的訓練家都瞄準弱點。我這輩子就沒打過別的地方。","A young Trainer, all the way out here! When I was your age I carried this lens into every battle. It is yours now.":"這麼年輕的訓練家，居然跑到這裡來了！我像你這麼大時，每場對戰都帶著這枚鏡片。現在給你吧。","Give it to a Pokémon to hold. It helps it land critical hits.":"讓寶可夢帶著它，就更容易打出會心一擊。","They say the fishing is better on the far side of the island, past the volcano. I am too old to find out.":"聽說島那邊、火山後面的魚更好釣。我太老了，去不動了。","I came to the Battle Zone with a team of six and a suitcase. I have been here for a year.":"我帶著六隻寶可夢和一個行李箱來到對戰特區，已經待了一年了。","This island was all fishermen and wind, once. Now every ship brings another Trainer.":"這座島以前只有漁夫和風。現在每條船都會帶來新的訓練家。","Fight Area. North: Route 225 to the Survival Area.":"戰鬥區。北：225號道路，通往生存區。","Route 225. North: Survival Area. South: Fight Area.":"225號道路。北：生存區。南：戰鬥區。","Only the strongest Trainers come to this island. Let me see if you are one of them.":"只有最強的訓練家才會來這座島。讓我看看你是不是其中之一。","Yes. You are.":"是的。你是。","This road gets harder the further north you go.":"這條路越往北越難走。","I look after the wild Pokémon on this road. You look like you need a lesson in respect!":"我負責照看這條路上的野生寶可夢。看來你需要學學什麼叫尊重！","Well, they respect you now.":"好吧，牠們現在尊重你了。","Keep to the path, please, and leave the berries for the Pokémon.":"請走大路，把樹果留給寶可夢。","My birds have flown over every inch of this island. Have you ever seen it from the air?":"我的鳥飛遍了這座島的每個角落。你從空中看過它嗎？","From up there, the volcano in the east looks close enough to touch.":"從天上看，東邊的火山近得好像伸手就能摸到。","Slowpoke and I knew you were coming. It took us a while, but we knew.":"呆呆獸和我早知道你要來。想了好一陣，但我們知道。","We did not know that, though.":"這個我們倒是不知道。","Give it a few minutes. Slowpoke is still thinking about the battle.":"等幾分鐘吧。呆呆獸還在想剛才的對戰。","So you crossed the river. Now try crossing me!":"你渡過河了。現在試試過我這一關！","My dragons will want a word with you next time.":"下次我的龍可要找你算帳。","Some Trainers stay on this road for years before they dare go any further.":"有些訓練家在這條路上待了好幾年，才敢繼續往前走。","Everything grows bigger and stronger out here. Even the fruit on my Tropius!":"這裡什麼都長得又大又壯。連我的熱帶龍結的果子也是！","You have grown bigger and stronger too, it seems.":"看來你也長大變強了。","Tropius grows its fruit all year. Nobody goes hungry on this road.":"熱帶龍一年四季都結果。這條路上沒人會挨餓。","Three Pokémon, three different ways to lose. Pick one!":"三隻寶可夢，三種輸法。選一種吧！","I had not thought of that one.":"這一種我倒沒想到。","A ranger has to know the land. The Survival Area is at the top of this road, then east.":"巡護員得熟悉地形。生存區在這條路的盡頭，再往東走。","The Survival Area is just ahead. If you cannot get past me, you will not last a day there!":"前面就是生存區了。過不了我這關，你在那兒一天也撐不下去！","You will last.":"你撐得下去。","Go on. The town is just east of here.":"去吧。城鎮就在東邊。","There you are, {player}! What took you so long? I have already been all over town!":"你可算來了，{player}！怎麼這麼慢？我都把鎮子逛遍了！","They call this the Survival Area, and only the toughest Trainers come here. So I am staying, obviously!":"這裡叫生存區，只有最強悍的訓練家才來。所以我當然要留下！","That big building is the Battleground. When it opens, every Gym Leader in Sinnoh is going to come here to battle.":"那座大樓就是對決場。等它開張，神奧所有的道館館主都會來這裡對戰。","I am training here until that road opens. Next time we meet, I will be the one fighting you, not beside you!":"路開之前我就在這裡修煉。下次見面，我就是你的對手，不是搭檔了！","Survival Area. A town for Trainers who want to find their limits.":"生存區。這裡屬於想挑戰自己極限的訓練家。","Everyone here is training for something. Nobody can quite remember what.":"這裡每個人都在為了什麼而修煉。至於為了什麼，誰也記不清了。","I buy Full Heals by the crate. You never know what is living on that volcano.":"我的萬靈藥都是整箱買的。誰知道那座火山上住著什麼。","This is the Battleground. One day the Gym Leaders of Sinnoh will meet here to battle anyone who asks. We are not quite ready for them yet.":"這裡是對決場。總有一天，神奧的道館館主會聚在這裡，和所有想挑戰的人對戰。我們還沒準備好。","I came all this way to see Roark battle, and he is not here! I can wait. I have sandwiches.":"我大老遠來看瓢太對戰，他居然不在！我可以等。我帶了三明治。","My grandson has gone off to the volcano again. He says the mountain talks to him. It only ever says one thing to me: stay away.":"我孫子又跑去火山了。他說山在跟他說話。山跟我只說一句：別靠近。","A note on the table says: \"Gone to look for shards. Back when I have enough.\"":"桌上的字條寫著：「出門找碎片了。找夠了就回來。」","And the road east goes to a volcano, over the sea. I am training here first, so do not you dare go up there and have all the fun!":"往東走過海就是一座火山。我先在這裡修行，你可別一個人跑上去把好玩的都玩了！","We have only just cleared this road. A lot of mountain came down here, and it keeps moving.":"這條路我們才剛清理好。山上塌下來好多石頭，而且還在動。","My grandson came home covered in soot, carrying the seal of the mountain under his arm. That boy will be the end of me.":"我孫子一身煤灰地回來，胳膊底下夾著這座山的封印。這孩子遲早要把我嚇死。","East: Route 226. Beyond the sea, Stark Mountain.":"東：226號水路。海的那邊是嚴酷山。","{player}! Perfect timing! I went to challenge Byron, but his Gym is shut. So I will take it out on you!":"{player}！來得正好！我去挑戰東瓜，結果他的道館關著。那我就拿你出氣了！","My team has all grown up since Pastoria. Look!":"我的隊伍比在濕原市時成長多了。你看！","No way! I trained so hard!":"不會吧！我練得那麼努力！","Byron went off to Iron Island, by the way. Ask the sailor at the harbour. I am going to train some more. See you!":"對了，東瓜去鋼鐵島了。去港口問問水手吧。我要繼續修行了。再見！","The next Gym is in Snowpoint City, far to the north. Its Leader, Candice, trains in the snow!":"下一個道館在雪峰市，在遙遠的北方。那裡的館主小菘在雪中修行！","The Gym is shut. A note on the door says: \"Gone to Iron Island. Back soon! Byron\"":"道館關著。門上的紙條寫著：「去鋼鐵島了。馬上回來！東瓜」","Ahoy! Shall I take you out to Iron Island?":"喂！要我送你去鋼鐵島嗎？","The boat sailed out to Iron Island...":"船駛向了鋼鐵島……","Any time. The sea is not going anywhere.":"隨時都行。大海又不會跑掉。","Hey, Champion! Byron uses Steel-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！東瓜使用鋼屬性的寶可夢。","Fire, Fighting and Ground moves are what you want. His Bastiodon is part Rock, so Fighting and Ground moves hit it four times as hard!":"要用火、格鬥和地面屬性的招式。他的護城龍也是岩石屬性，所以格鬥和地面招式有四倍效果！","Careful with Metal Burst: it hits back harder than it was hit. Up to level 50, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"小心金屬爆炸：牠會用更大的力量打回來。在這裡，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢在50級以下都會聽話。","Take the Mine Badge! It is as hard as the one who earned it.":"收下礦物徽章吧！它和贏得它的人一樣堅硬。","{player} received the Mine Badge from Byron!":"{player}從東瓜那裡得到了礦物徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 60 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，60級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算來自其他地區也一樣。","And take TM91, Flash Cannon. A blast of steel light that may lower the foe's Special Defense!":"再收下招式學習器91，加農光炮。這道鋼鐵之光有時能降低對手的特防！","Two lines, two Gyarados. Today is my lucky day!":"兩根釣竿，兩隻暴鯉龍。今天運氣真好！","Not so lucky after all.":"看來運氣也沒那麼好。","You need Surf to get across. There is no other way to Canalave from here.":"要用衝浪才能過去。從這裡去水脈市沒有別的路。","Tony":"托尼","The sea is my stage! Listen to this!":"大海就是我的舞台！聽好了！","My strings broke...":"我的琴弦斷了……","Kricketune and I play for the ships in Canalave harbour.":"我和音箱蟀在水脈市的港口為船隻演奏。","The bridge goes up when big ships come through the canal. It is the best thing in town!":"大船經過運河時，橋會升起來。這是城裡最棒的景象！","Our Gym Leader built his Gym with his own hands, and he has a son who leads a Gym too.":"我們的館主親手建了這座道館，他的兒子也是道館館主。","Fire, Fighting and Ground moves are the answer to Steel. Almost nothing else hurts it much!":"對付鋼屬性就要用火、格鬥和地面。其他招式幾乎都打不痛牠！","A sailor always stocks up before going to sea. Iron Island has no shop!":"水手出海前一定要備好物資。鋼鐵島上可沒有商店！","My husband worked the mines on Iron Island. The steel of Sinnoh came from there.":"我丈夫以前在鋼鐵島的礦山工作。神奧的鋼鐵都是從那裡來的。","Every story in this library starts in Sinnoh. Strange, is it not?":"這座圖書館裡的每個故事都從神奧開始。很奇怪吧？","Jackson":"傑克遜","We built this Gym with Byron, one steel beam at a time!":"我們和東瓜一起，一根鋼樑一根鋼樑地建起了這座道館！","Needs more welding.":"還得再焊一焊。","Steel types resist nearly everything. Do not waste your time on weak moves.":"鋼屬性幾乎什麼都能抵抗。別在弱招式上浪費時間。","David":"大衛","Two Steelix, hard as the island they came from!":"兩隻大鋼蛇，和牠們的故鄉鋼鐵島一樣堅硬！","Even steel can bend.":"鋼鐵也會彎的。","Steelix are part Ground, so Water moves work on them too.":"大鋼蛇也是地面屬性，所以水屬性招式也有效。","This Magnemite keeps my tools sharp. And it bites!":"這隻小磁怪幫我保養工具。而且牠可不好惹！","Back to the workshop.":"回工坊去了。","Magnemite are part Electric. Ground moves hit them four times as hard.":"小磁怪也是電屬性。地面招式對牠有四倍效果。","You have to get past my Steelix first!":"你得先過我的大鋼蛇這一關！","Byron and his son Roark argue about whose Pokémon are tougher. Every single day.":"東瓜和他兒子瓢太天天爭論誰的寶可夢更硬。","Breanna":"布麗安娜","Bronzor can be Levitate or Heatproof. Do you know which is which?":"銅鏡怪的特性可能是飄浮或耐熱。你分得清嗎？","You worked it out.":"被你看穿了。","Steel and Psychic together have very few weak spots. Fire is one of them.":"鋼和超能力屬性組合起來弱點很少，火屬性是其中之一。","Cesar":"塞薩爾","I am the last one before Byron. My Scizor will end this!":"我是東瓜前面最後一關。我的巨鉗螳螂會結束這一切！","Go on. Byron is ready.":"去吧。東瓜已經準備好了。","Scizor has only one weak spot: Fire. It is a big one.":"巨鉗螳螂只有一個弱點：火。不過這個弱點非常致命。","Ha! So you are the one who chased Team Galactic out of my island! I am Byron, and my Steel Pokémon are the hardest in Sinnoh. A Champion of three regions? Then hit me as hard as you can!":"哈！原來就是你把銀河隊趕出了我的島！我是東瓜，我的鋼屬性寶可夢是神奧最硬的。三個地區的冠軍？那就使出全力打過來吧！","Ha ha! What a blow! Even steel rings when it is struck like that.":"哈哈！好重的一擊！這樣打下去，連鋼鐵都會響。","Route 218. West: Canalave City, across the water. East: Jubilife City.":"218號道路。西：水脈市（要過海）　東：祝慶市","Canalave City. A port town, split in two by its canal.":"水脈市。被運河一分為二的港口城市。","Canalave City Gym. Leader: Byron, the Steel man.":"水脈道館。館主：鋼鐵之人東瓜","Canalave Harbour. Ask the sailor about the boat to Iron Island.":"水脈港。去鋼鐵島的船請問水手。","A book of old stories: \"When the world began, there was only one egg. From it came the first Pokémon, and the first Pokémon made time and space.\"":"一本古老的故事書：「世界之初只有一顆蛋。第一隻寶可夢從蛋中誕生，並創造了時間和空間。」","A book of old stories: \"Three spirits sleep in Sinnoh's three lakes. They gave people knowledge, feeling and will.\"":"一本古老的故事書：「三個精靈沉睡在神奧的三座湖中。牠們賜予人們知識、情感和意志。」","...Oh, it is you. Sorry, my head is somewhere else today.":"……啊，是你啊。抱歉，我今天心不在焉的。","My boy will not wake up. He sleeps day and night and cries out in his dreams, as if something dark were standing over him.":"我兒子醒不過來了。他白天黑夜都在睡，還在夢裡大叫，好像有什麼黑乎乎的東西站在他身邊。","The old folk here say a feather from Fullmoon Island, the Lunar Wing, chases bad dreams away. Nobody goes out there anymore...":"這裡的老人們說，滿月島上有一種羽毛叫新月之羽，能趕走噩夢。可是已經沒有人去那裡了……","My boy is up and running around again, all thanks to you! I owe you more than a boat ride.":"我兒子又能下床到處跑了，全多虧了你！我欠你的可不只是一趟船。","Will you go to Fullmoon Island for my boy? I will take you there right away.":"你願意為了我兒子去一趟滿月島嗎？我馬上送你過去。","The boat sailed out to Fullmoon Island...":"船向滿月島駛去……","The boy is fast asleep, tossing and turning. He mumbles something about a shadow...":"男孩睡得很沉，翻來覆去的。他嘴裡嘟囔著什麼影子……","{player} held the Lunar Wing near the sleeping boy. It glowed like the moon...":"{player}把新月之羽靠近熟睡的男孩。羽毛像月亮一樣發出了光……","...Huh? Is it morning? I had such a long, scary dream. Then a bright Pokémon came, and the scary thing went away.":"……咦？天亮了嗎？我做了一個好長好可怕的夢。後來來了一隻發著光的寶可夢，可怕的東西就走了。","Thank you! I am going to tell Dad!":"謝謝你！我要去告訴爸爸！","My dad sails the boat to Iron Island. One day I will be a sailor too!":"我爸爸開船去鋼鐵島。總有一天我也要當船員！","I dreamed of a Pokémon that shone like the moon. It chased the dark thing away, and then I woke up.":"我夢到一隻像月亮一樣發光的寶可夢。牠把黑乎乎的東西趕跑了，然後我就醒了。","The Battle Castle. Castle Points pay for everything: win well to earn them.":"對戰城堡。一切都用城堡點數支付：贏得漂亮才拿得到。","Welcome to the castle, challenger. Allow me to show you how we battle here.":"歡迎來到城堡，挑戰者。請讓我示範這裡的對戰方式。","Your Pokémon look tired. Good.":"你的寶可夢看起來很累了。正合我意。","Every point you spend is a point you do not have. Did you spend wisely?":"花掉的每一點都回不來了。你花得明智嗎？","A noble battle, then!":"那就來一場高貴的對戰吧！","A royal performance.":"真是一場王者風範的表現。","I should have saved my points...":"我應該把點數留著的……","You are welcome at court any time.":"宮廷隨時歡迎你。","Defeated with grace, at least.":"至少輸得很優雅。","Twenty wins in my lady's castle! I am Darach, the Castle Valet. Allow me to battle you in her place.":"在我家小姐的城堡裡連贏二十場！我是城堡管家石蘭。請讓我代替她與你對戰。","Forty-eight wins. My lady would be delighted. I, however, intend to stop you here.":"四十八連勝。小姐一定會很高興。不過，我打算在這裡阻止你。","Magnificent. I shall report your victory to my lady at once.":"了不起。我這就去向小姐稟報你的勝利。","Splendid... I have served the castle many years, and seen nothing finer.":"太精彩了……我在城堡服務多年，從沒見過這麼出色的對戰。","Castle Points: {n}.":"城堡點數：{n}。","{mon} HP {hp}/{max}":"{mon} HP {hp}/{max}","Rent an item":"租道具","Battle No. {n}. Castle Points: {cp}. What will you do?":"第 {n} 場。城堡點數：{cp}。要做什麼？","Skip battle No. {n} for {cp} CP?":"要花 {cp} CP 跳過第 {n} 場嗎？","You do not have enough Castle Points.":"城堡點數不夠。","HP · {cp} CP":"HP · {cp} CP","PP · {cp} CP":"PP · {cp} CP","HP and PP · {cp} CP":"HP 和 PP · {cp} CP","{mon} recovered!":"{mon}恢復了！","Which Pokémon will hold it?":"要讓哪隻寶可夢攜帶？","{item} · {cp} CP":"{item} · {cp} CP","{mon} is holding the {item}.":"{mon}攜帶了{item}。","Who they are · {cp} CP":"對手是誰 · {cp} CP","Their summary · {cp} CP":"詳細資料 · {cp} CP","Their moves · {cp} CP":"招式 · {cp} CP","Their level +5 · {cp} CP":"等級 +5 · {cp} CP","Their level -5 · {cp} CP":"等級 -5 · {cp} CP","Your opponents will battle at level {n}.":"對手會以 {n} 級出戰。","{mon}, level {lvl}, at full HP.":"{mon}，{lvl} 級，HP 全滿。","{mon}, level {lvl}, holding {item}.":"{mon}，{lvl} 級，攜帶{item}。","{mon}: {moves}.":"{mon}：{moves}。","Recovery":"回復","{kind}: rank {r} (the top)":"{kind}：等級 {r}（最高）","{kind}: rank {r} → {next} · {cp} CP":"{kind}：等級 {r} → {next} · {cp} CP","{kind} rank up! It is now rank {r}.":"{kind}升級了！現在是等級 {r}。","Welcome to the Battle Castle! This counter is for double battles.":"歡迎來到對戰城堡！這個櫃檯是雙打對戰。","Welcome to the Battle Castle! This counter is for single battles.":"歡迎來到對戰城堡！這個櫃檯是單打對戰。","Enter three Pokémon. Here they do not hold their own items, and nothing heals them between battles.":"請帶三隻寶可夢參加。在這裡不能帶自己的道具，戰鬥之間也不會自動回復。","Castle Points pay for everything: healing, items to hold, a look at your opponents. You earn them by winning well.":"一切都用城堡點數支付：回復、租道具、查看對手。贏得漂亮就能得到點數。","Win seven in a row to finish a round and earn Battle Points. Your Castle Points last as long as your streak.":"連贏七場就完成一輪，可以獲得對戰點數。城堡點數在連勝期間一直保留。","Battle No. {n} was skipped.":"跳過了第 {n} 場。","The Castle Valet has come to battle you himself!":"城堡管家親自來和你對戰了！","{player} earned {n} CP! Castle Points: {cp}.":"{player}得到了 {n} CP！城堡點數：{cp}。","Darach recognizes your skill. You earned the Silver Print!":"石蘭認可了你的實力。你得到了銀色印記！","Darach recognizes your skill. You earned the Gold Print!":"石蘭認可了你的實力。你得到了金色印記！","The Castle Valet, Darach, battles in his lady's place against Trainers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row.":"城堡管家石蘭會代替小姐，和單打連勝到第 21 場和第 49 場的訓練家對戰。","Castle Points: {cp}. Ranks: Info {i}, Recovery {r}, Items {t}.":"城堡點數：{cp}。等級：查看 {i}、回復 {r}、道具 {t}。","The ruins have stood for longer than anyone can remember. We only look after them.":"這座遺跡存在的時間，比任何人記得的都久。我們只是守護它而已。","Those people in the space suits have gone into the ruins. Please, can you stop them?":"那些穿太空服的人進了遺跡。拜託了，你能阻止他們嗎？","Thank you for driving them out of the ruins. And what is this? The Old Charm! So my Cynthia sent you.":"謝謝你把他們趕出遺跡。咦，這是？古代護符！原來是我家竹蘭讓你來的。","This charm has been in our family for a very long time. Sinnoh's oldest stories are tied to it.":"這個護符在我們家傳了很久很久。神奧最古老的傳說都和它有關。","I would give you HM03 for your trouble, but I see you carry Surf already. Take this instead.":"本來想把秘傳學習器03送給你當謝禮，不過你已經有衝浪了。收下這個吧。","TM51 is Roost. The user lands and rests, and gets back half its HP.":"招式學習器51是羽棲。使用者降落休息，回復一半的HP。","Welcome to the Cafe Cabin! Our Moomoo Milk is the best on Route 210.":"歡迎光臨咖啡小屋！我們的哞哞鮮奶是210號道路上最棒的。","Go in if you want. The boss will finish you off!":"想進就進吧。老大會收拾你的！","The spirit is a flaw in this world. One day I will remove it, and then you will understand.":"心是這個世界的缺陷。總有一天我會把它抹去，到時你就明白了。","Cyrus left the ruins without another word.":"赤日一句話也沒再說，離開了遺跡。","Celestic Town Elder":"神和鎮的長老","Patrick":"帕特里克","A Dragon Tamer fears nothing, not even fog. Come on!":"馴龍師什麼都不怕，連霧也不怕。來吧！","Dragons are hard to raise, you know.":"龍可是很難養的。","Gible loves caves, but I have to walk it through here to reach Celestic Town.":"圓陸鯊喜歡洞穴，不過要去神和鎮，只能帶牠走這裡。","I cannot see a thing in this fog, but I can hear you. Hiyah!":"這霧裡什麼都看不見，但我聽得到你。嘿呀！","I never saw that coming. Really.":"我真的沒看到你出招。","Walking in fog trains your ears as well as your legs.":"在霧裡走路，既練腿也練耳朵。","Brianna":"布莉安娜","My owls see through this fog as if it were night. And you?":"我的貓頭鷹在霧裡就像在夜裡一樣看得清。你呢？","They did not see that coming.":"這下牠們也沒料到。","Noctowl never loses its way, fog or no fog.":"貓頭夜鷹從不迷路，有霧沒霧都一樣。","A battle on the bridge road, with the fog all around. Perfect!":"在橋邊的路上對戰，四周都是霧。太棒了！","Well fought.":"打得好。","A Nosepass evolves near Mt. Coronet. Mine became a Probopass right there.":"朝北鼻在天冠山附近會進化。我的就是在那裡變成大朝北鼻的。","Alyssa":"艾莉莎","If you got this far in the fog, you must be good. Show me!":"能在霧裡走到這裡，你一定很厲害。讓我看看！","I knew it.":"果然如此。","Celestic Town is just over the bridge. It is quiet there, and very old.":"過了橋就是神和鎮。那裡很安靜，也很古老。","Nathan":"內森","Ninja art: hiding in the fog! You found me? Then we battle!":"忍法：霧隱之術！被你發現了？那就對戰吧！","I should have hidden better...":"我應該藏得更好才對……","A true ninja needs no fog. I am still learning.":"真正的忍者不需要霧。我還在學。","Nothing warms you up after the fog like a glass of fresh milk.":"走完霧路，來杯鮮奶最暖身了。","Route 211 climbs into Mt. Coronet from here. The rocks are loose today, so you had better stay in town.":"211號道路從這裡通往天冠山。今天岩石鬆動，你還是留在鎮上吧。","Those people in the space suits showed up this morning. They want something in the ruins!":"那些穿太空服的人今天早上來的。他們想要遺跡裡的什麼東西！","The elder looks after the ruins, as her family always has.":"長老守護著遺跡，她的家族世代如此。","The boss is busy in there. Nobody goes in!":"老大正在裡面忙。誰也不准進去！","Ugh! Boss, I tried!":"嗚！老大，我盡力了！","Scholars come from all over Sinnoh to see the mural in the ruins. Nobody can agree on what it means.":"全神奧的學者都來看遺跡裡的壁畫，但誰也說不清它的含義。","My grandfather told me that long ago, people and Pokémon were the same. I still wonder about that.":"爺爺告訴過我，很久以前人和寶可夢是一樣的。我到現在還在想這件事。","So we meet again. This mural tells of the Pokémon that shaped time and space. With that power, a new world can begin. If you mean to stand in my way, then show me your strength.":"我們又見面了。這幅壁畫講述的是創造時間與空間的寶可夢。有了那份力量，新的世界就能開始。如果你想擋我的路，就讓我看看你的實力。","I see. Your strength is real. It changes nothing.":"原來如此。你的實力是真的。但這改變不了什麼。","Route 210. West: Celestic Town. South: Solaceon Town. Mind the fog!":"210號道路。西：神和鎮　南：隨意鎮　小心大霧！","Celestic Town. A quiet town that keeps the old stories of Sinnoh.":"神和鎮。守護著神奧古老傳說的寧靜小鎮。","The Celestic Ruins. Nobody remembers who built them.":"神和遺跡。沒有人記得是誰建造的。","A mural of two great Pokémon, face to face. One seems to hold back time, the other to bend space itself.":"壁畫上有兩隻巨大的寶可夢相對而立。一隻彷彿能止住時間，另一隻彷彿能扭曲空間。","So here is the new Champion. My Cynthia speaks of nothing else. I have been waiting for you.":"這就是新冠軍啊。我家竹蘭整天都在說你。我一直在等你。","You saw {dialga} and {palkia} at the Spear Pillar, dragged there by a chain. That is not how the old stories say they should be met.":"你在槍之柱見到的{dialga}和{palkia}，是被鎖鏈拖來的。古老的傳說裡，不該這樣與牠們相見。","The mural in our ruins shows two orbs, the {adamant} and the {lustrous}. They were left long ago in Mt. Coronet, on the way up to the peak.":"我們遺跡的壁畫上有兩顆寶珠：{adamant}和{lustrous}。它們很久以前就留在天冠山裡，在通往山頂的路上。","Find them and carry them to the Spear Pillar. To one who comes without a chain, the masters of time and space may yet answer.":"找到它們，帶到槍之柱去。對不帶鎖鏈而來的人，時間和空間的主宰也許會回應。","The orbs lie in Mt. Coronet, on the way up to the Spear Pillar. Mind your step up there.":"寶珠就在天冠山裡，在去槍之柱的路上。上山要當心。","A little girl is standing at the far end of the table, looking at you without a word...":"餐桌的另一頭站著一個小女孩，一言不發地看著你……","You blink, and she is gone. There is no other door in the room.":"你眨了一下眼，她就不見了。這個房間明明沒有別的門。","An old TV. Its screen stays dark.":"一台舊電視。螢幕一直是黑的。","An old TV. It is not even plugged in. People say it switches itself on at night, though.":"一台舊電視，連插頭都沒插。不過聽說它到了晚上會自己打開。","The unplugged TV flickers on by itself! Something is moving inside the screen...":"沒插電的電視自己閃爍著亮了起來！螢幕裡有什麼東西在動……","{mon} slipped back into the wires, and the screen went dark.":"{mon}又鑽回了電線裡，螢幕黑了下來。","A painting of a Pokémon and its Trainer. Wherever you stand, its eyes seem to be looking right at you...":"一幅畫著寶可夢和牠的訓練家的畫。不管你站在哪裡，畫裡的眼睛好像都在盯著你……","Welcome to the Contest Hall! Here Pokémon show how fine they look, how well they dance and how they perform.":"歡迎來到華麗大賽會場！寶可夢在這裡展示牠們的外表、舞蹈和演技。","There are three rounds. In the Visual round, the judges look at your Pokémon's condition: Poffins help.":"比賽分三輪。在視覺審查中，評審會看寶可夢的狀態：寶芬能幫上忙。","{mon} may now enter the {rank} of the {cat} contest.":"{mon}現在可以參加{cat}組的{rank}了。","Welcome to the Poffin House! We cook Poffins from berries. Pokémon love them, and they make them shine in contests.":"歡迎來到寶芬屋！我們用樹果做寶芬。寶可夢很愛吃，吃了在比賽裡會更出色。","{player} received a Poffin Case!":"{player}得到了寶芬盒！","Cook Poffins":"做寶芬","Feed a Poffin":"餵寶芬","Come back any time. The pot is always warm!":"隨時歡迎再來。鍋子一直是熱的！","You have no berries to cook with. The clerk sells some.":"你沒有可以用的樹果。店員那裡有賣。","Cook!":"開始做！","In the pot: {list}":"鍋裡：{list}","Your Poffin Case is full.":"寶芬盒已經滿了。","{player} made a {poffin}! Level {n}, smoothness {s}.":"{player}做出了{poffin}！等級 {n}，順滑度 {s}。","Your Poffin Case is empty. Cook some first!":"寶芬盒是空的。先做一些吧！","{poffin} Lv. {n}":"{poffin} Lv. {n}","Which Poffin?":"哪個寶芬？","{mon} can't eat any more Poffins.":"{mon}已經吃不下寶芬了。","{mon} ate the {poffin}!":"{mon}吃了{poffin}！","Plain berries, perfect for Poffins!":"普通的樹果，最適合做寶芬！","Poffin chef":"寶芬廚師","The dance is my favourite part! You have to step right on the beat.":"我最喜歡舞蹈了！一定要踩準節拍。","A Pokémon in good condition shines in the Visual round. The Poffin House east of the road can help with that.":"狀態好的寶可夢在視覺審查裡很亮眼。路東邊的寶芬屋能幫上忙。","Four berries in one Poffin make it much stronger. But a Pokémon can only eat so many!":"一個寶芬裡放四顆樹果會強很多。不過寶可夢能吃的數量有限！","A poster: \"Win a ribbon at every rank! Normal, Great, Ultra, Master.\"":"海報：「每個等級都拿一枚獎章！普通、高手、究極、大師。」","The boss is going up to the peak, and nobody follows him. Nobody!":"首領要上山頂，誰也不准跟著。誰也不准！","You followed him. I said nobody!":"你還是跟上來了。我都說了誰也不准！","There are more of us higher up. Many more.":"再往上還有我們的人。多得是。","I carried boxes all the way up this mountain. I am in no mood for you!":"我一路把箱子搬上這座山，沒心情跟你耗！","And now my arms hurt and I have lost.":"現在胳膊疼，還輸了。","I do not know what was in the boxes. I am not paid to know.":"我不知道箱子裡裝的是什麼。這不歸我管。","A kid, this high up? You should have stayed at the bottom!":"小孩子跑這麼高？你該待在山腳下的！","I should have stayed at the bottom.":"該待在山腳下的是我。","It gets cold outside. I hope you brought a coat.":"外面很冷。希望你帶了外套。","The way out to the snow is mine to guard. Turn around!":"通往雪地的出口歸我看守。回去吧！","I was told this would be an easy post.":"他們說這個崗位很輕鬆的。","The boss walked past me without a word. He never even looked at me.":"首領一言不發地從我身邊走過，看都沒看我一眼。","You came through the snow for this? You must really want to lose!":"你穿過雪地就為了這個？這麼想輸嗎！","My feet are too cold to think straight.":"腳太冷了，腦子都轉不動了。","The ladder goes on up. I would stay here if I were you.":"梯子還能繼續往上爬。換作是我就留在這裡。","A new world is about to begin, and you are spoiling it!":"新世界就要開始了，你卻來攪局！","Spoiled.":"全攪黃了。","What do you mean, a place for us? Of course there is a place for us. The boss said so.":"什麼叫有沒有我們的位置？當然有了。首領親口說的。","The air is thin up here. Let me take your breath away!":"這裡空氣稀薄。讓我來叫你喘不過氣！","I think you took mine.":"喘不過氣的好像是我。","Can you feel the mountain shaking? It started when the boss went up.":"你感覺到山在晃嗎？首領上去之後就開始了。","This is the last cave before the peak. You will not see the end of it!":"這是山頂前最後一個洞穴。你走不到頭的！","You saw the end of it.":"你走到頭了。","The ruins on the peak are older than anybody knows.":"山頂的遺跡古老得沒人說得清。","My Golbat has been waiting in the dark for days. It is not in a good mood!":"我的大嘴蝠在黑暗裡等了好幾天，心情很差！","Now it is in a worse one.":"現在牠心情更差了。","Go on, then. The Commanders are up there.":"去吧。幹部們就在上面。","Nobody reaches the Spear Pillar today!":"今天誰也別想到槍之柱！","Somebody just did.":"剛剛就有人做到了。","I have never seen the boss look happy before today. It was not a nice thing to see.":"我今天才第一次看到首領高興的樣子。那可不是什麼好景象。","Nothing is getting past me while I watch this place. Go on, you will be late!":"有我守著這裡，什麼也別想過去。快去吧，要遲到了！","The boss has begun, and nobody is to disturb him. It will take both of us to make sure of that!":"首領已經開始了，誰也不許打擾。我們兩個就是為這個守在這裡的！","Both of us were not enough!":"我們兩個都不夠！","So you climbed all this way. You are just in time to watch.":"你竟然一路爬到了這裡。來得正好，看著吧。","This is the Red Chain. With it, the masters of time and space must answer to me.":"這就是紅色鎖鏈。有了它，時間和空間的主宰都得聽命於我。","{dialga} and {palkia} appeared among the pillars!":"{dialga}和{palkia}出現在石柱之間！","The old world ends here. Mars. Jupiter. See that I am not disturbed.":"舊世界到此為止。夥星，歲星，別讓任何人打擾我。","You heard the boss. This is as far as you go.":"聽到首領的話了吧。你只能走到這裡。","I told you not to bother, did I not? Two Commanders at once. Good luck.":"我不是說過別白費力氣嗎？兩位幹部一起上。祝你好運。","Hold it right there! You are not doing this without me, {player}!":"等一下！這種事不能少了我，{player}！","I trained until I dropped, and then I ran all the way up here. That Commander owes me a rematch!":"我練到累趴下，然後一路跑上來。那個幹部還欠我一場比賽！","Your team looks tired. Here, let me fix that.":"你的隊伍看起來累了。來，交給我。","Two against two, {player}! Let us show them!":"二對二，{player}！讓她們見識一下！","No! We are Commanders of Team Galactic!":"不！我們可是銀河隊的幹部！","Stop now, if you like. It hardly matters. The boss has already won.":"想停手就停手吧，無所謂了。首領已經贏了。","Yes. Watch closely. The chain holds, and the world begins again, with no spirit left to spoil it.":"沒錯。看清楚了。鎖鏈不會斷，世界將重新開始，再也沒有心靈來敗壞它。","Suddenly the ground shook. A huge shadow rose out of the stones and spread across the pillars.":"地面突然震動起來。一道巨大的影子從石頭裡升起，籠罩了所有石柱。","{dialga} and {palkia} were gone!":"{dialga}和{palkia}消失了！","What is this? Something is tearing the air apart. This was no part of my world!":"這是什麼？有東西在撕開空氣。我的世界裡沒有這種東西！","A rift split the air, and dark shapes dragged Cyrus inside!":"空氣裂開了一道縫隙，黑色的影子把赤日拖了進去！","Boss? Boss!":"首領？首領！","This is not what we were told would happen. Come on, Mars. We are leaving.":"這和說好的不一樣。走吧，夥星。我們撤。","I came as fast as I could, and I see I am too late to stop it.":"我已經盡快趕來了，看來還是來不及阻止。","That shadow was Giratina. The old stories of Celestic Town tell of a Pokémon sent away for its violence, to a world behind our own.":"那道影子是騎拉帝納。神和鎮的古老傳說裡，有一隻寶可夢因為太過暴戾，被放逐到了我們世界背後的另一個世界。","Cyrus reached for time and space, and it came to answer him. Now the way is open, and that world is pressing against this one.":"赤日想要奪取時間和空間，把牠引了出來。現在通道已經打開，那個世界正壓向這邊。","Somebody has to go in after him. I am going, and I would be glad to have you beside me, {player}.":"必須有人進去追他。我要去，如果你能和我一起，那就太好了，{player}。","I will stay and guard this place. Somebody has to, and I just ran up a mountain. Do not be late coming back!":"我留下來守著這裡。總得有人守，而且我剛跑完一座山。別太晚回來！","Fallen rocks block the ladder. There is no way up for now.":"落石擋住了梯子。現在上不去。","People in white uniforms came through in a great hurry. They cleared the rocks and went up that ladder!":"剛才有一群穿白制服的人急匆匆地過來，搬開落石，從那個梯子上去了！","The way up the mountain is closed by a rockfall. Nobody has been to the peak in years.":"上山的路被落石封住了。已經好多年沒人上過山頂了。","The boss will not be pleased. Not that he is ever pleased.":"首領不會高興的。雖說他也從沒高興過。","The rift has closed. Only a faint shimmer is left in the air.":"裂縫已經閉合，空氣中只剩下一點微光。","Step into the rift when you are ready. I will be right behind you.":"準備好了就走進裂縫吧。我就跟在你後面。","So this is the world behind our own. Nothing here keeps still, not even the ground.":"原來這就是我們世界背後的世界。這裡什麼都不安定，連地面也一樣。","A vast shadow slid across the dark overhead, and sank away below.":"一道巨大的影子掠過頭頂的黑暗，沉向了下方。","Giratina. It went down, and Cyrus must be down there too. If this distortion keeps growing, it will swallow our world as well.":"是騎拉帝納。牠往下去了，赤日一定也在下面。這種扭曲再擴大下去，連我們的世界也會被吞沒。","Those panels must lead deeper. I will go on ahead and look for the way. Do not stop for long.":"那些傳送板一定通往更深的地方。我先去探路。別耽擱太久。","{uxie}, {mesprit} and {azelf} are here! They came after us.":"{uxie}、{mesprit}和{azelf}都來了！牠們跟著我們過來了。","You set them free, and now they want to help. They know this place. Follow the panels, and they will meet us further down.":"你救了牠們，現在牠們想幫忙。牠們熟悉這裡。沿著傳送板走，牠們會在下面等我們。","He is just ahead. Your team has come a long way, so let me see to them first.":"他就在前面。你的隊伍走了很遠的路，先讓我照看一下吧。","I will stay close, but this is your fight. He has never once listened to me.":"我就在附近，但這一戰是你的。他從來沒聽過我的話。","Giratina sank away into the shadows.":"騎拉帝納沉入了陰影之中。","Do you feel that? The ground has stopped shaking. Time and space are settling again.":"你感覺到了嗎？地面不再震動了。時間和空間正在恢復平靜。","So you have taken my new world from me as well. It makes no difference. I will stay here. In this place, at least, nobody feels anything.":"你連我的新世界也奪走了。無所謂。我留在這裡。至少在這個地方，誰也不會有感情。","Cyrus...":"赤日……","Cyrus turned and walked away into the dark.":"赤日轉過身，走進了黑暗。","We cannot make him come back. Over here, {player}. There is a way out, and I think it was left open for us.":"我們沒辦法逼他回來。這邊，{player}。這裡有出口，我想是特意為我們留著的。","We are back. The air smells of water. I have only read about this place: it is Sendoff Spring, a lake hidden in the mountains.":"我們回來了。空氣裡有水的味道。我只在書上讀到過這裡：這是送泉，藏在群山之中的湖。","The way we came has closed behind us. You did well in there, {player}. Better than I could have done alone.":"我們來時的路已經關上了。你在裡面做得很好，{player}。比我一個人做得更好。","They say the cave over there leads back towards that world. If anything is left unfinished, that is where it will be.":"據說那邊的洞窟通往那個世界。如果還有什麼沒了結的事，就在那裡。","Professor Rowan needs to hear about this. Rest for a while first. You have earned it.":"這件事得告訴七灶博士。你先休息一下吧，這是你應得的。","I do not understand. Why can a heart as weak as yours not be broken?":"我不明白。這麼軟弱的心，為什麼就是打不碎？","You did it. Quickly, let me help your team.":"你做到了。快，讓我幫幫你的隊伍。","Giratina came down out of the dark, and the whole island shook!":"騎拉帝納從黑暗中降下，整座浮島都震動起來！","It is furious. It will tear both worlds apart unless somebody stops it. {player}, it is looking at you!":"牠怒不可遏。沒人阻止的話，兩個世界都會被牠撕裂。{player}，牠在盯著你！","Giratina is waiting in the dark of the cave.":"騎拉帝納在洞窟的黑暗中等待著。","Giratina sank away into the shadows. It may come back if you leave the cave.":"騎拉帝納沉入了陰影之中。離開洞窟後，牠也許還會回來。","The warp panel is dark. Something is keeping it from working.":"傳送板暗著。有什麼東西讓它無法啟動。","Uxie is watching the hole beside it, and it does not blink.":"由克希目不轉睛地盯著旁邊的洞。","Mesprit looks from you to the hole, and back again.":"艾姆利多看看你，又看看洞，再看看你。","Azelf hovers over the hole, waiting.":"亞克諾姆懸在洞的上方，靜靜等待。","Those three are showing us something. A strong Pokémon could fill those holes, and I think that is what this panel is waiting for.":"牠們三個在給我們指路。力氣大的寶可夢可以把那些洞填上，我想這塊傳送板等的就是這個。","So you followed me, even here. Look around you. There is no spirit in this world, and that makes it perfect. I need nothing from yours. If you came to drag me back, you will have to defeat me.":"你竟然追到了這裡。看看周圍吧。這個世界沒有心靈，所以才完美。我不需要你們世界的任何東西。想把我拖回去，就先打敗我。","Even here. Even now.":"即使在這裡。即使到了現在。","Excuse me! Are you going through Eterna Forest? It is dark and full of Trainers, and I am a little nervous on my own.":"不好意思！你要穿過百代森林嗎？裡面又暗又有很多訓練家，我一個人有點害怕。","May I come along with you? My Chansey can heal your Pokémon after every battle.":"我可以跟你一起走嗎？我的吉利蛋可以在每場對戰後幫你的寶可夢回復。","Thank you! I will stay right behind you.":"謝謝你！我會緊跟在你後面的。","Oh... Then I will wait here a little longer. Tell me if you change your mind!":"哦……那我在這裡再等一會兒。改變主意的話就告訴我！","We made it out of the forest! Thank you so much for letting me come along.":"我們走出森林了！謝謝你讓我跟你一起走。","Eterna City is just ahead. Good luck at the Gym!":"百代市就在前面。道館戰加油！","The next Gym is in Hearthome City, on the far side of Mt. Coronet. Its Leader, Fantina, uses Ghost types. Spooky!":"下一個道館在天冠山另一邊的家緣市。那裡的館主梅麗莎使用幽靈屬性。好嚇人！","Cheryl's Chansey looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"芽米的吉利蛋照顧了你的寶可夢。牠們完全恢復了！","The door is locked. A sign says: \"Team Galactic Eterna Building. Staff only.\"":"門鎖著。告示寫著：「銀河隊百代大樓。閒人免進。」","The cycle shop is closed. A note on the door says: \"Back soon!\"":"自行車店關著。門上的紙條寫著：「馬上回來！」","Hey, {player}! I went through the forest in no time. Did you get lost?":"喂，{player}！我一下子就穿過森林了。你是不是迷路了？","I am off to challenge Gardenia right now! Grass types do not stand a chance against my Starly!":"我現在就去挑戰菜種！草屬性根本打不過我的姆克兒！","Hey, Champion! Gardenia uses Grass-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！菜種使用草屬性的寶可夢。","Fire, Flying, Bug, Poison and Ice moves work great on them. Water, Ground and Rock moves barely tickle them.":"火、飛行、蟲、毒和冰屬性的招式對牠們很有效。水、地面和岩石屬性的招式只是給牠們撓癢癢。","Picked Piplup? Bring a Starly, or a Pokémon from home with the right moves. Up to level 25, they will listen to you here.":"選了波加曼？帶上姆克兒，或是會合適招式的家鄉寶可夢吧。25級以下的話，牠們在這裡都會聽你的。","This is the Forest Badge. You earned it!":"這是森林徽章。這是你應得的！","{player} received the Forest Badge from Gardenia!":"{player}從菜種那裡得到了森林徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 30 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，30級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算來自其他地區也一樣。","And take this. TM86 is Grass Knot: the heavier the foe, the harder it trips!":"還有這個。招式學習器86是打草結：對手越重，摔得越狠！","Wurmple evolve into Silcoon or Cascoon. Nobody can tell which until it happens.":"刺尾蟲會進化成甲殼繭或盾甲繭。不到進化的那一刻誰也不知道。","Lindsey":"琳賽","This forest is full of strange feelings. Some come from the Pokémon, some from somewhere older.":"這片森林充滿了奇怪的感覺。有些來自寶可夢，有些來自更古老的東西。","Zackary":"扎卡里","I finally made it out of the forest. I need a battle to celebrate!":"我終於走出森林了。得來場對戰慶祝一下！","Some celebration that was.":"這算什麼慶祝啊。","Eterna City is the oldest city in Sinnoh. People say its statue is older than the city itself.":"百代市是神奧最古老的城市。聽說那裡的雕像比城市本身還要古老。","Sharon":"莎倫","Going to Eterna? Then test your team on mine first!":"要去百代市？那先拿我的隊伍試試你的吧！","Your team passed the test.":"你的隊伍通過考驗了。","Gardenia, the Eterna Gym Leader, sometimes walks in the forest to talk to the trees.":"百代道館的館主菜種有時會到森林裡散步，和樹木說話。","Rocks fell on the path to Mt. Coronet. Nobody gets through until they are cleared!":"通往天冠山的路上落石了。清理完之前誰也過不去！","Cycling Road is closed for repairs. Come back when it is finished!":"自行車道正在維修，暫時關閉。修好了再來吧！","This is the Team Galactic Eterna Building. Members only. Scram, kid!":"這裡是銀河隊百代大樓。只准成員進入。快滾，小鬼！","Gardenia's Gym is full of plants. Some days you cannot even see the Trainers for the leaves!":"菜種的道館裡到處都是植物。有時候葉子多到連訓練家都看不見！","Eterna is a city of old things: old stories, old trees, and a statue nobody can date.":"百代市是座充滿古老事物的城市：古老的傳說、古老的樹木，還有一座沒人知道年代的雕像。","Grass types can put you to sleep or paralyze you with their powders. Bring Awakenings and Paralyze Heals!":"草屬性寶可夢會用粉末讓你睡著或麻痺。多帶些解眠藥和解麻藥！","The statue in the square? My grandmother said it shows a Pokémon that rules over time itself. Who knows!":"廣場上的雕像？我奶奶說，那是一隻掌管時間的寶可夢。誰知道呢！","Jenna":"珍娜","Breathe in. Smell that? That is the scent of your defeat!":"深呼吸。聞到了嗎？那是你失敗的味道！","My perfume did not work...":"我的香水不管用……","Gardenia says every plant has its own scent, and every Pokémon its own strength.":"菜種說，每株植物都有自己的香氣，每隻寶可夢都有自己的力量。","This Gym is like a jungle! I love it here.":"這個道館就像叢林一樣！我好喜歡。","Lost in the jungle...":"在叢林裡迷路了……","Fire burns, Flying pecks, Bug bites: Grass types have lots of weak spots!":"火會燒、飛行會啄、蟲會咬：草屬性的弱點可多了！","Angela":"安琪拉","My Roselia's roses are lovely, but they have thorns!":"我的毒薔薇的玫瑰很漂亮，但是有刺哦！","Pricked by my own thorns.":"被自己的刺扎到了。","Gardenia's Roserade is the most elegant Pokémon I have ever seen.":"菜種的羅絲雷朵是我見過最優雅的寶可夢。","Mariah":"瑪麗亞","Gardenia is right behind me. You will not reach her!":"菜種就在我後面。你別想過去！","Go on, then. She is waiting.":"去吧。她在等你。","Gardenia's Turtwig is so cute. Do not let that fool you!":"菜種的草苗龜超可愛的。可別被牠騙了！","Welcome to the Eterna Gym! I am Gardenia, the Gym Leader, and I just love Grass-type Pokémon. A Champion of three regions? My Grass Pokémon will not wilt for anybody!":"歡迎來到百代道館！我是館主菜種，最喜歡草屬性的寶可夢了。三個地區的冠軍？我的草屬性寶可夢可不會為任何人枯萎！","Amazing... You made my garden bloom in a whole new way!":"太厲害了……你讓我的花園以全新的方式綻放了！","Route 205. East: Eterna City. West: Eterna Forest.":"205號道路。東：百代市　西：百代森林","An ancient statue of a Pokémon. The plaque says it stood here long before the city, and that it shows a Pokémon from the oldest stories of Sinnoh.":"一座古老的寶可夢雕像。銘牌上寫著，它早在城市建成之前就在這裡了，雕的是神奧最古老的傳說中的寶可夢。","Team Galactic grabbed my Clefairy right out of my shop and took it into that building!":"銀河隊從我店裡搶走了我的皮皮，帶進那棟大樓裡了！","I cannot fight them on my own. Please, help my Clefairy!":"我一個人對付不了他們。求求你，救救我的皮皮！","Oh, {player}! Team Galactic took the cycle shop owner's Clefairy into their building.":"啊，{player}！銀河隊把自行車店老闆的皮皮帶進他們的大樓了。","You beat me, so I know you are strong. Go on in! I will stay out here and make sure none of them sneak away.":"你打敗過我，我知道你很強。進去吧！我會守在外面，不讓他們任何人溜走。","Cycle Shop Owner":"自行車店老闆","The Trainers here like to battle two at a time. If they do, Chansey and I will battle beside you!":"這裡的訓練家喜歡兩個人一起對戰。真遇上了，我和吉利蛋會在你身邊一起戰鬥！","Stay close! If Trainers come at us two at a time, Chansey and I will battle beside you.":"別走散了！要是訓練家兩個人一起過來，我和吉利蛋會在你身邊一起戰鬥。","Phillip & Donald":"菲利普和唐納德","We are bug hunting in pairs today. Want to see what we caught?":"今天我們兩個人一起抓蟲子。想看看我們抓到了什麼嗎？","Our bugs got squashed...":"我們的蟲子被打扁了……","Jack & Briana":"傑克和布麗安娜","The forest is our bug paradise! Two of you? Then two of us!":"森林是我們的蟲子天堂！你們有兩個人？那我們也兩個！","My collection got squashed, and her Pachirisu too...":"我的收藏被打扁了，她的帕奇利茲也是……","Pachirisu are not bugs, but Briana says it can come along anyway.":"帕奇利茲不是蟲子，不過布麗安娜說牠也可以一起來。","Kody & Rachael":"柯迪和瑞秋","We saw the two of you coming in a dream. In the dream, we won!":"我們在夢裡看到你們兩個來了。在夢裡，是我們贏了！","The dream was wrong...":"夢是假的……","The old house deep in the forest? Even we cannot see what waits inside.":"森林深處的那棟舊房子？連我們也看不見裡面有什麼。","Lindsey & Elijah":"琳賽和以利亞","We sensed you coming from far away. We also sense that you will lose!":"我們老遠就感應到你們來了。我們還感應到你們會輸！","Our senses failed us...":"我們的感應失靈了……","Please take this as a token of my thanks. A Pokémon wearing it grows fond of you faster.":"請收下這個，當作我的謝禮。帶著它的寶可夢會更快和你親近。","The Battle Factory. Rental Pokémon, at level 50 or the Open Level.":"對戰工廠。租借寶可夢，可選 50 級或開放級別。","Every rental in this building has a weakness. I know all of them. Do you?":"這棟樓裡的每隻租借寶可夢都有弱點。我全都知道。你呢？","A team you have never trained, against a team you have never seen. That is the Factory!":"用從沒訓練過的隊伍，對抗從沒見過的隊伍。這就是工廠！","I spent all night reading the rental list. Let us see if it pays off.":"我整晚都在讀租借名單。看看有沒有用吧。","Choose well, battle better!":"選得好，打得更好！","You used them better than I would have...":"你用得比我還好……","I chose the wrong three. Again.":"我又選錯三隻了。","Not bad! Want to trade one of mine?":"不錯嘛！要不要換一隻我的？","Rentals, but no luck at all on my side.":"都是租來的，可運氣一點也不站在我這邊。","Twenty wins with rentals? Then you can read a Pokémon at a glance. I am Thorton, the Factory Head. I can too. Let us compare!":"用租借寶可夢連贏二十場？那你一眼就能看透寶可夢。我是工廠頭目捩木。我也能。來比比看吧！","You again! I have run every number since our last battle. This time the odds are mine.":"又是你！上次對戰後我把所有數字都算了一遍。這次勝算在我這邊。","Hm. Your choices beat my calculations. Take this, you earned it.":"嗯。你的選擇勝過了我的計算。拿去吧，這是你應得的。","Unbelievable... No table I made predicted that. You are the real deal.":"難以置信……我做的表格沒有一張預料到這個。你是貨真價實的高手。","Here, you battle with rented Pokémon. Out of the six we offer, choose three, for single and for double battles alike.":"這裡用租借寶可夢對戰。我們提供六隻，單打和雙打都從中選三隻。","At level 50, every Pokémon battles at level 50. At the Open Level, every Pokémon battles at level 100.":"50 級時，所有寶可夢都以 50 級對戰。開放級別時，所有寶可夢都以 100 級對戰。","Which level will you challenge?":"要挑戰哪個級別？","Thorton recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Silver Print!":"捩木認可了你的知識。你得到了銀色印記！","Thorton recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Gold Print!":"捩木認可了你的知識。你得到了金色印記！","Nobody here battles with their own Pokémon. Read the moves and the held item of each rental before you choose.":"這裡沒有人用自己的寶可夢對戰。選之前，先看清每隻租借寶可夢的招式和攜帶道具。","The Factory Head, Thorton, battles Trainers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row. He knows every rental by heart.":"工廠頭目捩木會和單打連勝到第 21 場和第 49 場的訓練家對戰。他把每隻租借寶可夢都記得清清楚楚。","At the Open Level, everything battles at level 100. Only this Factory offers that.":"開放級別時，全都以 100 級對戰。只有這座工廠有這種玩法。","A notebook lies open on the desk: \"What the first Pokémon in your party does outside battle.\"":"桌上攤著一本筆記本：《隊伍裡第一隻寶可夢在對戰以外的作用》。","\"{a} and {b}: more wild Pokémon. {c} and {d}: fewer. {e} in a sandstorm and {f} in the snow: fewer too.\"":"“{a}和{b}：野生寶可夢變多。{c}和{d}：變少。{e}在沙暴中、{f}在下雪時：也會變少。”","\"{a} and {b}: wild Pokémon much weaker than it often run off. {c}, {d} and {e}: wild Pokémon at their strongest more often.\"":"“{a}和{b}：比牠弱很多的野生寶可夢常常會逃走。{c}、{d}和{e}：更常遇到等級最高的野生寶可夢。”","\"{a}: more Steel types. {b}: more Electric types. {c}: often the same nature as it. {d}: often the other gender.\"":"“{a}：鋼屬性的變多。{b}：電屬性的變多。{c}：常常和牠同樣性格。{d}：常常是異性。”","\"{a} and {b} sometimes find something after a battle won. With {c} or {d} in the party, Eggs hatch twice as fast.\"":"“{a}和{b}在贏得對戰後有時會撿到東西。隊伍裡有{c}或{d}時，蛋孵化的速度加倍。”","A textbook lies on the desk: \"Walking with a Partner.\"":"書桌上放著一本教科書：《和夥伴同行》。","\"When someone walks with you through tall grass or a cave, wild Pokémon often come out two at a time. You and your partner battle them together.\"":"「有人和你一起走在草叢或洞窟裡時，野生寶可夢常常會兩隻一起出現。你和夥伴要一起對付牠們。」","\"A Poké Ball cannot be aimed while two wild Pokémon are out. Knock one out first, then throw at the other.\"":"「兩隻野生寶可夢都在的時候，精靈球是瞄不準的。先打倒一隻，再對另一隻丟球。」","\"On the water, your partner still battles beside you, though only one wild Pokémon comes at a time.\"":"「在水上，夥伴也會在你身邊一起戰鬥，只是野生寶可夢一次只來一隻。」","Come on, old man! Hand over all your Honey. Team Galactic needs it!":"快點，老頭！把你的甜甜蜜全交出來。銀河隊要用！","{player}! Help! These people want every jar of Honey I have!":"{player}！救命！這些人要把我的甜甜蜜全部搶走！","Who is this, a Trainer? Get lost, kid! ...No? Then you can battle us both, one after the other!":"這是誰，訓練家嗎？滾開，小鬼！……不走？那就一個接一個跟我們兩個打吧！","This kid is too strong! Back to the windworks, quick!":"這小鬼太強了！快回發電廠！","In their hurry, the grunts dropped a key. It is the key to the Valley Windworks!":"手下們慌忙之中掉了一把鑰匙。是山谷發電廠的鑰匙！","Thank you! They wanted my Honey to lure Pokémon. And they were talking about the windworks, south-east of town across Route 205.":"謝謝你！他們想用我的甜甜蜜來引誘寶可夢。他們還提到了發電廠，就在鎮子東南邊，穿過205號道路就到。","Pokémon love sweet Honey. Spread some on a tree and they come from all around!":"寶可夢最愛甜甜蜜了。把它塗在樹上，寶可夢就會從四面八方聚過來！","Please, help me! Those two will not leave me alone!":"求求你，幫幫我！那兩個人一直纏著我！","My dad came home from the windworks! He says a Trainer chased the bad people away. Was it you? Thank you!":"爸爸從發電廠回來了！他說有個訓練家把壞人趕走了。是你嗎？謝謝你！","My dad works at the Valley Windworks. People in strange space suits took it over, and now he cannot come home...":"我爸爸在山谷發電廠工作。一群穿著奇怪太空服的人佔領了那裡，爸爸回不了家……","I saw some of them in Floaroma Meadow, north of town, too.":"我在鎮子北邊的苑之鎮花田也看到了他們的人。","An Oran Berry heals a Pokémon a little when its HP runs low. Let your Pokémon hold one!":"橙橙果能在寶可夢HP變少時幫牠回復一點。讓你的寶可夢帶一顆吧！","Welcome to our flower shop! We grow Berries as well as flowers.":"歡迎光臨我們的花店！我們除了花，也種樹果。","A Trainer passing through? Then take these, with our compliments.":"路過的訓練家？那這些送給你吧。","The door is locked. A Team Galactic sign says: \"Keep out!\"":"門鎖著。銀河隊的告示寫著：「禁止進入！」","Thank you! I am going home to my daughter in Floaroma. She must be so worried.":"謝謝你！我要回苑之鎮見我女兒了。她一定擔心壞了。","Help! Those people in strange suits locked me in. They want the windworks' power for something.":"救命！那些穿著奇怪衣服的人把我關在這裡。他們想拿發電廠的電力去做什麼事。","Hmph. So you are the real thing. Fine: we got the readings we came for anyway.":"哼。看來你是真有本事。算了，反正我們要的數據已經到手了。","Team Galactic is going to make a brand-new world, and nobody will get in our way. Bye-bye!":"銀河隊要創造一個全新的世界，誰也別想阻撓我們。拜拜！","Team Galactic left the Valley Windworks.":"銀河隊離開了山谷發電廠。","A Drifloon is drifting by the windworks, riding the valley wind...":"一隻飄飄球乘著山谷的風，飄到了發電廠旁邊……","Honey Seller":"賣甜甜蜜的人","Sarah":"莎拉","The road north was blocked for days. Now that it is open, I want a battle!":"北邊的路封了好幾天。現在通了，我要來場對戰！","I waited all that time for this?":"我等了這麼久就為了這個？","Past the cave is Floaroma Town. It smells of flowers all year round.":"穿過洞窟就是苑之鎮。那裡一年到頭都飄著花香。","My Wurmple might become a Beautifly or a Dustox. Help it grow!":"我的刺尾蟲可能會變成狩獵鳳蝶，也可能變成毒粉蛾。幫牠成長吧！","It grew a little, I think.":"牠好像長大了一點。","Nobody knows which one a Wurmple will become. That is the fun of it!":"誰也不知道刺尾蟲會變成哪一種。這才有意思嘛！","This tunnel was dug to carry flowers from Floaroma to the city. Now it is mostly Zubat.":"這條隧道原本是為了把苑之鎮的花運到城裡而挖的。現在裡面幾乎全是超音蝠。","Liv & Liz":"麗芙和麗茲","We are twins, and so are our Pachirisu! Two against two!":"我們是雙胞胎，我們的帕奇利茲也是！二對二！","Two of us, and we still lost...":"我們有兩個人，還是輸了……","In a double battle, pick a move that hits both foes at once. We learned that the hard way.":"雙打對戰時，要選能同時攻擊兩個對手的招式。我們是吃了苦頭才學會的。","I am camping by the flowers tonight. First, a battle!":"今晚我要在花叢邊露營。先來場對戰吧！","Time to pitch my tent...":"該搭帳篷了……","Budew close up at night and open again in the morning sun.":"含羞苞晚上會閉起來，早上曬到太陽又會張開。","North of town is Floaroma Meadow, where the man who sells Honey keeps his flowers.":"鎮子北邊是苑之鎮花田，賣甜甜蜜的人在那裡種花。","The flowers here bloom all year. Grandpa says it is because the people who live here care for them so much.":"這裡的花一年四季都開。爺爺說，那是因為住在這裡的人都很用心照顧它們。","East of town, Route 205 crosses the river. Its south side leads to the Valley Windworks.":"鎮子東邊的205號道路跨過一條河。往南走就是山谷發電廠。","Eterna Forest is long and dark. Take plenty of Potions, dear.":"百代森林又長又暗。多帶些傷藥吧，孩子。","Berries grow on plants, too. Here we grow them for Trainers and their Pokémon.":"樹果也是植物結的。我們在這裡為訓練家和他們的寶可夢種樹果。","Long ago this land was all bare rock. One person planted a single flower, and Floaroma grew from it.":"很久以前，這片土地全是光禿禿的岩石。有人種下了一朵花，苑之鎮就從那裡開始了。","Erick":"艾瑞克","Shh! You will scare the fish! ...Oh well, they are gone. Battle me instead!":"噓！你會把魚嚇跑的！……算了，已經跑了。那就和我對戰吧！","Even the Magikarp swam away...":"連鯉魚王都游走了……","The Shellos in this river are pink. In the east of Sinnoh they are blue, they say.":"這條河裡的無殼海兔是粉紅色的。聽說在神奧東部是藍色的。","I hiked here all the way from Oreburgh. My legs are tired, but my Pokémon are not!":"我從黑金市一路走到這裡。我的腿累了，但我的寶可夢可不累！","Now my Pokémon are tired too.":"現在我的寶可夢也累了。","The windworks to the south makes power from the wind that blows down the valley.":"南邊的發電廠利用順著山谷吹下來的風發電。","Siena":"西耶娜","A picnic by the river, and then a battle. Perfect day!":"在河邊野餐，再來場對戰。完美的一天！","Well, the picnic was nice.":"嗯，野餐還是挺開心的。","People say Eterna Forest is full of Trainers. Be careful in there.":"聽說百代森林裡有很多訓練家。進去要小心哦。","This windworks belongs to Team Galactic now. Go home, kid!":"這座發電廠現在歸銀河隊了。回家去吧，小鬼！","Hey! That was not supposed to happen!":"喂！怎麼會這樣！","Even if you get in, the Commander will deal with you.":"就算你進去了，幹部也會收拾你的。","An intruder? The Commander will not be happy. I will stop you right here!":"有入侵者？幹部會不高興的。我就在這裡攔住你！","I am going to be in so much trouble...":"我要倒大楣了……","Commander Mars is not someone you want to make angry.":"最好別惹夥星幹部生氣。","Huh? A kid made it all the way in here? I am Mars, one of Team Galactic's Commanders. We are borrowing this place's power for a little project. Want to stop me? Go ahead and try!":"咦？居然有小鬼闖到這裡來了？我是銀河隊的幹部夥星。我們正借用這裡的電力做個小計畫。想阻止我？那就試試看吧！","Ugh! I lost to a kid?":"可惡！我居然輸給了小鬼？","Route 204. North: the Ravaged Path and Floaroma Town. South: Jubilife City.":"204號道路。北：荒蕪小路、苑之鎮　南：祝慶市","Route 204. North: Floaroma Town. South: the Ravaged Path.":"204號道路。北：苑之鎮　南：荒蕪小路","Floaroma Town. A town of flowers, where the air always smells sweet.":"苑之鎮。花之小鎮，空氣中總是飄著甜美的香氣。","Floaroma Meadow. Please do not pick the flowers.":"苑之鎮花田。請勿摘花。","Route 205. North: Eterna Forest. South: the Valley Windworks. West: Floaroma Town.":"205號道路。北：百代森林　南：山谷發電廠　西：苑之鎮","Valley Windworks. The wind of the valley turns into power for all of Sinnoh.":"山谷發電廠。將山谷的風化為電力，送往整個神奧。","Or use it right where you stand, in tall grass or a cave. Wild Pokémon will come out at once!":"或者就在你站的地方用，在草叢或洞窟裡，野生寶可夢馬上就會出來！","The Battle Frontier. The Battle Tower is open: the other facilities follow soon.":"對戰開拓區。對戰塔已經開放，其他設施也會陸續開放。","This tower is the top of Sinnoh. Every Trainer here came to win. So did I.":"這座塔是神奧的頂點。來這裡的訓練家都是為了贏。我也一樣。","Twenty-one battles, forty-nine... the number means nothing until you win the next one.":"二十一場、四十九場……在贏下一場之前，數字都沒有意義。","Show me the bond you built on your way up!":"讓我看看你一路爬上來建立的羈絆吧！","I have watched your streak from the stands. Now I want to see it up close.":"我在看台上看著你一路連勝。現在我想近距離看看。","No more warm-ups. Let us battle!":"熱身結束了。來對戰吧！","Ha! Not bad at all.":"哈！很不錯嘛。","That stung. Keep climbing.":"真痛啊。繼續往上爬吧。","Your team clearly trusts you.":"你的隊伍顯然很信任你。","I lost, but what a battle!":"我輸了，不過真是一場好對戰！","All right, you earned that one.":"好吧，這場是你應得的。","So you are the one who has won twenty in a row! I am Palmer, the Tower Tycoon. My son never stops talking about you. Now show me why!":"原來連贏二十場的就是你！我是塔主桄榔。我兒子成天都在說你的事。讓我看看為什麼吧！","Forty-eight wins! I have been waiting for you. This time I bring my strongest team. Hold nothing back!":"四十八連勝！我一直在等你。這次我帶來了最強的隊伍。拿出全力吧！","Ha ha! What a battle! I can see why my son calls you his rival.":"哈哈！真是一場好對戰！我明白為什麼我兒子說你是他的勁敵了。","Wonderful! I have nothing left to show you. You are the true master of this tower!":"太精彩了！我已經沒有什麼能教你的了。你才是這座塔真正的主人！","The Tower Tycoon has come to battle you himself!":"塔主親自來和你對戰了！","Palmer recognizes your strength. You earned the Silver Print!":"桄榔認可了你的實力。你得到了銀色印記！","Palmer recognizes your strength. You earned the Gold Print!":"桄榔認可了你的實力。你得到了金色印記！","Your Pokémon received the {ribbon}!":"你的寶可夢得到了{ribbon}！","Fifty double battles in a row! Your Pokémon received the {ribbon}!":"雙打五十連勝！你的寶可夢得到了{ribbon}！","The Tower Tycoon, Palmer, battles challengers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row.":"塔主桄榔會和單打連勝到第 21 場和第 49 場的挑戰者對戰。","Beat him and you earn a Print, and your Pokémon earn a ribbon. Fifty double battles in a row earn a ribbon too.":"打敗他就能得到印記，你的寶可夢也會得到獎章。雙打五十連勝也能得到獎章。","Silver Print: {s}. Gold Print: {g}. Battle Points: {n}.":"銀色印記：{s}。金色印記：{g}。對戰點數：{n}。","Welcome to the Training Stall! Vitamins and held items, for Battle Points.":"歡迎光臨訓練攤位！營養飲料和攜帶道具，都用對戰點數兌換。","Welcome to the Move Stall! Our TMs teach the moves the Battle Frontier's best Trainers use.":"歡迎光臨招式攤位！我們的招式學習器能教會對戰開拓區高手們愛用的招式。","They say the Tower Tycoon is the father of a boy from Twinleaf Town. He waits at the top for anyone who wins twenty in a row.":"聽說塔主是雙葉鎮某個男孩的父親。他在塔頂等著連贏二十場的人。","Battle Points from the Tower can be spent at the Battle Shops. I want a Scope Lens!":"對戰塔的對戰點數可以在對戰商店用掉。我想要焦點鏡！","The Battle Shops. Battle Points for items and TMs.":"對戰商店。用對戰點數兌換道具和招式學習器。","In multi battles, a Trainer you have traveled with battles beside you. Fifty wins in a row earn a ribbon as well.":"組隊對戰中，旅途上同行過的訓練家會和你並肩作戰。連贏五十場也能獲得獎章。","Welcome to the Battle Frontier! Five facilities wait for the strongest Trainers.":"歡迎來到對戰開拓區！五個設施等待著最強的訓練家。","All five facilities are open at last. I hope I am still young enough to battle in every one of them.":"五個設施終於都開放了。希望我還打得動，每一個都去挑戰看看。","The Battle Tower. Single, double and multi battles, seven in a row, for Battle Points.":"對戰塔。單打、雙打與組隊對戰，連贏七場，就能獲得對戰點數。","Ho! A visitor who rode my belts all the way here! I am Fuego, and this is my ironworks.":"哈！居然有人坐著我的傳送帶一路來到這裡！我是多多羅，這裡是我的鋼鐵廠。","Anyone who makes it this far gets a present. Here: a stone with a fire burning inside it.":"能走到這裡的人都有禮物。來，這是一塊裡面燃著火焰的石頭。","Some Pokémon change when they touch it. Find out which!":"有些寶可夢碰到它就會起變化。去找找看是哪些吧！","Fire and iron, that is all I need. Well, and my belts.":"火和鐵，我就只需要這兩樣。噢，還有我的傳送帶。","Dillan":"迪倫","No visitors on the factory floor! Unless they can battle!":"工廠車間不准外人進來！除非你會對戰！","Back to the furnace for me.":"我還是回熔爐那邊去吧。","Mind the belts. They do not stop for anyone.":"小心傳送帶。它們可不會為誰停下來。","Holden":"霍爾頓","These Magnemite keep the machines running. Want to feel the current?":"這些小磁怪讓機器一直運轉。想嚐嚐電流的滋味嗎？","Magnemite stick to the iron here. Sometimes I have to peel them off.":"小磁怪老是吸在這裡的鐵上。有時候我得把牠們一隻隻剝下來。","Conrad":"康拉德","Magmar keeps the furnace hot. Let us see if you can take the heat!":"鴨嘴火獸讓熔爐一直保持火熱。看看你受不受得了這股熱氣！","You cooled us right down.":"你一下子就讓我們冷靜下來了。","Mr. Fuego says the hottest iron makes the best steel. I think he means people too.":"多多羅先生說，燒得最熱的鐵才能煉出最好的鋼。我覺得他說的也是人。","Fuego Ironworks. Iron goes in, wonders come out!":"多多羅鋼鐵廠。送進去的是鐵，造出來的是奇蹟！","In the pale light of the clearing, {mon} turns and looks at you. Its wings shimmer like thin clouds.":"在林間空地淡淡的光裡，{mon}轉過身來看著你。牠的翅膀像薄薄的雲一樣閃著微光。","{mon} gave a clear cry and rose into the sky!":"{mon}發出一聲清亮的鳴叫，飛上了天空！","Something glows softly where {mon} was standing...":"{mon}剛才站著的地方，有什麼東西在微微發光……","Shall we head back to Canalave?":"我們回水脈市吧？","Take your time. I will wait here with the boat.":"慢慢來。我在這裡守著船等你。","Fullmoon Island. They say a Pokémon that brings good dreams rests in the wood on nights of the full moon.":"滿月島。傳說有一隻帶來美夢的寶可夢，會在滿月之夜於林中歇息。","You! You are the kid who keeps turning up at the lakes!":"是你！就是你老在湖邊冒出來！","There is nothing here for you! And I have never heard of any storage key, so do not ask me about it!":"這裡沒你的事！我也從沒聽說過什麼倉庫鑰匙，別問我！","I just remembered something I have to do. Somewhere else. Far from here!":"我突然想起有件事要辦。在別的地方。離這裡很遠的地方！","The grunt ran off, and a stranger in a long coat stepped up from nowhere and picked something off the ground.":"手下逃走了。一個穿長風衣的陌生人不知從哪裡冒出來，從地上撿起了什麼東西。","Aha! He has dropped the very thing I was after. A most fortunate accident.":"啊哈！他掉的正是我要找的東西。真是幸運的意外。","Forgive me, I should introduce myself. They call me Looker, of the International Police. Do not tell anyone.":"失禮了，我該先自我介紹。大家叫我帥哥，是國際警察。別告訴任何人。","This key opens their warehouse in the north-east of the city, and the warehouse is the back way into this building.":"這把鑰匙能打開他們在城市東北邊的倉庫，而倉庫就是這棟大樓的後門。","The three Pokémon from the lakes must be somewhere inside. It is too much for one detective.":"三隻湖裡的寶可夢一定就在裡面。這件事我一個偵探應付不來。","Will you come in with me?":"你願意和我一起進去嗎？","I understand. It is a great deal to ask. But those Pokémon cannot wait for long.":"我明白，這個請求確實不小。但那些寶可夢等不了太久。","Splendid! I will meet you at the warehouse. Walk casually, and try not to look like a detective.":"太好了！我們在倉庫見。走路自然一點，別讓人看出你像個偵探。","There you are. Excellent timing. Allow me.":"你來了。時機正好。交給我吧。","Looker used the storage key. The door slid open!":"帥哥用了倉庫鑰匙。門滑開了！","The stairs beyond go down to the basement, and from there the way runs under the city to their building.":"那邊的樓梯通往地下室，從那裡可以穿過城市地下，走到他們的大樓。","Look out for the panels on the floor down there, and for a key to the doors of the building. I will search the rooms up here.":"下面地板上有傳送板，要留意。還要找到打開大樓各扇門的鑰匙。我來搜查上面這些房間。","Friends. Look at the world outside these walls. It is unfinished and weak, and it is ruled by feelings.":"各位。看看這些牆外面的世界吧。它殘缺、軟弱，被感情所支配。","Soon the power of time and space will be in our hands. With it we will make a new world, and each of you will have your place there.":"時間和空間的力量很快就會落入我們手中。我們將用它創造新的世界，你們每個人在那裡都會有一席之地。","Long live Team Galactic!":"銀河隊萬歲！","The day is close. Go back to your posts.":"那一天不遠了。回到各自的崗位去吧。","Cyrus and the grunts left the meeting room.":"赤日和手下們離開了會議室。","The console has gone dark. There is nothing more it can do.":"控制台已經暗了下來，什麼也做不了了。","There is a large red switch on the console. Press it?":"控制台上有一個紅色的大開關。要按下去嗎？","The glass tanks slid open!":"玻璃艙滑開了！","{uxie}, {mesprit} and {azelf} shot out of their tanks, circled the room once and were gone, each to its own lake.":"{uxie}、{mesprit}和{azelf}衝出玻璃艙，在房間裡繞了一圈，便各自飛回了自己的湖。","So they go home. It changes nothing. The boss has the Red Chain, and that was all he ever wanted from them.":"牠們回家了啊。這改變不了什麼。首領已經拿到紅色鎖鏈，他要的就只有這個。","He has gone up Mt. Coronet to call the two he really wants. If he can truly make a new world, I wonder who will be left in it.":"他上天冠山去召喚他真正想要的那兩隻了。如果他真能創造新世界，不知道那裡還會剩下誰。","{player}! Three Pokémon just flew straight through the wall past my ear! You did it!":"{player}！剛才有三隻寶可夢穿牆而過，從我耳邊飛走了！你成功了！","I will take care of what is left of this building. But Cyrus has gone to Mt. Coronet, and I do not think the International Police can climb that high.":"這棟大樓剩下的事交給我。不過赤日去了天冠山，國際警察恐怕爬不了那麼高。","Rest, and get ready. I have a feeling this is not over.":"好好休息，做好準備。我有預感，事情還沒有結束。","The warp panel is switched off. Nothing happens.":"傳送板沒有啟動。什麼也沒發生。","What I needed from the lake Pokémon is already mine: the Red Chain. The three of them are of no more use to me.":"我需要從湖之寶可夢身上得到的東西已經到手了：紅色鎖鏈。那三隻對我已經沒有用處。","Take this. It is a ball that never fails. There will be no need for it in my world.":"拿去吧。這是絕不會失手的球。在我的世界裡用不上它。","If you want those three, they are in the laboratory, through the warp panel in this room. Saturn is there. I am leaving for Mt. Coronet.":"你要找那三隻的話，牠們在實驗室，從這個房間的傳送板過去。鎮星在那裡。我要去天冠山了。","Cyrus left the room. The warp panel began to hum.":"赤日離開了房間。傳送板嗡嗡地響了起來。","Enough. The machine has done its work, so it no longer matters who touches it.":"夠了。機器的任務已經完成，誰碰它都無所謂了。","The switch is on the console, behind me. Do as you like.":"開關在我身後的控制台上。隨你的便吧。","This basement is off limits! How did you even get down here?":"這個地下室禁止入內！你到底是怎麼下來的？","That door was supposed to stay locked!":"那扇門本來應該一直鎖著的！","The panels on the floor are how we get around down here. Just step on one.":"這裡靠地上的傳送板走動。踩上去就行了。","Somebody left a key lying around down here. I am guarding it until they remember where it was!":"有人把鑰匙忘在這裡了。在他想起來之前，由我看守！","Guarding things is harder than it looks.":"看守東西比想像中難多了。","That key opens every locked door in the building. Do not tell anyone I told you.":"那把鑰匙能打開大樓裡所有上鎖的門。別說是我告訴你的。","You came in the back way? Nobody comes in the back way!":"你從後門進來的？根本沒人走後門！","From now on I will watch the back way.":"從今以後我要盯緊後門。","The stairs are right over there. Not that it will do you any good.":"樓梯就在那邊。不過對你也沒什麼用。","Fredrick":"弗雷德里克","An intruder! Good. Let me record how quickly you lose.":"有入侵者！正好。讓我記錄一下你輸得有多快。","The result does not match my prediction...":"結果和我的預測不符……","We drew something remarkable out of the three lake Pokémon: a chain, as red as a warning light. The boss has plans for it.":"我們從三隻湖之寶可夢身上提取出了了不起的東西：一條紅得像警示燈的鎖鏈。首領自有打算。","Members only on this floor. Do you have a card? I did not think so!":"這層只有成員才能進。你有會員卡嗎？我就知道沒有！","I should have asked for the card first.":"我應該先查卡的。","There is a lock on that door. If you have the key, it is no business of mine.":"那扇門上了鎖。你要是有鑰匙，就不關我的事了。","The boss is giving a speech today, and I will not miss it because of you!":"今天首領要演講，我可不能因為你錯過！","Now I am going to be late.":"這下要遲到了。","Step on that panel and you will come out on the far side of the wall.":"踩上那塊傳送板，就會到牆的另一邊。","You used the panel? Those are for staff!":"你用了傳送板？那是員工專用的！","I will be writing a very angry report.":"我要寫一份非常生氣的報告。","Everyone is gathering upstairs. You could go and listen, I suppose.":"大家都在樓上集合。你想聽的話，大概也能去聽聽。","The world as it is cannot be mended.":"這個世界已經無法修補了。","Quiet! The boss is speaking!":"安靜！首領在講話！","The meeting is about to start, and you are not on the list!":"會議馬上要開始了，名單上沒有你！","You are still not on the list.":"名單上還是沒有你。","The boss always speaks in the room behind that door. You will want the key.":"首領總是在那扇門後面的房間講話。你得有鑰匙才行。","A new world is coming, and I am going to be in it!":"新世界就要來了，裡面一定有我的位置！","It will still come. You will see.":"它還是會來的。你等著瞧。","The boss promised us a place in the new world. All of us.":"首領答應過，新世界有我們的位置。我們所有人。","Nobody gets to the boss. Not while I am standing here!":"只要我站在這裡，誰也別想見到首領！","I am still standing, at least.":"至少我還站著。","The boss will not be as easy as me. I hope.":"首領可不會像我這麼好對付。但願如此。","Only one Pokémon, but it is a very smelly one!":"我只有一隻寶可夢，但牠臭得很！","I can still smell it on my uniform.":"我的制服上還留著那股味道。","The stairs by the statue go up to the boss's office.":"雕像旁邊的樓梯通往首領的辦公室。","So it is you again. You heard my speech, I suppose. It was a lie. There is no place for them in the new world, for it will hold one person alone: me. Spirit only spoils a world. Come, and I will show you what it is worth.":"又是你。我的演講你聽到了吧。那是謊言。新世界沒有他們的位置，因為那裡只會有一個人：我。心靈只會敗壞世界。來吧，讓我告訴你它究竟有多少價值。","I see. So it can still do that.":"原來如此。它竟然還能做到這種事。","Uxie floats in the glass tank with its eyes shut tight.":"由克希緊閉雙眼，漂浮在玻璃艙裡。","Mesprit floats in the glass tank. It looks very sad.":"艾姆利多漂浮在玻璃艙裡，看起來非常悲傷。","Azelf floats in the glass tank. It is not moving at all.":"亞克諾姆漂浮在玻璃艙裡，一動也不動。","The switch is over there. Go on. It no longer matters to us.":"開關就在那邊。去吧。這對我們已經無所謂了。","The boss sent you to me, did he? Then you beat him. I had a feeling you would. Still, I have my orders, and nobody passes this door.":"是首領讓你來找我的？那麼你贏了他。我早有預感。不過命令就是命令，誰也別想通過這扇門。","That makes it twice. I will not pretend to be surprised.":"這是第二次了。我也不必裝作吃驚。","A report is fixed to the base of the statue: \"Dialga, said to rule time. Palkia, said to rule space. The Red Chain can bind them both.\"":"雕像底座上貼著一份報告：「帝牙盧卡，傳說掌管時間。帕路奇亞，傳說掌管空間。紅色鎖鏈能將兩者束縛。」","Come back tomorrow. I will think of another level for you.":"明天再來吧。我會再想一個等級給你。","I collect sightings of Pokémon at just the right level. Today, show me a Pokémon at level {n}.":"我在收集剛好某個等級的寶可夢的目擊紀錄。今天，讓我看看 {n} 級的寶可夢吧。","Your {mon} is level {n}, exactly what I was looking for! Here, a little thank-you.":"你的{mon}是 {n} 級，正是我要找的！來，一點小小的謝禮。","Glasses change the way the world looks. And a Pokémon wearing them sees things differently too.":"眼鏡會改變世界看起來的樣子。戴著眼鏡的寶可夢，看事情的方式也會不一樣。","Choice Specs make special moves stronger, but the holder can only use the first move it picks.":"講究眼鏡能提高特殊招式的威力，但攜帶者只能使用一開始選的招式。","BlackGlasses make Dark-type moves stronger.":"黑色眼鏡能提高惡屬性招式的威力。","Wise Glasses make special moves a little stronger.":"博識眼鏡能稍微提高特殊招式的威力。","You have Combee of both kinds. You are a real bug expert!":"你有兩種三蜜蜂呢。你真是蟲子專家！","Did you know a Combee can be a boy or a girl? Show me both kinds in your party, and I will give you something good!":"你知道三蜜蜂分公的和母的嗎？讓我看看你隊伍裡兩種都有，我就送你好東西！","Not a single Combee with you? Look for them in the sweet-smelling trees.":"你身上一隻三蜜蜂都沒有？去那些甜甜香味的樹上找找吧。","That is a Combee, all right! Now show me one of the other kind too.":"這確實是三蜜蜂！現在也讓我看看另一種吧。","A boy Combee and a girl Combee! Amazing. This is for you: it makes a Pokémon grow strong from every battle.":"公的三蜜蜂和母的三蜜蜂！太厲害了。這個給你：它能讓寶可夢在每場對戰中變強。","A Pokémon holding the Exp. Share gets some of the Exp. Points without battling.":"攜帶學習裝置的寶可夢，不用出戰也能得到一部分經驗值。","I am one of Professor Rowan's aides. How many kinds of Pokémon have you seen? {n}, it says here.":"我是七灶博士的助手。你見過幾種寶可夢呢？這上面寫著 {n} 種。","Come back when you have seen at least 35 kinds. Then I will have something for you.":"等你見過至少 35 種再來吧。到時我有東西要給你。","That is plenty! The professor asked me to give you this.":"真不少！博士請我把這個交給你。","Some Pokémon evolve when traded holding a Metal Coat. Steel suits them.":"有些寶可夢攜帶金屬膜進行交換就會進化。鋼鐵很適合牠們。","Ah, the Trainer who helped Riley on this island. My apologies for leaving my Gym back then. Take this as thanks.":"啊，你就是在這座島上幫了亞玄的訓練家。那時我丟下道館不管，真是抱歉。收下這個當作謝禮吧。","Your Pokémon looks like it wants to go first. Let it hold this!":"你的寶可夢看起來很想搶先行動呢。讓牠帶著這個吧！","A Pokémon holding a Quick Claw sometimes moves first.":"攜帶先制之爪的寶可夢，有時會搶先行動。","I have something for your Pokémon. Here!":"我有東西要送給你的寶可夢。拿去吧！","A Shell Bell gives its holder back some HP each time it deals damage.":"貝殼之鈴會在攜帶者造成傷害時，回復一些 HP。","Please let one of your Pokémon wear this. It will be fond of you in no time.":"請讓你的寶可夢戴上這個。牠很快就會和你親近的。","A Pokémon with a Soothe Bell grows fond of you faster.":"戴著安撫之鈴的寶可夢，會更快和你親近。","Ace Trainer":"精英訓練家","The steel from this island goes all over Sinnoh. Byron works the mine himself, you know.":"這座島的鋼鐵會運到神奧各地。東瓜還親自在礦坑裡幹活呢。","The Battle Hall. One Pokémon, a type of your choice for every battle.":"對戰舞台。只帶一隻寶可夢，每場自選對手的屬性。","I specialize in exactly this type. You chose well... or very badly.":"我專攻的正是這個屬性。你選得好……或者選得很糟。","Every Pokémon here is a star. Mine is about to shine.":"在這裡每隻寶可夢都是明星。我的馬上就要發光了。","A one-on-one on this stage? Let the audience decide!":"在這個舞台上一對一？讓觀眾來評判吧！","Pick a type, pick a fight. You picked me!":"選了屬性，就選了對手。你選中了我！","The spotlight is yours.":"聚光燈是你的了。","Bravo... even if it hurts to say so.":"精彩……雖然說出來很不甘心。","That was a performance.":"這才叫表演。","Encore? Not for me, I am afraid.":"安可？恐怕輪不到我了。","Fifty wins with the same Pokémon! You and your partner make a fine pair. I am Argenta, the Hall Matron. Show me how it shines on my stage!":"用同一隻寶可夢連贏五十場！你們真是好搭檔。我是舞台名伶青葙。讓我看看牠在我的舞台上如何發光吧！","One hundred and seventy wins. You came back to my stage, and so did I. Let us give them a finale!":"一百七十連勝。你回到了我的舞台，我也是。讓我們獻上壓軸演出吧！","Splendid! I can see how much it trusts you.":"太出色了！看得出牠有多信任你。","A standing ovation! Nobody has ever performed like that on my stage.":"全場起立鼓掌！從來沒有人在我的舞台上有過這樣的表演。","Welcome to the Battle Hall! On this stage, one Pokémon takes on one opponent at a time.":"歡迎來到對戰舞台！在這個舞台上，一隻寶可夢每次對抗一個對手。","Before each battle, you choose the type of your opponent. Every type has ten ranks: each win raises it one, and a win at rank 10 closes it until every type is done.":"每場對戰前，你要選對手的屬性。每種屬性有十個等級：每贏一場升一級，在第 10 級獲勝後，這個屬性就會關閉，直到所有屬性都打完。","Enter one Pokémon of level 30 or more. Your opponents' levels follow its level and the ranks. A round is ten battles, and you cannot leave before the end.":"參加的寶可夢要 30 級以上。對手的等級會依牠的等級和各屬性的等級而定。一輪十場，中途不能離開。","Your streak belongs to the Pokémon you enter. Enter another, and it starts over.":"連勝紀錄屬於參加的那隻寶可夢。換別隻參加，就會從頭算起。","Wins in a row with {mon}: {n}.":"{mon}的連勝：{n} 場。","Below level 30":"未滿 30 級","Which Pokémon will take the stage?":"要讓哪隻寶可夢登上舞台？","Your streak belongs to {old}. With {mon}, it starts over. Is that all right?":"連勝紀錄屬於{old}。換成{mon}的話會從頭算起。這樣可以嗎？","Thank you. Please follow me to the stage.":"謝謝。請跟我到舞台上來。","Battle No. {n}. Which type will you face?":"第 {n} 場。要對戰哪個屬性？","{type} · Rank {r}":"{type} · 第 {r} 級","The Hall Matron has come to the stage herself!":"舞台名伶親自登台了！","Battle No. {n}! A {type}-type challenger takes the stage.":"第 {n} 場！{type}屬性的挑戰者登上舞台。","Argenta recognizes your bond. You earned the Silver Print!":"青葙認可了你們的羈絆。你得到了銀色印記！","Argenta recognizes your bond. You earned the Gold Print!":"青葙認可了你們的羈絆。你得到了金色印記！","Congratulations! You won ten battles in a row!":"恭喜！你連贏了十場！","{mon} was healed. On to battle No. {n}!":"{mon}恢復了。進入第 {n} 場！","The Hall Matron, Argenta, takes the stage against Trainers who reach the 50th and the 170th battle in a row.":"舞台名伶青葙會和連勝到第 50 場和第 170 場的訓練家對戰。","{mon}: {n} wins in a row. Ranks: {list}.":"{mon}：連勝 {n} 場。等級：{list}。","all at rank 1":"全部是第 1 級","The door to the stage. Challengers must register at the counter first.":"通往舞台的門。挑戰者要先在櫃檯報名。","...You there. Do you know where you are standing? This mountain is said to be where Sinnoh began.":"……你。知道自己站在什麼地方嗎？傳說這座山就是神奧開始的地方。","My name is Cyrus. I have been thinking about this world. The land, the people, even the heart: everything in it wears away. It is all incomplete.":"我叫赤日。我一直在思考這個世界。大地、人，甚至是心，一切都會磨損消逝。一切都不完整。","I intend to make a new world, one without that weakness. Remember my name. We will meet again.":"我要創造一個沒有這種軟弱的新世界。記住我的名字。我們會再見面的。","The man in the grey coat walked off into the dark of the mountain.":"穿灰色大衣的男人走進了山中的黑暗裡。","The next Gym is in Veilstone City, east past Route 209 and Solaceon Town. Its Leader, Maylene, uses Fighting types!":"下一個道館在帷幕市，往東經過209號道路和隨意鎮就到。那裡的館主阿李使用格鬥屬性！","Berries grow best with patience. Come back when you have planted some of your own!":"樹果要有耐心才長得好。等你自己種了樹果再來吧！","I am the Berry Master! I grow Berries of every kind behind this house.":"我是樹果名人！我在這房子後面種了各式各樣的樹果。","A traveling Trainer, eh? Take these. A Sitrus Berry heals a good deal of HP when a Pokémon needs it.":"旅行中的訓練家啊？收下這些吧。文柚果能在寶可夢需要時回復不少HP。","Hey, {player}! I crossed Mt. Coronet ahead of you. I bumped into a weird guy in a grey coat in there...":"喂，{player}！我比你先穿過天冠山了。我在裡面撞見一個穿灰大衣的怪人……","Anyway! Fantina's Ghost types are tough, so I am training first. Do not you dare beat her before me!":"總之！梅麗莎的幽靈屬性很難對付，我要先去訓練。你可別比我先贏她！","Hey, Champion! Fantina uses Ghost-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！梅麗莎使用幽靈屬性的寶可夢。","Ghost and Dark moves work great on them. Normal and Fighting moves pass right through them!":"幽靈和惡屬性的招式對牠們很有效。一般和格鬥屬性的招式會直接穿過去！","Bring a team! A Pokémon that knows Bite, like a Luxio, is a big help, and Awakenings for when they put you to sleep. Up to level 30, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"帶一支隊伍來！會咬住的寶可夢（比如勒克貓）很有幫助，也要帶解眠藥以防被催眠。30級以下的家鄉寶可夢在這裡會聽你的話。","This is the Relic Badge. Take it, with my compliments!":"這是遺跡徽章。請收下，以表我的敬意！","{player} received the Relic Badge from Fantina!":"{player}從梅麗莎那裡得到了遺跡徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 35 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，35級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算來自其他地區也一樣。","And this is for you: TM65, Shadow Claw. A slash from the shadows that often hits a weak spot!":"這個送給你：招式學習器65，暗影爪。從暗影中揮出的爪擊，容易擊中要害！","Berry Master":"樹果名人","Mt. Coronet is the heart of Sinnoh. Show me you have the heart to cross it!":"天冠山是神奧的心臟。讓我看看你有沒有穿越它的膽量！","You have plenty of heart.":"你膽量十足。","The mountain goes up and up, to a peak nobody I know has climbed.":"這座山一直往上延伸，山頂是我認識的人誰也沒爬上去過的。","I train by the mountain every day. Today I train on you!":"我每天都在山邊修行。今天就拿你來練練！","My training is not over.":"我的修行還沒結束。","Meditite meditate for hours. I can barely sit still for a minute.":"瑪沙那能冥想好幾個小時。我連一分鐘都坐不住。","I foresaw this battle. I did not foresee who would win, though.":"我預見了這場對戰。不過沒預見到誰會贏。","Now I see it clearly.":"現在我看清楚了。","Bronzor were found in ancient tombs. Some say they were made, not born.":"人們在古墓中發現了銅鏡怪。有人說牠們是被造出來的，而不是生出來的。","The Berry Master's flowers smell wonderful. Battle me while you breathe them in!":"樹果名人的花好香啊。一邊聞著花香一邊和我對戰吧！","Ah, I lost my breath.":"啊，我喘不過氣了。","Hearthome is just ahead. It is the city where people and Pokémon meet in friendship.":"家緣市就在前面。那是人與寶可夢以友誼相聚的城市。","The bridge on Route 209 is being repaired. You will have to wait a little!":"209號道路的橋正在維修。你得稍等一下了！","Route 212 is flooded after all this rain. Better wait until the water goes down.":"下了這麼多雨，212號道路淹水了。還是等水退了再說吧。","In Amity Square, people walk with their Pokémon. It is closed for gardening today, sadly.":"在友好廣場，大家會和寶可夢一起散步。可惜今天在整理花木，沒有開放。","Fantina, our Gym Leader, travelled the world before coming here. Her Ghost Pokémon are amazing!":"我們的道館館主梅麗莎在來這裡之前周遊過世界。她的幽靈寶可夢超厲害！","Normal and Fighting moves pass right through Ghost-type Pokémon. Bring something else to the Gym!":"一般和格鬥屬性的招式打不中幽靈屬性的寶可夢。去道館要帶別的招式！","Ghost types like to put you to sleep or confuse you. Awakenings are a must!":"幽靈屬性喜歡讓你睡著或混亂。解眠藥一定要帶！","Long ago, people from all over came to Hearthome to share what they had. That is how it got its name.":"很久以前，各地的人都會來家緣市分享自己擁有的東西。這就是它名字的由來。","The spirits whisper your name... and they are laughing!":"靈魂們在低語你的名字……還在笑呢！","The spirits went quiet.":"靈魂們安靜下來了。","Fantina says Ghost Pokémon are only scary if you do not understand them.":"梅麗莎說，幽靈寶可夢只有在你不了解牠們的時候才可怕。","Kendall":"肯德爾","I sense your fear. Or is it mine? Battle!":"我感覺到你的恐懼。還是我自己的？對戰吧！","It was mine.":"是我自己的。","Drifloon float toward children at dusk. Hold your balloons tight!":"傍晚時分，飄飄球會飄向小孩子。抓緊你的氣球！","Do you feel a chill? That is my Haunter, right behind you.":"感覺到一陣寒意了嗎？那是我的鬼斯通，就在你身後。","Even my Haunter has had enough.":"連我的鬼斯通都受夠了。","Haunter can slip through walls. Watch your back in here!":"鬼斯通能穿牆而過。在這裡要小心背後！","Desmond":"戴斯蒙","Fantina is right behind me, and you will not reach her!":"梅麗莎就在我後面，你別想過去！","Go on, then. She is waiting in the dark.":"去吧。她在黑暗中等你。","Fantina's Mismagius sings a song that can curse its foes. Be ready!":"梅麗莎的夢妖魔會唱出詛咒對手的歌。做好準備！","Welcome to the Hearthome Gym! I am Fantina, the Gym Leader. I came from far away to learn about Ghost Pokémon, and now I share them with you! A Champion of three regions? How wonderful. Let us dance!":"歡迎來到家緣道館！我是館主梅麗莎。我從很遠的地方來到這裡研究幽靈寶可夢，現在要和你分享牠們！三個地區的冠軍？太棒了。我們來跳支舞吧！","Ah, magnifique! You are truly strong, mon ami.":"啊，太精彩了！你真的很強，我的朋友。","Route 208. East: Hearthome City. West: Mt. Coronet.":"208號道路。東：家緣市　西：天冠山","Hearthome City. The warm-hearted city, where people and Pokémon come together.":"家緣市。溫暖人心的城市，人與寶可夢在此相聚。","Something is clinging to the tree, licking the Honey!":"有什麼東西攀在樹上舔著甜甜蜜！","The tree is sticky with Honey, but nothing has come yet. Check back in a while.":"樹上黏糊糊地沾著甜甜蜜，但還什麼都沒來。過一陣子再來看看吧。","A tree with a faint, sweet smell. Pokémon that love sweet things might gather here.":"一棵散發著淡淡甜香的樹。喜歡甜食的寶可夢也許會聚集過來。","Spread some Honey on the tree?":"要在樹上塗甜甜蜜嗎？","{player} spread Honey on the tree. Something might come to lick it in a few hours.":"{player}在樹上塗了甜甜蜜。過幾個小時也許會有什麼來舔。","Hello. I am Riley. I come here to train with my Lucario, but today Team Galactic is on the floors below, frightening the Pokémon.":"你好。我叫亞玄。我常和路卡利歐來這裡修行，但今天銀河隊在下面幾層嚇唬寶可夢。","Let us go down together. My Lucario can look after your team after each battle.":"我們一起下去吧。每場戰鬥後，我的路卡利歐可以照顧你的隊伍。","Riley will come along with you!":"亞玄和你一起走！","I have an Egg for you, but you are carrying six already. Hatch a few, and come back for it.":"我有一顆蛋要給你，但你身上已經有六顆了。等孵化幾顆再回來拿吧。","{player} received an Egg from Riley!":"{player}從亞玄那裡得到了一顆蛋！","Riolu will hatch from it. It can sense what you feel, so raise it with care.":"裡面會孵出利歐路。牠能感知你的心情，要好好養育牠。","We are getting out of here. There is plenty of steel elsewhere!":"我們撤了。別的地方還有的是鋼鐵！","That is the last of them. Thank you, {player}. The Pokémon here can rest now.":"這是最後的了。謝謝你，{player}。這裡的寶可夢終於能休息了。","Byron was looking into the trouble here. He has gone back to his Gym in Canalave, so you can challenge him now.":"東瓜之前在調查這裡的事。他已經回水脈市的道館了，你可以去挑戰他。","Before you go, I want you to have this.":"在你走之前，我想把這個送給你。","Ready to head back to Canalave?":"要回水脈市了嗎？","The boat sailed back to Canalave City...":"船駛回了水脈市……","I will wait right here.":"我就在這裡等你。","Riley's Lucario looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"亞玄的路卡利歐照顧了你的寶可夢。牠們完全恢復了！","I came to camp in the old mine. It is quiet. Too quiet. Battle me!":"我來這座老礦山露營。這裡很安靜，太安靜了。和我對戰吧！","At least that was not quiet.":"至少剛才不安靜了。","I heard people in strange suits on the floor below.":"我聽到下面一層有穿著奇怪衣服的人。","A picnic in a mine is not as nice as I thought. A battle will cheer me up!":"在礦山裡野餐沒有想像中好。來場對戰讓我打起精神吧！","Not cheered up.":"精神沒打起來。","Raichu lights up the tunnels for me. It is very handy.":"雷丘幫我照亮隧道，非常方便。","Damon":"戴蒙","Solid.":"夠硬。","Onix evolve with a Metal Coat. This island is full of old steel.":"大岩蛇要用金屬膜才能進化。這座島上到處都是舊鋼鐵。","All right, all right.":"好吧好吧。","Riley trains here with his Lucario. They read each other's minds.":"亞玄和他的路卡利歐在這裡修行。他們能讀懂彼此的心。","Those people in the space suits went that way. Be careful.":"那些穿太空服的人往那邊去了。小心點。","Kendal":"肯德爾","Time to run!":"快跑！","Iron Island. The mine has been closed for years. Enter at your own risk.":"鋼鐵島。礦山已關閉多年。入內風險自負。","The Trainers below battle in pairs, so we will face them as a pair too.":"下面的訓練家都是兩人一組對戰，所以我們也兩個人一起應戰吧。","Lucario can feel the Pokémon of this mine. They are frightened. Let us hurry.":"路卡利歐能感覺到這座礦坑裡的寶可夢。牠們很害怕。我們快走吧。","Damon & Maurice":"戴蒙和莫里斯","Two Hikers, two of you. This mine made our Pokémon as hard as its steel!":"兩個登山男對你們兩個。這座礦坑讓我們的寶可夢變得跟這裡的鋼鐵一樣硬！","Solid... but not solid enough.":"夠硬……但還不夠硬。","Jonah & Brenda":"約拿和布倫達","We came down here to train in peace, and here you are with Riley. Fine: two against two!":"我們下來這裡是想安靜地修行，結果你和亞玄來了。好吧，二對二！","All right, all right. You two work well together.":"好啦好啦。你們兩個配合得真好。","Tyler & Kendal":"泰勒和肯德爾","We train in the dark so we can fight anywhere. Hiyah!":"我們在黑暗中修行，在哪裡都能戰鬥。嘿呀！","We need more light... and more training.":"我們需要更多光……還有更多修行。","Brendon & Quentin":"布倫登和昆汀","We dig this mine, and those strange people scared off every Pokémon in it. You look like trouble too!":"我們在這座礦坑幹活，那些怪人把這裡的寶可夢全嚇跑了。你看起來也像來搗亂的！","Sorry! You are the good kind of trouble.":"對不起！你是來解決麻煩的那種人。","The people in space suits went down that narrow way.":"穿太空服的那些人從那條窄路下去了。","Two of you? Then two of us! The steel in this mine belongs to Team Galactic!":"你們有兩個人？那我們也兩個！這座礦坑的鋼鐵歸銀河隊所有！","{player}! The professor asked me to see you off. Jubilife City is just north of here.":"{player}！博士讓我來送送你。祝慶市就在這裡北邊。","Oh, a wild Bidoof! You have caught plenty of Pokémon, I know. But let me show you how we do it in Sinnoh!":"哎呀，是野生的大牙狸！我知道你已經抓過很多寶可夢了，不過讓我示範一下神奧的做法吧！","{assistant} sent out a Pokémon and wore the Bidoof down, then threw a Poké Ball...":"{assistant}派出寶可夢削弱了大牙狸，然後扔出了精靈球……","Gotcha! The wild Bidoof was caught!":"抓到了！野生的大牙狸被收服了！","Weaken it first, then throw. A sleeping or paralyzed Pokémon is even easier to catch!":"先削弱牠，再扔球。睡著或麻痺的寶可夢更容易抓到！","I will go on ahead to Jubilife City. See you there!":"我先去祝慶市了。那裡見！","Come on, hand it over! Professor Rowan's notes on evolution. Team Galactic has a use for them.":"快交出來！七灶博士關於進化的研究筆記。銀河隊用得著它。","{player}! Over here! These two will not leave me alone!":"{player}！這邊！這兩個人一直纏著我！","Beaten by two kids? This is not over. Team Galactic will remember you!":"居然輸給兩個小孩？這事沒完。銀河隊會記住你們的！","Thank you, {player}! Why would anyone want the professor's research? I will tell him right away.":"謝謝你，{player}！為什麼會有人想要博士的研究呢？我得馬上告訴他。","Barry ran east to Route 203, looking for you. The first Gym of Sinnoh is in Oreburgh City, past Oreburgh Gate at the end of the route.":"阿馴往東跑去203號道路找你了。神奧的第一個道館在黑金市，穿過道路盡頭的黑金關口就到。","Jubilife TV. The doors are shut: a show is being filmed inside.":"祝慶電視台。大門緊閉：裡面正在錄節目。","The Pokétch Company. A sign on the door says: \"Our watch for Trainers is coming soon!\"":"寶可錶公司。門上的告示寫著：「我們的訓練家手錶即將推出！」","Welcome to the Trainers' School! In Sinnoh, even a Champion can learn something new.":"歡迎來到訓練家學校！在神奧，就算是冠軍也能學到新東西。","Here, Pokémon evolve in ways you may not have seen: holding an item at night, or once they know a certain move. Have a look at the blackboard!":"這裡的寶可夢有些進化方式你可能沒見過：在夜裡攜帶道具，或者學會某個招式。看看黑板吧！","Tristan":"崔斯坦","You came up from Sandgem? Then you have to battle me. Those are the rules of Route 202!":"你是從真砂鎮過來的？那就得和我對戰。這是202號道路的規矩！","I made the rules up anyway...":"反正規矩是我自己編的……","Bidoof look sleepy, but they are tougher than they seem.":"大牙狸看起來呆呆的，其實比看上去頑強。","Logan":"羅根","Listen to my Kricketot! It knocks its antennae together like a little drum!":"聽聽我的圓法師！牠把觸角碰在一起，像在打小鼓！","The song is over...":"曲子結束了……","When Kricketot evolves, it plays a real melody. I cannot wait.":"圓法師進化以後，就能演奏真正的旋律了。我好期待。","Natalie":"娜塔莉","My Shinx sparks when it is happy. Let me show you how happy it gets in a battle!":"我的小貓怪一高興就會冒出火花。看看牠對戰時有多高興吧！","Oh, the sparks went out.":"啊，火花熄滅了。","Shinx glow in the dark. At night the grass here twinkles with them.":"小貓怪會在黑暗中發光。到了晚上，這裡的草叢就一閃一閃的。","Rocks came down on the path to Route 204. We are clearing them, but it will take a while!":"通往204號道路的路上落石了。我們正在清理，不過還要一陣子！","Jubilife has a TV station and the company that makes the Pokétch. It is the place to be in Sinnoh!":"祝慶市有電視台，還有製造寶可錶的公司。這裡是神奧最熱鬧的地方！","Team Galactic? They talk about making a brand-new world. Strange people, if you ask me.":"銀河隊？他們說要創造一個全新的世界。要我說，真是群怪人。","Route 203 is east of the city. Past it, a tunnel through the mountain leads to Oreburgh City.":"203號道路在城市東邊。過了那裡，有一條穿山隧道通往黑金市。","The Gym Leader in Oreburgh uses Rock-type Pokémon. Water and Grass moves are the way to go!":"黑金市的道館館主使用岩石屬性的寶可夢。水屬性和草屬性的招式最有效！","A Repel keeps weak wild Pokémon away for a while. Very handy in a long cave!":"除蟲噴霧能讓弱小的野生寶可夢暫時不靠近。在長長的洞窟裡特別好用！","Harrison":"哈里森","Today we are learning about battles. Will you be my homework?":"今天我們在學對戰。你願意當我的作業嗎？","I think I failed that test...":"這次考試我好像不及格了……","I will read the blackboard again. Twice!":"我要再看一遍黑板。看兩遍！","Christine":"克莉絲汀","I got top marks in type matchups. Let me prove it!":"我的屬性相剋考了滿分。讓我證明給你看！","Top marks are not everything, I guess.":"看來滿分也不代表一切。","Electric moves are great against Flying types. That part I got right!":"電屬性招式對飛行屬性很有效。這一題我答對了！","My neighbor works at the Pokétch Company. They are making a watch for Trainers, full of handy little apps.":"我的鄰居在寶可錶公司上班。他們在做一款給訓練家用的手錶，裡面有很多好用的小程式。","Route 202. North: Jubilife City. South: Sandgem Town.":"202號道路。北：祝慶市　南：真砂鎮","Jubilife City. The busiest city in Sinnoh, where people and Pokémon come together.":"祝慶市。神奧最熱鬧的城市，人與寶可夢在此相聚。","Trainer Tips: the Oreburgh Gym is east of here, past Route 203 and Oreburgh Gate.":"訓練家小提示：黑金道館在東邊，穿過203號道路和黑金關口就到。","The blackboard says: \"Some Pokémon evolve when they level up holding an item, some only by day or only by night, and some once they know a certain move.\"":"黑板上寫著：「有些寶可夢要攜帶道具升級才會進化，有些只在白天或只在夜晚進化，有些則要學會某個招式。」","The blackboard says: \"The Shiny Stone, the Dusk Stone and the Dawn Stone each make certain Pokémon evolve.\"":"黑板上寫著：「光之石、暗之石和覺醒之石都能讓特定的寶可夢進化。」","The boats to Canalave are not running, and the sea on Route 218 is too rough today. Better come back another time.":"去水脈市的船停開了，今天218號道路的海浪也太大。改天再來吧。","That notebook on the desk is mine. Did you know abilities work outside battle too? My Slugma keeps the Eggs I carry warm, so they hatch in no time!":"桌上那本筆記本是我的。你知道特性在對戰以外也有用嗎？我的熔岩蟲會幫我把帶著的蛋保溫，很快就孵出來了！","Who are you, another Trainer? Fine: two of us, two of you. Team Galactic does not lose!":"你是誰，又一個訓練家？好啊，二對二。銀河隊是不會輸的！","{player}, let us battle them together! Two against two!":"{player}，我們一起對付他們吧！二對二！","Rupert":"魯伯特","Veteran Rupert":"老練訓練家 魯伯特","Splendid. You saw through every trick I played.":"精彩。我的每一招你都看穿了。","Power alone does not win battles. Spikes on the ground, a taunt at the right moment, a wish for a friend who comes after: that is what I teach.":"光靠力量是贏不了對戰的。地上的撒菱、恰到好處的挑釁、留給下一位同伴的祈願——這些才是我要教的。","Would you like a lesson? Six against six, and no holding back.":"要上一課嗎？六對六，全力以赴。","Come back whenever you are ready to learn.":"等你準備好學習了再來吧。","Then take your places, and watch the field as closely as the foe!":"那就各就各位吧，場地和對手一樣要看仔細！","Every trick has its answer. Come and try again whenever you like.":"每一招都有破解的方法。隨時歡迎再來挑戰。","There is little left I can teach you. Pass it on to the children here, will you?":"我已經沒什麼可以教你的了。把這些教給這裡的孩子們吧，好嗎？","Hmph. It does not matter. Soon the whole of Sinnoh will feel what we can do!":"哼，無所謂。很快整個神奧都會見識到我們的厲害！","The grunt ran off toward the lake.":"手下朝湖的方向逃走了。","So that is where he was hiding! Well fought. The marsh is safe, thanks to you.":"原來他躲在這裡！打得好。多虧了你，大濕地平安無事。","Your friend Barry is back in Pastoria, and he is itching to see you. Off you go!":"你的朋友阿馴回濕原市了，他急著要見你。快去吧！","Fresh rubble blocks the tunnel. A note says: \"Still digging. Come back later!\"":"新塌下來的碎石堵住了隧道。紙條上寫著：「還在挖。晚點再來！」","The cottage is locked. A card on the door says: \"Hotel Grand Lake guests only.\"":"小屋鎖著。門上的牌子寫著：「僅限湖畔飯店的住客。」","Carlos":"卡洛斯","I am on a case. I followed this Goldeen all the way up the hill. Do not ask how.":"我在辦案。我一路跟著這隻角金魚爬上了山坡。別問我是怎麼做到的。","Case closed... on me.":"結案了……輸的是我。","A good detective notices everything. Somebody has been digging in the cliff to the south.":"好偵探什麼都看在眼裡。南邊的山崖有人挖過。","Douglas":"道格拉斯","I collected all the Eevee evolutions I could find. Want to see them up close?":"我收集了能找到的所有伊布進化型。要不要近距離看看？","My collection! Not a scratch, I hope.":"我的收藏！希望沒有刮傷。","They say Eevee can evolve in new ways here in Sinnoh. I am going to need a bigger shelf.":"聽說在神奧，伊布還有新的進化方式。我得換個更大的架子了。","Mitchell":"米切爾","I saw this battle in a dream. In the dream, I won.":"我在夢裡見過這場對戰。夢裡是我贏了。","Dreams are not what they used to be.":"夢也不比從前了。","Something is stirring under Lake Valor. I can feel it in my spoons.":"立志湖底下有什麼在蠢動。我的湯匙感覺得到。","Abigail":"阿比蓋爾","My Pokémon whisper that you are strong. Prove them right!":"我的寶可夢悄悄說你很強。證明給牠們看吧！","They were right.":"牠們說得沒錯。","The wind from the lake smells strange today.":"今天從湖上吹來的風味道很怪。","My Pokémon come from ruins and fossils. History hits hard!":"我的寶可夢來自遺跡和化石。歷史的拳頭可是很重的！","Buried again.":"又被埋起來了。","That tunnel in the cliff is mine. I will not stop digging until I find what is down there.":"山崖上那條隧道是我挖的。不找到底下的東西，我絕不停手。","Brady":"布雷迪","Six Pokémon from the Great Marsh, and every one of them a rare find!":"六隻大濕地的寶可夢，每一隻都很稀有！","All six of them...":"六隻全倒了……","I caught them in the Great Marsh at Pastoria. You pay at the gate and throw Safari Balls.":"我是在濕原市的大濕地抓到的。在入口付錢，然後丟狩獵球就行了。","The way to Lake Valor is closed for now. Guests say something odd is going on at the shore.":"去立志湖的路暫時封閉了。住客說湖邊有些不對勁。","People come from all over Sinnoh to stay at the Hotel Grand Lake. The view is lovely.":"全神奧的人都會來湖畔飯店住。這裡的景色很美。","Seven Stars is the best restaurant in Sinnoh. I saved up for a whole year!":"七星餐廳是神奧最好的餐廳。我存了整整一年的錢！","You followed me all the way here? Too bad for you! That bomb was only the start.":"你一路追到這裡？算你倒楣！那顆炸彈只是開始。","No! The mission!":"不！任務！","Welcome to the Hotel Grand Lake. I am sorry, every suite is booked this season.":"歡迎光臨湖畔飯店。很抱歉，這一季的套房全都訂滿了。","I come here every year for the lake. This year it looks... restless.":"我每年都來看湖。今年牠看起來……不太平靜。","The cottages on the beach belong to the hotel too. You need a key to get in.":"海灘上的小屋也是飯店的。要有鑰匙才進得去。","They say the chef here once cooked for the Champion of Sinnoh.":"聽說這裡的主廚曾經為神奧的冠軍下過廚。","The sea air makes a sailor strong. Let me show you!":"海風把水手吹得結結實實。讓你見識一下！","You never know what the tide will bring to this beach.":"你永遠不知道潮水會把什麼沖上這片海灘。","Kenneth":"肯尼斯","I fish from the beach. Today I caught a battle!":"我在海灘上釣魚。今天釣到了一場對戰！","It got away...":"讓牠跑了……","A Gyarados on the line is no joke. Crasher Wake in Pastoria has one of his own.":"釣到暴鯉龍可不是開玩笑的。濕原市的吉憲也有一隻。","Cyndy":"辛蒂","My Glameow and I came for the sun, but I never say no to a battle.":"我和魅力喵是來曬太陽的，不過對戰我也從不拒絕。","Oh, my nails!":"哎呀，我的指甲！","The hotel cottages have the best view of the sea. If you can get in.":"飯店的小屋能看到最美的海景。前提是你進得去。","I cannot swim without my float, but I can battle!":"沒有泳圈我不會游泳，但我會對戰！","Waaah, my Shellos!":"哇啊，我的無殼海兔！","Shellos look different on the other side of the mountain, you know!":"山的另一邊，無殼海兔長得不一樣哦！","Chelsea":"切爾西","Marill floats just like me! Battle!":"瑪力露和我一樣會浮在水上！來對戰吧！","My big sister says the Great Marsh is all mud and rare Pokémon.":"姊姊說大濕地全是爛泥和稀有的寶可夢。","Evan":"埃文","Swimming clears the head. A battle clears it even more!":"游泳能讓頭腦清醒。對戰更能！","Glub...":"咕嚕……","The sea around Sinnoh runs deep. Swim with care.":"神奧周圍的海很深。游的時候要小心。","Finneon lights my way at night. By day, we battle!":"螢光魚在夜裡為我照路。白天我們就對戰！","Washed ashore!":"被沖上岸了！","From out here you can see Pastoria to the west.":"從這裡往西能看到濕原市。","Route 214. North: Veilstone City. South: Valor Lakefront.":"214號道路。北：帷幕市　南：立志湖畔","Valor Lakefront. West: Lake Valor. South: Route 213.":"立志湖畔。西：立志湖　南：213號道路","Hotel Grand Lake. Rest by the water, and leave your cares at the door.":"湖畔飯店。在水邊好好休息，把煩惱留在門外。","Route 213. West: Pastoria City. North: Valor Lakefront.":"213號道路。西：濕原市　北：立志湖畔","So you are {player}. I am Cynthia. I study the old stories of Sinnoh, and Professor Rowan told me about you.":"你就是{player}吧。我叫竹蘭，在研究神奧的古老傳說。七灶博士跟我提起過你。","I was heading north, but a crowd of Psyduck is blocking Route 210. Their heads ache so much that they cannot move.":"我本來要往北走，但一群可達鴨堵住了210號道路。牠們頭痛得動不了。","This Secret Potion will cure them. I have something to see to here by the lake first. Could you take it to them?":"這瓶秘傳之藥能治好牠們。我在湖邊還有點事要辦。你能幫我帶過去嗎？","Route 210 is north of Solaceon Town. I will meet you there!":"210號道路在隨意鎮的北邊。我們在那裡見！","The road to Sunyshore City is closed. It will only open when Professor Rowan in Sandgem gives the word.":"通往濱海市的路封閉了。要等真砂鎮的七灶博士發話才會開放。","Our double battles run from nine in the morning until eleven at night. Do come back then!":"我們的雙打對戰從早上九點開始，到晚上十一點結束。請到時候再來吧！","You have battled every pair at our tables today. The whole kitchen is talking about you!":"今天你已經和我們每一桌的組合都對戰過了。整個廚房都在談論你呢！","Welcome to the Seven Stars! Five pairs dine with us today, and each of them would love a double battle.":"歡迎光臨七星餐廳！今天有五組客人在這裡用餐，他們每一組都很想來一場雙打對戰。","The pairs change every day, so do come back tomorrow.":"每天來的組合都不一樣，明天也請再來吧。","Five double battles in one day! Nobody has done that since we opened. The kitchen is cheering for you!":"一天之內贏下五場雙打！自開店以來還沒有人做到過。整個廚房都在為你喝彩！","Our parents own half the hotels on this lake. Shall we see if we own this battle too?":"這座湖邊一半的飯店都是我們爸媽的。來看看這場對戰是不是也歸我們吧？","Money cannot buy that kind of teamwork, it seems.":"看來那種默契是花錢買不到的。","Kylie wants dessert now. She always wants dessert after losing.":"琪莉現在想吃甜點了。她每次輸了都想吃甜點。","Alison":"艾莉森","My Feebas is the rarest thing in this room. Well, after the soup. Let us battle!":"我的醜醜魚是這間餐廳裡最稀有的東西。嗯，僅次於湯。來對戰吧！","My precious Feebas! You were not supposed to be so strong!":"我寶貴的醜醜魚！你不應該這麼厲害的啊！","Alison says Roselia smells nicer than my Feebas. She is right, but do not tell Feebas.":"艾莉森說毒薔薇比我的醜醜魚好聞。她說得沒錯，但別告訴醜醜魚。","Emanuel":"艾曼紐","Blythe":"布萊絲","My granddaughter and I eat here every week. And every week we battle someone!":"我和孫女每個星期都來這裡吃飯。每個星期也都會和人對戰一場！","Ha! The young ones keep getting stronger.":"哈！年輕人真是越來越厲害了。","Blythe is learning fast. One day she will beat me, and then I will retire.":"布萊絲學得很快。總有一天她會贏過我，到時候我就退休。","Kendrick":"肯德里克","Gabriella":"加布麗埃拉","I have been watching you since you walked in. A detective notices these things. Battle!":"從你一進門我就在觀察你了。偵探總會注意到這些事。來對戰吧！","I did not see that coming. Some detective I am.":"我完全沒料到。我這個偵探真是失職。","Gabriella is not my partner on the case. Only at dinner.":"加布麗埃拉不是我辦案的搭檔，只是吃飯的搭檔。","Emilio":"埃米利奧","Kaylee raises them, I study them. Let us test our results on you!":"凱莉負責培育，我負責研究。就拿你來檢驗我們的成果吧！","Interesting. Your results are better than ours.":"有意思。你的成果比我們的好。","Kaylee says I think too much and play too little. My Kadabra agrees with her.":"凱莉說我想得太多、玩得太少。我的勇基拉也同意她的說法。","Leonardo":"萊昂納多","Rebecca":"麗貝卡","A double battle before the main course. How delightfully civilized!":"主菜上桌前來一場雙打對戰，真是風雅極了！","A splendid battle. My compliments to the Trainer.":"精彩的對戰。請接受我對這位訓練家的讚美。","Chatot will be repeating your name all evening now, I fear.":"恐怕聒噪鳥今晚會一直重複你的名字了。","Ismael":"伊斯梅爾","Harley":"哈莉","I paint battles, you know. Give me a beautiful one to paint!":"我可是畫對戰的畫家哦。給我一場漂亮的對戰來畫吧！","What colors! I will need a bigger canvas.":"多麼豐富的色彩！我需要一張更大的畫布了。","Harley thinks my paintings of Psyduck are too yellow. Psyduck is yellow!":"哈莉覺得我畫的可達鴨太黃了。可達鴨本來就是黃的啊！","Darryl":"達里爾","Valerie":"瓦萊麗","We are doing a story on the best Trainers at the lake. Show the camera what you can do!":"我們在做一期湖邊最強訓練家的專題報導。讓鏡頭看看你的本事吧！","Did you get that, Darryl? Tell me you got that!":"達里爾，你拍下來了嗎？告訴我你拍下來了！","The story will be on the evening news. You might want to comb your hair.":"這段報導會在晚間新聞播出。你最好梳一下頭髮。","Esteban":"埃斯特萬","Meredith":"梅雷迪思","Miss Meredith is teaching me about cute Pokémon. I am teaching her about battling!":"梅雷迪思姊姊在教我可愛的寶可夢。我在教她怎麼對戰！","I think we both have more to learn.":"看來我們兩個都還要多學學。","Meredith says Pichu is the cutest. I say Quagsire. We will never agree.":"梅雷迪思說皮丘最可愛。我說是沼王。我們永遠不會有共識的。","Chef":"廚師","Ah, {player}. Good, you are here. Sit down and listen.":"啊，{player}。你來得正好。坐下聽我說。","Sinnoh has three great lakes: Verity, Valor and Acuity. An old story says that a Pokémon sleeps in each of them.":"神奧有三座大湖：心齊湖、立志湖和睿智湖。古老的傳說講，每座湖裡都沉睡著一隻寶可夢。","They are said to have given people feeling, will and knowledge. And Team Galactic has been reading those same stories.":"據說牠們賜予了人們情感、意志和知識。而銀河隊也一直在研究這些傳說。","Then we stop them! Simple!":"那就阻止他們！很簡單！","A huge boom shook the library, and books fell from the shelves!":"一聲巨響震動了圖書館，書從架子上掉了下來！","Professor! That came from the east. People are saying that something blew up at Lake Valor!":"博士！聲音是從東邊傳來的。大家說立志湖發生了爆炸！","So it has begun. We must protect the lakes at once. Barry, you go to Lake Acuity. {assistant}, to Lake Verity.":"果然開始了。我們必須馬上保護這幾座湖。阿馴，你去睿智湖。{assistant}，你去心齊湖。","{player}, Lake Valor is yours. It lies west of Valor Lakefront. Hurry!":"{player}，立志湖就交給你了。它在立志湖畔的西邊。快去！","Lake Acuity, got it! It is way up north, but I will be there before you know it!":"睿智湖，明白！雖然在很北邊，但我轉眼就到！","You are strong, I will give you that. But I already have what I came for.":"你很強，這點我承認。但我已經拿到想要的東西了。","Mesprit is ours now, just like Azelf. Run along, and try to catch the boss if you dare!":"艾姆利多已經是我們的了，和亞克諾姆一樣。有膽量的話，就去追老大吧！","Team Galactic left Lake Verity, and took Mesprit with them.":"銀河隊離開了心齊湖，帶走了艾姆利多。","They took it, and I could not stop them. I have to tell the Professor. Thank you for coming, {player}.":"牠被帶走了，我沒能阻止他們。我得去告訴博士。謝謝你趕來，{player}。","Barry went north to Lake Acuity, past Snowpoint City. I hope he is all right.":"阿馴往北去了睿智湖，要經過雪峰市。希望他沒事。","There you are, {player}! Professor Rowan is in the library with Barry. He wants to see you right away!":"{player}，你在這兒！七灶博士和阿馴在圖書館，博士想馬上見你！","Go on, then. It will not change anything!":"去吧。反正什麼也改變不了！","It makes no difference. Azelf is already ours, and Mars has gone to Lake Verity for the next one.":"無所謂。亞克諾姆已經到手了，夥星也去心齊湖抓下一隻了。","You might want to hurry. Not that it will help.":"你最好快點。不過也沒什麼用。","Saturn left the cavern.":"鎮星離開了洞穴。","One Galactic Bomb, and the whole lake is gone. Impressive, right?":"一顆銀河炸彈，整座湖就沒了。厲害吧？","Hey! We are the ones who won here!":"喂！贏的明明是我們！","The Commander is in the cave. It is too late, anyway.":"幹部在洞穴裡。反正已經太遲了。","Those Magikarp will be fine. Probably. Who cares?":"那些鯉魚王不會有事的。大概吧。誰在乎呢？","I care about that, at least.":"這個我倒是在乎。","The lake will fill up again. We got what we wanted.":"湖水還會漲回來的。我們已經得到想要的了。","Commander Saturn is busy. Nobody gets past me!":"鎮星幹部正忙著。誰也別想過去！","He is going to be so angry...":"他會氣壞的……","So you found your way down here. I am Saturn, a Commander of Team Galactic. You are too late, but since you came all this way, let me show you what a Commander can do.":"你居然找到這裡來了。我是銀河隊幹部鎮星。你來晚了，不過既然來了，就讓你見識一下幹部的實力。","I see. The boss was right to take note of you.":"原來如此。老大注意到你是有道理的。","Lake Valor. Its waters are said to be the home of a spirit of will.":"立志湖。據說湖中住著意志的精靈。","The Magikarp is flopping on the dry lake bed. It has nowhere to swim.":"鯉魚王在乾涸的湖床上撲騰，沒有水可以游。","Lake Valor is full again! The water has come back, and the Pokémon of the lake with it.":"立志湖又滿了！湖水回來了，湖裡的寶可夢也跟著回來了。","Far out on the water a Magikarp leaps and splashes down. It has somewhere to swim again.":"遠處的水面上，一隻鯉魚王躍起又撲通落下。牠又有地方可以游了。","The lake shines in the sun, as if the Galactic Bomb had never fallen.":"湖面在陽光下閃閃發亮，就好像銀河炸彈從來沒有落下過一樣。","One morning the lake was simply full again, as if nothing had happened. The fish came back with the water.":"某天早上，湖就這樣又滿了，好像什麼事都沒發生過。魚也跟著水一起回來了。","I walk over from the Hotel Grand Lake every morning. A lake without water was a sad thing to look at.":"我每天早上都從湖畔飯店散步過來。沒有水的湖，看著真讓人難過。","Beyond this door are the Elite Four of Sinnoh. You battle all four in a row, and then the Champion.":"這扇門後面就是神奧的四天王。你要連續挑戰四人，然後是冠軍。","Sinnoh's Elite Four use Bug, Ground, Fire and Psychic Pokémon. And the Champion? I hear she spends her days reading old stories.":"神奧的四天王用的是蟲、地面、火和超能力屬性的寶可夢。那冠軍呢？聽說她整天都在讀古老的傳說。","A shelf of records: the names of every Champion of Sinnoh's Pokémon League.":"一排記錄架：上面寫著神奧寶可夢聯盟歷代冠軍的名字。","Elite Four Aaron":"四天王阿柳","Welcome. I am Aaron of the Elite Four. Most people look at a Bug Pokémon and see something small and weak. I see something that never gives up. Let me show you how far that goes!":"歡迎。我是四天王阿柳。大多數人看到蟲屬性寶可夢，只覺得牠們又小又弱。我看到的卻是永不放棄。讓我告訴你，這能走多遠！","I lost... My Pokémon fought to the very end, and so did yours.":"我輸了……我的寶可夢戰鬥到了最後一刻，你的也一樣。","Go on. Bertha is next, and she has been doing this for longer than any of us.":"去吧。下一位是菊野，她比我們誰幹這一行都久。","Back again, Champion? My Bug Pokémon have shed their old shells. See what has grown underneath!":"又來了嗎，冠軍？我的蟲屬性寶可夢已經蛻去了舊殼。看看裡面長出了什麼吧！","Elite Four Bertha":"四天王菊野","Well now, such a young face. I am Bertha of the Elite Four. My Pokémon and I are as patient as the ground under your feet. Come along, dear, and show this old woman what you can do.":"哎呀，好年輕的一張臉。我是四天王菊野。我和我的寶可夢就像你腳下的大地一樣有耐心。來吧，孩子，讓我這老太婆看看你的本事。","Oh my. It has been years since anyone shook the ground under me.":"哎喲。好多年沒人能撼動我腳下的地面了。","Flint is next. He may grin at you, but his fire is no joke. Take care, dear.":"下一位是大葉。他也許會衝你笑，但他的火可不是鬧著玩的。小心點，孩子。","Back to see me, Champion? How kind of you. The ground has not forgotten your footsteps.":"又來看我了，冠軍？真是有心。大地還記得你的腳步。","There you are! Volkner has not stopped talking about you since Sunyshore. You woke him up, so now it is my turn. My team only knows one way to fight: all out. Let us burn!":"你可算來了！自從濱海市之後，電次就一直在說你。你把他點著了，現在輪到我了。我的隊伍只會一種打法：全力燃燒。來吧！","Whew! Burned right down to the ashes. Now I see what got Volkner out of that lighthouse.":"呼！燒得連灰都不剩了。現在我明白是什麼把電次從燈塔裡拉出來的了。","Lucian is the last of us. Good luck getting him to put his book down.":"悟松是我們中的最後一位。想讓他放下手裡的書，祝你好運。","Champion! Volkner says hello. He also says I will lose again. Let us prove him wrong!":"冠軍！電次向你問好。他還說我又要輸了。我們來證明他說錯了吧！","Elite Four Lucian":"四天王悟松","One moment, please. I would like to finish this page... There. I am Lucian of the Elite Four. Books have taught me a great deal, but some things are only written in a battle. Shall we read each other?":"請稍等，我想讀完這一頁……好了。我是四天王悟松。書教會了我很多，但有些東西只寫在對戰裡。讓我們讀一讀彼此吧。","Hm. I did not see that ending coming.":"嗯。我沒料到會是這樣的結局。","The Champion is beyond that door. I believe you have met. Do not expect what you remember.":"冠軍就在那扇門後面。我想你們見過面。別指望她還是你記憶中的樣子。","Champion. I have read another whole shelf since we last met. Every book was about how to beat you.":"冠軍。上次見面之後，我又讀完了一整架書。每一本講的都是怎樣打敗你。","So you came, {player}. I hoped you would.":"你來了，{player}。我一直希望你會來。","I told you I study the old stories of Sinnoh, and that is true. I did not tell you the rest: I am the Champion of this League.":"我說過我在研究神奧的古老傳說，這是真的。但還有一件事我沒告訴你：我就是這座聯盟的冠軍。","We stood together at the Spear Pillar and in that broken world. Today there is nobody to stop, nothing to save. It is only you, me and our Pokémon.":"我們一起站在槍之柱，也一起走過那個破碎的世界。今天沒有誰要阻止，也沒有什麼要拯救。只有你、我，和我們的寶可夢。","I have looked forward to this since the day we met. Come, and hold nothing back!":"從我們相遇的那天起，我就在期待這一刻。來吧，別留一點餘力！","...That was the best battle I have had in a very long time. Thank you, {player}. From today, you are the Champion of Sinnoh.":"……這是我很久以來打過的最棒的一場對戰。謝謝你，{player}。從今天起，你就是神奧的冠軍。","Hm. So it is done. I left my lab to see this with my own eyes, and I am glad I did.":"嗯。總算到了這一步。我離開研究所，就是想親眼看看，這一趟來得值。","You came to Sinnoh as a stranger and picked up a Pokémon from my briefcase. Look at what the two of you have done since.":"你初到神奧時人生地不熟，從我的公文包裡拿了一隻寶可夢。看看你們倆後來做到了什麼。","Come with us, {player}. There is one more room, and only a Champion may enter it.":"跟我們來吧，{player}。還有最後一個房間，只有冠軍才能進去。","Welcome back, Champion. I have found a few new stories, and my team has grown stronger. Shall we?":"歡迎回來，冠軍。我又找到了幾個新的傳說，我的隊伍也更強了。開始吧？","Still the Champion. I will never get tired of this. Come back whenever you like.":"依然是冠軍。這樣的對戰我永遠不會膩。想來就隨時來吧。","The Hall of Fame. Sinnoh's Champions and their Pokémon are remembered here forever.":"殿堂。神奧的冠軍和他們的寶可夢將在這裡被永遠銘記。","The names of Sinnoh's Champions and their Pokémon are kept in this room for as long as the League stands. Today, yours join them.":"只要聯盟還在，神奧歷代冠軍和他們的寶可夢的名字就會留在這個房間裡。今天，你們的名字也加入了。","Sinnoh has its old stories, and now it has a new one. Be sure to write to Birch. He will want to hear all of it.":"神奧有它古老的傳說，現在又多了一個新的。記得寫信給小田卷。他一定想知道全部經過。","Time, space and the lakes are all at peace, thanks to you. Go home and rest, Champion. I will be here when you want another battle.":"時間、空間和三座湖都平靜下來了，這都多虧了你。回家好好休息吧，冠軍。想再打一場的時候，我會在這裡。","A cave opens in the rock of the island. A strange pressure turns you back.":"島上的岩石間有個洞穴。一股奇怪的壓力把你推了回來。","{mon} sits with its eyes closed. As you come near, they begin to open.":"{mon}閉著眼睛。你走近時，牠的眼睛慢慢睜開了。","{mon} hovers in the middle of the cave. It seems to have been waiting for you.":"{mon}浮在洞穴中央，好像一直在等你。","{mon} faded away into the dark. It may come back when the cave is quiet.":"{mon}消失在黑暗中。等洞穴安靜下來，牠也許會回來。","{mon} floats in the dim light and looks straight at you.":"{mon}浮在昏暗的光裡，直直地看著你。","{mon} gave a soft cry and vanished!":"{mon}輕輕叫了一聲，消失了！","It must be roaming somewhere in Sinnoh now. The Town Map will show where.":"牠現在一定在神奧的某處遊蕩。城鎮地圖會顯示牠的位置。","The {item} grows warm in your bag, and {mon} looks down at you. Time itself seems to hold its breath.":"包裡的{item}漸漸發熱，{mon}低頭看著你。時間彷彿屏住了呼吸。","The {item} shines in your bag, and {mon} looks down at you. The air between the pillars begins to bend.":"包裡的{item}亮了起來，{mon}低頭看著你。柱子之間的空氣開始彎曲。","{mon} faded in among the pillars. It may answer you again.":"{mon}消失在柱子之間。牠也許還會回應你。","The air over the Spear Pillar grew still. Time and space are flowing as they should.":"槍之柱上空的空氣靜了下來。時間和空間都在正常流動。","You climbed all the way up to pay your respects? Bless you. Take this. It keeps wild Pokémon from bothering you.":"你一路爬上來掃墓嗎？真是好孩子。拿著這個吧。它能讓野生寶可夢少來打擾你。","Let the Pokémon at the front of your team hold the Cleanse Tag, and fewer wild ones will come near.":"讓隊伍最前面的寶可夢帶著潔淨之符，野生寶可夢就不太會靠近了。","The spirits here are gentle, but they like to play tricks. Here, a tag with their power in it.":"這裡的靈魂都很溫和，就是愛捉弄人。給你，這張符裡有牠們的力量。","A Pokémon holding the Spell Tag hits harder with Ghost-type moves. The spirits lend it a hand.":"帶著詛咒之符的寶可夢，幽靈屬性招式的威力會更強。是靈魂在幫牠一把。","I come every week to visit my Starly. The old women at the very top keep all the graves clean.":"我每週都來看我的姆克兒。最頂層的兩位婆婆把每座墓都打掃得乾乾淨淨。","Oliver":"奧利弗","My friends dared me to climb to the top. Battle me, so I have an excuse to stop here!":"朋友打賭說我不敢爬到頂。跟我對戰吧，這樣我就有理由停在這裡了！","Now I have to keep climbing...":"這下只好繼續往上爬了……","Is it just me, or did that grave move?":"是我的錯覺嗎？那座墓好像動了一下？","I bring my Pichu here so they are not scared of ghosts. It is not working yet!":"我帶皮丘來這裡，好讓牠們不再怕幽靈。目前還沒什麼效果！","Brave little things, all the same.":"不過牠們還是很勇敢的小傢伙。","Pikachu was the bravest of them. It still is.":"皮卡丘以前是最勇敢的，現在也是。","Do not laugh at my Cleffa. It is tougher than it looks. So am I!":"不准笑我的皮寶寶。牠比看起來強悍多了。我也是！","You did not laugh. Respect.":"你沒笑。佩服。","I come up here to think. The quiet does me good.":"我上來這裡是為了想想事情。安靜一點挺好的。","Beth & Bob":"貝絲和鮑勃","Pa and I raised these two Ponyta from foals. Let us show you how they run!":"我和爸爸從小把這兩隻小火馬養大。讓你看看牠們跑得多快！","They ran their best. That is what counts.":"牠們已經盡全力跑了。這才是最重要的。","We came to visit the old farm horse. Well, the old farm Rapidash.":"我們是來看農場的那匹老馬的。嗯，是農場那隻老烈焰馬。","Rebekah":"麗貝卡","My Bonsly cries when it sees the graves. A battle cheers it up!":"我的盆才怪一看到墓碑就哭。對戰能讓牠打起精神！","There, there. You did so well.":"好了好了，你做得很好。","Bonsly is smiling again. Thank you.":"盆才怪又笑了。謝謝你。","Mike & Nat":"邁克和娜特","We came here on a dare. Now we are scared, so we will battle you instead!":"我們是打賭才來的。現在害怕了，所以乾脆跟你對戰吧！","Even our ghosts were scared of you.":"連我們的幽靈都怕你。","Let us go home. Holding hands. Tightly.":"我們回家吧。手牽著手。牽緊一點。","A gravestone, polished smooth by many hands. \"For all the Pokémon who walked beside us.\"":"一塊被許多雙手摸得光滑的墓碑。「獻給所有曾陪伴在我們身邊的寶可夢。」","The biggest grave in the tower. Fresh flowers are laid before it every day.":"塔裡最大的一座墓。每天都有人在墓前獻上新鮮的花。","Oh, it is you! I would love to battle beside you again. My Pokémon are ready.":"啊，是你呀！真想再和你並肩作戰一次。我的寶可夢都準備好了。","Mira remembers you! Mira and her Pokémon want to battle with you!":"麥兒記得你！麥兒和寶可夢都想和你一起對戰！","Your aura feels as steady as ever. I would be glad to fight at your side.":"你的波導還是一樣沉穩。能和你並肩作戰，我很樂意。","...You came. If it is you, I do not mind teaming up.":"……你來了。如果是你的話，組隊也沒關係。","Hey, it is you! A tag team? Count me in, this is going to be a blast!":"嘿，是你啊！組隊對戰？算我一份，一定超有意思！","Seven wins in a row! Battling beside you makes my Pokémon so happy.":"連贏七場！和你並肩作戰，我的寶可夢都好開心。","We won! Mira had so much fun!":"我們贏了！麥兒玩得好開心！","A fine set of battles. Your Pokémon and mine fought as one.":"真是一連串精彩的對戰。你的寶可夢和我的寶可夢配合得天衣無縫。","...We were good together. Let us do it again.":"……我們配合得不錯。下次再一起吧。","Ha ha! Did you see that? We were unstoppable!":"哈哈！看到沒？我們簡直勢不可擋！","Welcome to the Battle Tower! This counter is for multi battles.":"歡迎來到對戰塔！這個櫃台受理組隊對戰。","In a multi battle, you and a partner each enter two Pokémon and battle two Trainers at once. Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points.":"組隊對戰中，你和夥伴各派出兩隻寶可夢，同時對戰兩位訓練家。連贏七場就能完成一輪，獲得對戰點數。","Your two must be different species holding different items. Your partner waits in the Battle Salon and brings two of their own.":"你的兩隻必須是不同種類，攜帶不同道具。夥伴在對戰沙龍等你，會帶上自己的兩隻寶可夢。","Partners are Trainers you have traveled with on your journey. No one is waiting in the Battle Salon for you yet.":"夥伴是你在旅途中同行過的訓練家。對戰沙龍裡還沒有人在等你。","Thank you. Please choose your partner in the Battle Salon.":"謝謝。請到對戰沙龍選擇你的夥伴。","Talk to the Trainer you would like to battle beside.":"請和你想並肩作戰的訓練家說話。","Would you like to call off your challenge?":"要取消這次挑戰嗎？","Your challenge has been called off.":"這次挑戰已經取消了。","Register at the multi battle counter first, and then we can team up.":"先到組隊對戰的櫃台報名，我們再一起組隊吧。","I will bring {one}, who knows {m1}, and {two}, who knows {m2}.":"我會帶會{m1}的{one}，還有會{m2}的{two}。","Team up with {name}?":"要和{name}組隊嗎？","Let us do our best together!":"我們一起加油吧！","Battle No. {n}! Here come your opponents.":"第{n}場對戰！對手們來了。","Fifty multi battles in a row! Your Pokémon received the {ribbon}!":"組隊對戰五十連勝！你的寶可夢獲得了{ribbon}！","That was a good try. Let us team up again some time.":"這次也打得不錯。下次再一起組隊吧。","The door to the multi battle room. Talk to the Trainer you would like to battle beside first.":"通往組隊對戰室的門。請先和你想並肩作戰的訓練家說話。","{player}! There you are! I heard about Jubilife. You took on Team Galactic without me? Not fair!":"{player}！你可來了！我聽說祝慶市的事了。你居然不叫上我就去對付銀河隊？太不公平了！","I have been training on this route all morning. Let me show you how much stronger we got!":"我一早上都在這條道路上訓練。讓你看看我們變得多強了！","Argh, again! Fine, fine, I will get you next time. The Oreburgh Gym is right past Oreburgh Gate, and I am getting there first!":"啊啊，又輸了！好吧好吧，下次一定贏你。黑金道館就在黑金關口後面，我要先到！","Ha! Told you we got stronger! The Oreburgh Gym is right past Oreburgh Gate. See you there!":"哈！我就說我們變強了吧！黑金道館就在黑金關口後面。那裡見！","There are seven more Gyms in Sinnoh. The next one is in Eterna City, past Floaroma Town. Its Leader, Gardenia, loves Grass types.":"神奧還有七個道館。下一個在百代市，要經過苑之鎮。那裡的館主菜種最喜歡草屬性。","The Gym is locked. A note on the door says: \"Gone down the mine. Back soon! Roark\"":"道館鎖著。門上的紙條寫著：「去礦山了，馬上回來！瓢太」","Hm? A visitor, all the way down here?":"嗯？居然有人跑到這麼深的地方來？","I am Roark, the Gym Leader of Oreburgh. I come down here to check the walls and look for fossils. Old habits!":"我是黑金道館的館主瓢太。我常下來檢查岩壁、找找化石。老習慣了！","A challenger, you say? A Champion of three regions, no less! Then I had better get back to my Gym. See you there!":"你說你是來挑戰的？還是三個地區的冠軍！那我得趕緊回道館了。道館見！","Hey, Champion! Welcome to the first Gym of Sinnoh. Roark uses Rock-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！歡迎來到神奧的第一個道館。瓢太使用岩石屬性的寶可夢。","Water, Grass, Fighting, Ground and Steel moves work great on them. Fire, Normal and Flying moves barely scratch them.":"水、草、格鬥、地面和鋼屬性的招式對牠們很有效。火、一般和飛行屬性的招式幾乎傷不了牠們。","Picked Chimchar? Train it until it evolves: Monferno's Mach Punch cracks rocks. Friends from home help too, as long as they are not above level 20.":"選了小火焰猴？把牠練到進化：猛火猴的音速拳能擊碎岩石。從家鄉帶來的夥伴也能幫忙，只要不超過20級就行。","This is the Coal Badge. It shows you beat me, fair and square.":"這是煤炭徽章。它證明你堂堂正正地打敗了我。","{player} received the Coal Badge from Roark!":"{player}從瓢太那裡得到了煤炭徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 25 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones raised in other regions.":"有了它，25級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算是在其他地區培養的也一樣。","Take this as well. TM76 is Stealth Rock: it scatters pointed stones that hurt every foe that comes into battle.":"把這個也收下吧。招式學習器76是隱形岩：撒下尖銳的岩石，傷害每一隻上場的對手。","Dallas":"達拉斯","You are heading for the Oreburgh Gym? Then you need practice. Lucky you, I am here!":"你要去黑金道館？那你得先練練。你運氣真好，碰上我了！","I was the one who needed practice...":"需要練習的原來是我……","Starly fly in big flocks around here. One of them is bound to be strong.":"這一帶的姆克兒成群結隊地飛。總有一隻是很強的。","Kaitlin":"凱特琳","My Shinx and I train on this route every day. Ready?":"我和我的小貓怪每天都在這條道路上訓練。準備好了嗎？","We will train some more tomorrow.":"明天我們再多練練。","Shinx use their sparks to talk to each other. Cute, right?":"小貓怪用火花互相交流。很可愛吧？","My Machop lifts rocks from the mine to get strong. Want to see its muscles?":"我的腕力會搬礦山的石頭來鍛鍊。想看看牠的肌肉嗎？","Its muscles were not enough...":"光有肌肉還不夠……","Fighting moves are great against Rock types. Remember that in Oreburgh!":"格鬥屬性的招式對岩石屬性很有效。到了黑金市可別忘了！","Kyle":"凱爾","I just came out of Oreburgh Gate. The Zubat in there would not leave me alone, so I caught one!":"我剛從黑金關口出來。裡面的超音蝠一直纏著我，所以我就抓了一隻！","Should have caught two...":"早知道抓兩隻了……","Bring something to light the way? No need: the gate is lit well enough.":"要帶照明的東西？不用啦：關口裡夠亮的。","This tunnel goes right under the mountain to Oreburgh City. The miners dug it long ago.":"這條隧道從山底下一直通到黑金市。是很久以前礦工們挖的。","Roark? He spends more time in the mine than in his Gym! Try the Oreburgh Mine, at the south end of town.":"瓢太？他待在礦山的時間比待在道館還多！去城南的黑金礦山找找吧。","Coal from the Oreburgh Mine goes all over Sinnoh. Trains, ships, the power plants: they all run on it.":"黑金礦山的煤炭會送到神奧各地。火車、輪船、發電廠，全都靠它運轉。","A blond boy ran into town earlier, shouting that he would beat the Gym before anyone else. He came out looking very red.":"剛才有個金髮男孩衝進鎮裡，喊著要比誰都先打贏道館。他出來的時候臉漲得通紅。","Roark's Rock types hit hard and take hits well. Do not forget to heal before you go in!":"瓢太的岩石屬性寶可夢攻擊力強又耐打。進去之前別忘了恢復！","Escape Ropes sell well in a mining town. Nobody wants to get lost underground!":"在礦業小鎮，離洞繩賣得特別好。誰也不想在地底下迷路！","Welcome to the Oreburgh Mining Museum! Fossils still turn up in the mine. One day we hope to wake the Pokémon inside them.":"歡迎來到黑金礦山博物館！礦山裡至今還會挖出化石。希望有一天能喚醒化石裡的寶可夢。","Roark's father is a Gym Leader too, in a port city far to the west. Like father, like son!":"瓢太的父親也是道館館主，在西邊很遠的一座港口城市。有其父必有其子！","Hey, this is a working mine! If you want to pass, you battle me first!":"喂，這裡可是在開工的礦山！想過去就先和我對戰！","You dig hard, kid.":"你挖得挺賣力嘛，小傢伙。","Roark? He was heading down the ladder at the back.":"瓢太？他往最裡面的梯子下去了。","Mason":"梅森","My Onix tunnels faster than any machine. Let it show you!":"我的大岩蛇挖隧道比任何機器都快。讓牠表演給你看！","Onix hit solid rock...":"大岩蛇撞上了堅硬的岩層……","Onix eat soil as they dig. That is why their bodies are full of stones.":"大岩蛇邊挖邊吃土。所以牠們的身體裡全是石頭。","Watch out for falling rocks down here! And for me!":"小心這裡的落石！還有小心我！","Ouch. That was a big rock.":"哎喲。那塊石頭可真大。","The boss is checking the walls over there. He likes to do it himself.":"老大在那邊檢查岩壁。他喜歡親自動手。","Jonathon":"喬納森","Roark taught me everything about Rock types. Now I will teach you!":"瓢太教了我所有關於岩石屬性的事。現在輪到我教你了！","I need more lessons...":"我還得多上幾堂課……","Roark found his Cranidos as a fossil in the mine. Amazing, right?":"瓢太的頭蓋龍是他在礦山裡挖到的化石。很厲害吧？","I work in the mine by day and train in the Gym by night. Rock solid!":"我白天在礦山幹活，晚上在道館訓練。堅如磐石！","Roark is right up ahead. His Stealth Rock hurts every Pokémon you switch in, so pick your first one well.":"瓢太就在前面。他的隱形岩會傷害你換上場的每一隻寶可夢，所以第一隻要選好。","Welcome to the Oreburgh Gym! I am Roark, the Gym Leader. A Champion of three regions, here in my Gym? Then my Rock types will give you everything they have!":"歡迎來到黑金道館！我是館主瓢太。三個地區的冠軍來到我的道館？那我的岩石屬性寶可夢也要全力以赴了！","Well, that settles it. Your Pokémon dug deeper than mine!":"好吧，勝負已分。你的寶可夢挖得比我的更深！","Route 203. West: Jubilife City. East: Oreburgh Gate.":"203號道路。西：祝慶市　東：黑金關口","Oreburgh City. A mining town whose coal warms all of Sinnoh.":"黑金市。用煤炭溫暖整個神奧的礦業城市。","Oreburgh Mine. Mind your step!":"黑金礦山。注意腳下！","A great lump of coal from the mine. Oreburgh's coal has kept Sinnoh warm for a hundred years.":"一大塊礦山出產的煤炭。黑金市的煤炭溫暖了神奧一百年。","A fossil from deep in the mine. Long ago, very different Pokémon lived in Sinnoh.":"從礦山深處挖出的化石。很久以前，神奧生活著和現在很不一樣的寶可夢。","The slope up to Route 207 is all mud after the rain. Nobody can climb it right now. Try again later!":"下過雨後，通往207號道路的坡全是爛泥。現在誰也爬不上去。晚點再來吧！","Play the {item} at the Spear Pillar. If the old songs are true, the way to the Original One will open.":"到槍之柱去吹響{item}吧。如果古老的歌謠說的是真的，通往創世之神的路就會打開。","Those stone plates you carry... {n} of them. The old songs speak of sixteen, one for every power in the world.":"你帶著的那些石板……有 {n} 塊呢。古老的歌謠裡說一共有十六塊，世上每一種力量各有一塊。","All sixteen plates... I never thought I would live to see them gathered in one place.":"十六塊石板全都在……真沒想到我這輩子能看到它們聚在一起。","The oldest of our songs tell of the Original One, {mon}, who shaped the world and gave each power its plate.":"我們最古老的歌謠講述著創世之神{mon}，是牠塑造了世界，並把石板分給了每一種力量。","My family has kept this {item} for longer than anyone remembers, waiting for one the plates would answer. I think that one is you.":"我們家守護這支{item}，久到誰也記不清了，一直在等石板願意回應的人。我想，那個人就是你。","Take it to the Spear Pillar, where Cyrus once tried to remake the world. Play it there, and see what answers.":"把它帶到槍之柱去吧，赤日曾經在那裡試圖重塑世界。在那裡吹響它，看看會有什麼回應。","{player} took out the {item}. Its clear note rang out between the pillars...":"{player}拿出了{item}。清澈的笛聲在柱子之間迴盪……","Steps of light formed above the center of the Spear Pillar, climbing up into the sky!":"槍之柱的中央浮現出光之階梯，一直延伸到天空！","{mon} looks down from the top of the hall. The whole place seems to breathe with it.":"{mon}從大廳的最高處俯視著。整個地方彷彿隨著牠一起呼吸。","{mon} vanished in a burst of light. It may appear before you again.":"{mon}在一陣光芒中消失了。牠也許還會再出現在你面前。","Huh? A kid? Beat it! This is Team Galactic business.":"嗯？小鬼？走開！這是銀河隊的事。","Well, since you are here, watch this. Our new Galactic Bomb needs a field test!":"算了，既然你在這裡，就看好了。我們的新型銀河炸彈要做實地測試！","A dull boom rolled across the marsh, and the ground shook!":"一聲悶響傳遍了大濕地，地面震動起來！","Ha ha! That was a small one. Imagine what a big one could do to a lake!":"哈哈！這只是顆小的。想像一下大的炸在湖上會怎麼樣！","What was that noise? You there! Hold it right there!":"剛才是什麼聲音？喂，你！站住！","Crasher Wake?! I am out of here!":"吉憲？！我閃了！","He ran east, toward Route 213 and the lakefront! I will check on the marsh. You go after him!":"他往東逃了，朝213號道路和立志湖畔去了！我去看看大濕地。你快追！","There you are, {player}! Wake told me you ran that guy off. Not bad!":"{player}，你在這兒！吉憲說你把那傢伙趕跑了。不賴嘛！","But I spent all day training in the marsh mud. Time to find out who is stronger!":"不過我在大濕地的爛泥裡練了一整天。來看看誰更強吧！","Argh! Again?! Okay, okay. I will just have to get even stronger!":"啊啊！又輸了？！好吧好吧。我只好變得更強了！","Next time I will not lose! And I am going to catch something amazing, too. See you!":"下次我絕不會輸！我還要抓一隻超厲害的寶可夢。再見！","The next Gym is in Canalave City, far to the west past Jubilife. Its Leader, Byron, knows everything about Steel!":"下一個道館在水脈市，往西經過祝慶市還要走很遠。那裡的館主東瓜對鋼屬性無所不知！","Hey, Champion! Crasher Wake uses Water-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！吉憲使用水屬性的寶可夢。","Electric moves hit Gyarados four times as hard, but they do nothing to his Quagsire, which is part Ground. Grass moves hit Quagsire four times as hard!":"電屬性招式對暴鯉龍有四倍效果，但打不到沼王，因為牠也是地面屬性。草屬性招式對沼王有四倍效果！","His Floatzel is fast, and it holds a Sitrus Berry. Up to level 40, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"他的浮潛鼬速度很快，還帶著文柚果。在這裡，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢在40級以下都會聽話。","Take the Fen Badge! You earned every drop of it.":"收下濕地徽章吧！這是你一滴一滴贏來的。","{player} received the Fen Badge from Crasher Wake!":"{player}從吉憲那裡得到了濕地徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 50 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，50級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算來自其他地區也一樣。","And this is TM55, Brine. It hits twice as hard when the foe is down to half its HP or less!":"還有這個，招式學習器55，鹽水。對手的HP在一半以下時，威力會變成兩倍！","Hey, {player}! You beat Wake too? Nice, but listen!":"嘿，{player}！你也打贏吉憲了？不錯，不過你聽我說！","There is a guy in a space suit outside the Great Marsh gate, and he keeps talking about a bomb! That has to be Team Galactic!":"大濕地入口有個穿太空服的傢伙，一直在說什麼炸彈！肯定是銀河隊！","Go and check it out! I will keep people away from the marsh!":"你去看看！我來讓大家別靠近大濕地！","Welcome to the Great Marsh!":"歡迎來到大濕地！","For ₽500 you get 30 Safari Balls and 500 steps to catch whatever you can. Would you like to go in?":"付₽500，可以得到30個狩獵球和500步，盡情捕捉吧。要進去嗎？","We will call you when your steps or your Safari Balls run out. Mind the mud!":"步數或狩獵球用完時我們會叫你。小心爛泥！","Great Marsh attendant":"大濕地的工作人員","Crasher Wake loves this town. He wrestles in the mud with the children every morning!":"吉憲很愛這座城市。他每天早上都和孩子們在泥裡摔角！","Nothing beats a walk in the marsh. You lose a boot now and then, that is all.":"在濕地散步最舒服了。只是偶爾會弄丟一隻靴子。","Electric moves are great against Water types, but they cannot touch a Pokémon that is part Ground!":"電屬性招式對水屬性很有效，但打不到帶地面屬性的寶可夢！","Stock up before the marsh. You cannot use your own items in a Safari Game, though!":"去大濕地之前先備好東西。不過狩獵時不能用自己的道具哦！","Different Pokémon show up in the marsh every day. Nobody has ever seen all of them in one visit.":"大濕地每天都會出現不同的寶可夢。從來沒有人一次就看遍過。","Jacky":"傑琪","My Bibarel paddles faster than I do. Splash!":"我的大尾狸游得比我還快。嘩啦！","I got water up my nose!":"水跑進鼻子裡了！","The walkways go back and forth. Keep going and you will reach Wake.":"走道來來回回繞著走。一直走就能到吉憲那裡。","Damian":"達米安","Ahoy! No one crosses this pool without a battle!":"喂！不對戰誰也別想過這個泳池！","Man overboard!":"有人落水啦！","Flying types help you stay out of the water, but Electric moves hit them hard.":"飛行屬性可以不碰水，但怕電屬性招式。","Caitlyn":"凱特琳","All three of us are from the same family. Look!":"我們三隻是一家人。你看！","We all lost together...":"我們一起輸了……","Azumarill looks soft, but it hits really hard.":"瑪力露麗看起來軟軟的，打起來可狠了。","Samson":"參孫","I sailed all seven seas to train with Crasher Wake!":"我航遍七海，就是為了跟吉憲修行！","Back to port, then.":"那就回港吧。","Wake never stops smiling, even under that mask.":"吉憲總是笑呵呵的，就算戴著面罩也一樣。","Fishing in a Gym pool? Wake says it is fine!":"在道館泳池釣魚？吉憲說沒問題！","Gyarados is part Flying. Ground moves will not reach it.":"暴鯉龍也是飛行屬性。地面招式打不到牠。","Wake is just past me. My Whiscash will not let you by!":"吉憲就在我後面。我的鯰魚王不會讓你過去！","Go on. He is waiting for you.":"去吧。他在等你。","Whiscash is part Ground, like Wake's Quagsire. Grass moves are what you want.":"鯰魚王也是地面屬性，和吉憲的沼王一樣。要用草屬性招式。","Ha ha! Welcome! I am Crasher Wake, the masked Leader of the Pastoria Gym! Even a Champion of three regions gets soaked by my waves. Here I come!":"哈哈！歡迎！我是吉憲，濕原道館的蒙面館主！就算是三個地區的冠軍，也會被我的浪頭澆個透。來了！","What a wave! You rode it all the way to the shore!":"好大的浪！你一路乘著牠衝到了岸上！","The Pokémon deep in the marsh are the hardest to find. Save your steps for the far side!":"大濕地深處的寶可夢最難找。留點步數到最裡面吧！","Pastoria City. Home of the Great Marsh, where the mud runs deep.":"濕原市。大濕地的所在地，這裡的爛泥可深了。","A big statue of Croagunk. People here say it brings good luck.":"一座巨大的不良蛙雕像。這裡的人說牠能帶來好運。","The Great Marsh. A Safari Game at the gate: ₽500 for 30 Safari Balls and 500 steps.":"大濕地。入口受理狩獵：₽500，30個狩獵球，500步。","The Great Marsh. Throw Bait to calm a Pokémon, or a Rock to rile it up!":"大濕地。丟餌料能讓寶可夢平靜，丟石頭能讓牠激動！","A lady named Cynthia came by, looking for you. She is at the lakefront, and she says the Psyduck on Route 210 need help!":"有位叫竹蘭的女士來找過你。她在立志湖畔，說210號道路的可達鴨需要幫助！","Resort guide":"名勝區嚮導","Moira":"莫伊拉","Kyler":"凱勒","Krista":"克麗絲塔","Keegan":"基根","Corbin":"科爾賓","Meagan":"梅根","Davon":"達文","Deshawn":"德蕭恩","Sandra":"桑德拉","Glenn":"格倫","Sophia":"索菲婭","Mallory":"馬洛里","Joanna":"喬安娜","Route 228. South: Route 229 and the Resort Area. The sand never stops blowing.":"228號道路。南：229號道路和名勝區。這裡的風沙從來不停。","Sand in my eyes, sand in my teeth. A battle is the only thing that takes my mind off it!":"眼睛裡是沙，牙縫裡也是沙。只有對戰能讓我忘掉這些！","Now I have sand in my pride, too.":"現在連自尊心裡都是沙了。","Keep your eyes half shut and keep walking. That is the only way through.":"瞇著眼睛一直走。這是唯一的辦法。","My team loves the sandstorm. Yours, I am not so sure.":"我的隊伍最喜歡沙暴了。你的嘛，就不好說了。","Yours does not seem to mind it either.":"看來你的也不在乎嘛。","Ground types do not feel the sand at all. Lucky them.":"地面屬性的完全不怕沙子。真羨慕。","A ranger never gets lost, even in a sandstorm. You, on the other hand...":"巡護員就算在沙暴裡也不會迷路。至於你嘛……","You know exactly where you are going. Good.":"你很清楚自己要去哪裡。很好。","The road goes south to the coast. The air gets clearer the further you go.":"這條路往南通到海邊。越往前走，空氣越清新。","I patrol this road every day. Today, I patrol you!":"我每天都在這條路上巡邏。今天就巡邏你了！","Patrol over. You win.":"巡邏結束。你贏了。","There is a pond to the west. Nobody knows how it stays full in all this sand.":"西邊有個水塘。在這麼多沙子裡，誰也不知道它怎麼一直是滿的。","In the desert, dragons are born from the sand. Let me show you!":"在沙漠裡，龍是從沙子裡誕生的。讓我給你看看！","Mine still has some growing to do.":"我的還得再長大一點。","One day my Vibrava will be a Flygon, and then the sandstorm will be ours.":"總有一天我的超音波幼蟲會變成沙漠蜻蜓，到時候沙暴就是我們的了。","I cannot see a thing in this storm. So I see with my mind instead.":"風沙裡什麼都看不見。所以我用心靈來看。","My mind did not see that one coming.":"這一下我的心靈可沒看到。","Close your eyes and listen. The sand sings.":"閉上眼睛聽。沙子在唱歌。","I brought an Ice type to the desert. Do not laugh. Battle!":"我帶了冰屬性來沙漠。不許笑。來對戰！","Fine. You may laugh now.":"好吧。現在你可以笑了。","My Abomasnow keeps me cool. It is better than a parasol.":"我的暴雪王能讓我涼快下來。比遮陽傘還好用。","Training in the sand makes the legs strong! Hyah!":"在沙地上修行能練出好腿力！嘿呀！","My legs are strong. My Pokémon, less so.":"我的腿是練強了，寶可夢還差點。","Route 229 is just ahead. Then the sea. Then a nap.":"前面就是229號道路。然後是海。然後睡個午覺。","Route 229. South: the Resort Area. West: the sea.":"229號道路。南：名勝區。西：大海。","After the sandstorm, this road feels like paradise. Let us celebrate with a battle!":"穿過沙暴以後，這條路簡直是天堂。用一場對戰來慶祝吧！","Some celebration. Well done.":"這慶祝可真夠嗆。幹得好。","Those flowers grow nowhere else in the Battle Zone. Please do not step on them.":"那些花在對戰特區別的地方都不長。請別踩它們。","I came here to rest. Then I saw you, and I forgot all about resting.":"我是來這裡休息的。結果看到你，就把休息全忘了。","Now I really do need a rest.":"這下我是真的需要休息了。","The Resort Area is just south. Everybody there is on holiday, all the time.":"名勝區就在南邊。那裡的人一年到頭都在度假。","A Champion on my road? Then I get to see what a Champion can do!":"冠軍走到我這條路上來了？那我正好看看冠軍有多厲害！","So that is what a Champion can do.":"原來冠軍這麼厲害。","I will be a Champion one day, too. Just you wait.":"總有一天我也會成為冠軍。你等著瞧。","My team is a little bit of everything. Let us see if you can handle it!":"我的隊伍什麼屬性都有一點。看看你應付得來嗎！","You handled it, all right.":"你確實應付得來。","There is a grove behind the trees to the west. You need to cut your way in.":"西邊的樹後面有一片小樹林。得砍開樹才能進去。","Route 230. West: Fight Area. East: Route 229.":"230號水路。西：戰鬥區。東：229號道路。","I swim from Fight Area and back every day. Today I will beat a Champion on the way!":"我每天都從戰鬥區游個來回。今天順路打敗一個冠軍！","Or not. Back to swimming.":"看來不行。繼續游吧。","The island in the middle is a good place to rest your arms.":"中間那個小島很適合讓胳膊歇一歇。","Pinch, pinch! My crabs are hungry!":"夾夾夾！我的螃蟹餓了！","Ouch. They pinched me instead.":"哎喲。牠們夾的是我。","Kingler can cut through anything. Except you, it seems.":"巨鉗蟹什麼都能夾斷。看來除了你。","I followed a Lapras out here, and now I cannot find my way back. Battle me while I think!":"我跟著一隻拉普拉斯游到這裡，現在找不到回去的路了。我想辦法的時候，陪我打一場吧！","I think I know the way now. That way. Probably.":"我想我知道路了。往那邊。大概吧。","Lapras carries people across the sea. Mine just carries me.":"拉普拉斯會載人渡海。我的只載我一個。","Delibird has a present for you! It might be a nice one. It might not.":"信使鳥有禮物要送你！也許是好東西。也許不是。","Not a nice one, then. For me.":"看來不是好東西。對我來說。","Mantine glides over the waves. I wish I could.":"巨翅飛魚能在浪上滑翔。真希望我也可以。","The water is cold out here. A battle will warm us up!":"這裡的水好冷。打一場暖暖身吧！","I am warm now. Warm and beaten.":"現在暖和了。暖和，但是輸了。","Sealeo loves cold water. It is the only one of us who does.":"海魔獅最愛冷水了。我們倆裡只有牠喜歡。","My Surskit walks on water. I have to swim. It is not fair!":"我的溜溜糖球能在水上走。我卻得游泳。太不公平了！","This is not fair either!":"這個也不公平！","Route 229 is right there. You can see the flowers from the water.":"229號道路就在那邊。在水裡就能看到花。","A villa by the sea. It has stood empty all season.":"海邊的別墅。整個季節都空著。","The Ribbon Syndicate. Members only.":"緞帶同好會。僅限會員。","The Resort Area. Rest, relax, and leave your battles at the door.":"名勝區。休息、放鬆，把對戰留在門外。","The villa over there has stood empty all season. Someone will move in one day, I am sure of it.":"那邊的別墅整個季節都空著。總有一天會有人搬進去的，我敢肯定。","I came for one night and stayed three weeks. Nobody here is ever in a hurry.":"我本來只想住一晚，結果待了三個星期。這裡誰都不著急。","The water here is warm all year. The swimmers on Route 230 are less friendly, though.":"這裡的海水一年到頭都很暖和。不過230號水路上的游泳選手就沒這麼友好了。","Welcome, welcome! You came all the way from the Survival Area? Then you have seen the whole Battle Zone.":"歡迎歡迎！你是從生存區一路走過來的？那你已經把整個對戰特區都看過了。","This is the Resort Area. People come here to rest after their battles: the villas, the beach, the sound of the sea.":"這裡是名勝區。大家打完仗都來這裡休息：別墅、沙灘，還有海浪聲。","Stay as long as you like. The sea will still be here tomorrow.":"想待多久就待多久。明天海也還在這裡。","The door is locked. A note says the villa is waiting for its owner.":"門鎖著。字條上寫著：別墅在等它的主人。","Your team received the Sinnoh Champ Ribbon!":"你的隊伍得到了神奧冠軍獎章！","{mon} received the {ribbon}!":"{mon}得到了{ribbon}！","Good day. The Ribbon Syndicate is for members only.":"您好。獎章尊享會只對會員開放。","A Trainer may join once one of their Pokémon has earned ten ribbons. The most any of yours has is {n}.":"只要訓練家有一隻寶可夢得到十枚獎章，就能入會。你的寶可夢當中最多的有{n}枚。","A Trainer may join once one of their Pokémon has earned ten ribbons.":"只要訓練家有一隻寶可夢得到十枚獎章，就能入會。","Ten ribbons and more on {mon}! A Pokémon of such standing is always welcome. Please, come in.":"{mon}有十枚以上的獎章！這樣身分的寶可夢永遠受歡迎。請進。","Welcome back to the Ribbon Syndicate.":"歡迎回到獎章尊享會。","Welcome to the Ribbon Syndicate. We offer ribbons of the finest make, for Pokémon of the finest standing.":"歡迎光臨獎章尊享會。我們為身分最尊貴的寶可夢，提供做工最精緻的獎章。","Which Pokémon will wear it?":"要讓哪隻寶可夢佩戴？","Has them all":"已全部擁有","Do come again.":"歡迎再次光臨。","{mon} already wears every ribbon we offer. Splendid!":"{mon}已經佩戴了我們提供的所有獎章。太出色了！","For {mon}, the {ribbon}, at ₽{price}. Shall I wrap it?":"為{mon}準備的是{ribbon}，價格₽{price}。需要為您包起來嗎？","Of course. Take all the time you need.":"當然。請慢慢考慮。","I am afraid that is beyond your means today.":"恐怕您今天的預算不太夠。","Our oils need a full day to warm. Please come back tomorrow.":"我們的精油要一整天才能溫好。請明天再來。","Welcome to the spa. A massage with our special oils makes a Pokémon feel loved.":"歡迎來到水療中心。用我們特製精油按摩，能讓寶可夢感受到被愛。","Shall I give one of your Pokémon a massage?":"要為您的寶可夢按摩嗎？","Which Pokémon?":"哪一隻寶可夢？","{mon} looks wonderfully relaxed. It seems even fonder of you now.":"{mon}看起來非常放鬆。牠好像更喜歡你了。","The Alert Ribbon, for waking up the week with a bright face.":"振奮獎章，送給精神飽滿開始新一週的寶可夢。","The Shock Ribbon, for a heart that still races at surprises.":"心跳獎章，送給遇到驚喜仍會心跳加速的寶可夢。","The Downcast Ribbon, to remember a sad day and grow from it.":"失望獎章，記住難過的日子，並從中成長。","The Careless Ribbon, a reminder to slow down and look around.":"大意獎章，提醒自己放慢腳步，多看看身邊。","The Relax Ribbon, for the easy calm at the end of the week.":"暢快獎章，送給一週結束時輕鬆自在的心情。","The Snooze Ribbon, for the deep, happy sleep of a weekend.":"酣睡獎章，送給週末那種又沉又甜的好覺。","The Smile Ribbon, for a smile that lights up everyone nearby.":"歡笑獎章，送給能讓身邊所有人都開心起來的笑容。","Hello! I am Julia. I can tell how a Pokémon feels just by looking at it, and every day of the week has a feeling of its own.":"你好！我是文子。我只要看一眼就知道寶可夢的心情，而一週的每一天也都有各自的心情。","So I made a ribbon for each day. Come by every day, and your Pokémon can collect all seven!":"所以我為每一天都做了一枚獎章。每天都來的話，你的寶可夢就能集齊七枚！","I have given away today's ribbon already. Come and see me tomorrow!":"今天的獎章已經送出去了。明天再來找我吧！","Who will wear the {ribbon}?":"誰來佩戴{ribbon}？","Has it":"已擁有","Come back any time today!":"今天隨時都可以再來！","{mon} already has the {ribbon}. Maybe another of your Pokémon?":"{mon}已經有{ribbon}了。換一隻寶可夢怎麼樣？","Hard work deserves a reward. Show me a Pokémon you have trained with all your heart!":"努力就該有回報。給我看看你用心訓練的寶可夢吧！","{mon} wears the Effort Ribbon already, and it shows!":"{mon}已經戴著努力獎章了，一看就知道！","{mon} has trained well, but it could grow stronger still. Keep at it!":"{mon}練得不錯，不過還能變得更強。繼續加油！","Oh! {mon} has trained as hard as any Pokémon can. This is for it!":"哇！{mon}已經練到了寶可夢能達到的極限。這是給牠的！","I am Dr. Footstep! One look at a Pokémon's footprints, and I know how it feels about its Trainer.":"我是足跡博士！只要看一眼寶可夢的腳印，就知道牠對訓練家有什麼感覺。","Which Pokémon's footprints?":"要看哪隻寶可夢的腳印？","Come back with footprints to show me!":"下次帶腳印來給我看吧！","These footprints dance! {mon} loves you more than anything in the world.":"這些腳印在跳舞！{mon}愛你勝過世上的一切。","Such footprints deserve a ribbon of their own.":"這樣的腳印，值得一枚專屬的獎章。","Light, happy steps. {mon} loves being with you.":"輕快又開心的腳步。{mon}很喜歡和你在一起。","Steady steps. {mon} is fond of you, and growing fonder.":"穩穩的腳步。{mon}喜歡你，而且越來越喜歡。","Careful steps. {mon} is still getting to know you.":"小心翼翼的腳步。{mon}還在慢慢認識你。","Heavy steps... {mon} keeps its distance. Be kind to it.":"沉重的腳步……{mon}和你保持著距離。要對牠好一點。","Doorman":"門衛","Butler":"管家","Masseuse":"按摩師","The spa is upstairs. A massage there leaves any Pokémon glowing with happiness.":"水療中心在樓上。在那裡按摩過的寶可夢，都會幸福得容光煥發。","Hearthome's Gym Leader is one of us, you know. She says the ribbons on her Pokémon are her proudest decorations.":"家緣市的道館館主也是我們的會員哦。她說她寶可夢身上的獎章，是她最自豪的裝飾。","A Pokémon's ribbons tell its story. The Gorgeous Royal Ribbon tells everyone it is very, very rich.":"寶可夢的獎章訴說著牠的故事。豪華高貴獎章則告訴大家：牠非常、非常有錢。","They say the oils here are made with crushed pearls. My Pokémon has never been so calm.":"聽說這裡的精油是用磨碎的珍珠做的。我的寶可夢從來沒有這麼平靜過。","Alexandra":"亞歷珊德拉","Louis":"路易斯","A breeze blows through the tunnel. Eterna City and Celestic Town are joined again, under the mountain.":"一陣風吹過隧道。百代市和神和鎮又在山底下連在一起了。","My birds ride the wind that comes down off the mountain. Want to see them fly?":"我的鳥兒乘著從山上吹下來的風。想看看牠們飛嗎？","They flew, and they fell.":"飛起來了，又掉下來了。","Birds cannot fly over Mt. Coronet. It is too tall, even for them.":"鳥兒飛不過天冠山。就算是牠們，山也太高了。","Every Hiker in Sinnoh comes to Mt. Coronet sooner or later. Let me test your legs first!":"神奧的登山男遲早都會來天冠山。先讓我考考你的腿力！","Strong legs. Strong Pokémon, too.":"腿力不錯。寶可夢也不錯。","The tunnel goes right through the mountain. Bring something that can break rocks.":"隧道穿過整座山。帶上能打碎岩石的寶可夢吧。","You found my hiding place! A ninja never forgives that!":"你找到了我的藏身處！忍者絕不會原諒這種事！","I will find a better hiding place.":"我要找個更好的藏身處。","I hide here because nobody ever comes this way. Well, nobody used to.":"我藏在這裡，是因為從來沒人走這條路。嗯，以前是沒人走。","Rocks have been falling up ahead all week. I would not go any further if I were you.":"前面這一整個星期都在落石。我要是你，就不再往前走了。","Route 211. East: Mt. Coronet, and through it Celestic Town. West: Eterna City.":"211號道路。東：天冠山，穿過山就是神和鎮。西：百代市。","Jason":"傑森","Melissa":"梅莉莎","Reina":"蕾娜","Bobby":"鮑比","Alex":"亞歷克斯","Caleb":"凱萊布","Allison":"艾莉森","Taylor":"泰勒","Danny":"丹尼","Alexa":"亞歷克莎","Stefano":"斯特凡諾","Shaun":"蕭恩","Belinda":"貝琳達","Emily":"艾米莉","Elena":"埃琳娜","Clare":"克萊爾","Celeste":"塞萊斯特","Welcome, welcome! I am Backlot, and this is my Mansion, the finest house in all of Sinnoh.":"歡迎歡迎！我是現慕，這是我的宅邸，全神奧最氣派的房子。","Behind it lies my Trophy Garden. I walk in it every morning, and every morning I see some Pokémon or other.":"宅邸後面是我的自豪的後院。我每天早上都去散步，每天早上都會看到一些寶可夢。","This morning, {mon} was out in my Trophy Garden! A fine one. Go and look, if you like.":"今天早上我在自豪的後院裡看到了{mon}！好漂亮的一隻。想看的話就去看看吧。","My father owns half of Hearthome. I own this Prinplup. Battle me!":"我爸爸擁有半個家緣市。我擁有這隻波皇子。來對戰吧！","I shall tell my father about this.":"我要告訴我爸爸。","The Mansion over there is bigger than ours. I do not like to talk about it.":"那邊的宅邸比我們家的還大。我不想提這件事。","I am out for a stroll with my Cherubi. Would you care for a little battle?":"我正帶著櫻花寶散步。來一場小小的對戰如何？","Oh my. That was not little at all.":"哎呀。這一點都不小。","Mr. Backlot invites everyone to tea. His garden is lovely in the morning.":"現慕先生會請所有人喝茶。他的院子早上特別美。","My Chatot has learned to say \"battle\". It says it all day long. Very well, battle!":"我的聒噪鳥學會說「對戰」了，一整天都在說。好吧，那就對戰！","Now it is saying \"lost\". Clever bird.":"現在牠在說「輸了」。真是隻聰明的鳥。","A gentleman always walks this road before lunch. It is good for the digestion.":"紳士總在午飯前走這條路。有助於消化。","My Roselia matches my dress. Do try to keep up!":"我的毒薔薇和我的裙子很配。你可要跟上哦！","You have ruined my dress. Well, my battle.":"你弄壞了我的裙子。哦，是我的對戰。","They say it rains all year to the south. I never go there. My shoes, you understand.":"聽說南邊一年到頭都在下雨。我從來不去。你懂的，我的鞋子。","Halt! Routine check. Show me your Pokémon!":"站住！例行檢查。把你的寶可夢拿出來！","Everything is in order. Very much in order.":"一切正常。非常正常。","We patrol this road for the Mansion. A lot of valuable things in there.":"我們在這條路上巡邏，是為了保護那座宅邸。裡面有很多值錢的東西。","You look suspicious. That is, you look like a strong Trainer. Same thing!":"你看起來很可疑。我是說，你看起來是個很強的訓練家。一個意思！","Not suspicious at all. Strong, though.":"一點也不可疑。倒是很強。","If you see anything strange on this road, report it. Or battle it.":"在這條路上看到奇怪的東西，就報警。或者跟它打一場。","Police! Stop right there. A battle is the fastest way to check your papers.":"警察！站住。對戰是檢查證件最快的方法。","Your papers are fine. Your Pokémon are better.":"證件沒問題。寶可夢更沒問題。","My partner and I take turns. One battles, the other writes the report.":"我和搭檔輪流來。一個對戰，一個寫報告。","The south road was underwater for weeks. Now that it is open, I check everyone!":"南邊的路淹了好幾個星期。現在通了，我要檢查每一個人！","Checked, and found strong.":"檢查完畢，結論：很強。","Bring an umbrella. Further south, the rain never stops.":"帶把傘吧。再往南走，雨就沒停過。","A ranger keeps going whatever the weather. Can you?":"巡護員不管天氣怎樣都要前進。你行嗎？","You can. Clearly.":"你行。顯然。","My Monferno hates the rain. It battles twice as hard to get it over with.":"我的猛火猴討厭下雨。牠打得格外賣力，想早點結束。","The marsh is full of Pokémon that love the rain. So are we!":"濕地裡全是喜歡下雨的寶可夢。我們也是！","You are not even wet. How?":"你居然一點都沒淋濕。怎麼做到的？","Leafeon grows faster in the rain. So does the grass. So does everything here.":"葉伊布在雨裡長得更快。草也是。這裡的一切都是。","Careful on the bridges! And careful of me!":"過橋小心！也要小心我！","You were careful. And strong.":"你很小心。也很強。","Carnivine hang from the trees here and wait. Watch your head.":"這裡的尖牙籠掛在樹上等著。小心你的腦袋。","Even in this weather, the law never sleeps. Battle!":"就算天氣這樣，法律也從不休息。對戰！","The law is soaked. And beaten.":"法律淋濕了。還輸了。","I am posted down here as a punishment. Do not ask what I did.":"我是被罰到這裡站崗的。別問我做了什麼。","My parasol keeps the rain off. Nothing keeps my Pokémon off you!":"陽傘能擋雨，可擋不住我的寶可夢！","I stayed dry, but I lost.":"我沒淋濕，可是輸了。","A parasol in the rain? It works for both, you know.":"下雨天打陽傘？晴天雨天都能用嘛。","Nothing bites when it rains this hard. So I bite instead!":"雨這麼大，什麼都不上鉤。那就換我來咬人了！","Not much bite left in me now.":"現在我咬不動了。","Gyarados love the rain. I hooked this one on a day like today.":"暴鯉龍最喜歡下雨。我就是在這樣的天氣釣到牠的。","Two Goldeen, two chances. Let us see!":"兩隻角金魚，兩次機會。來吧！","Two chances, two losses.":"兩次機會，兩次失敗。","The channels are deeper than they look. Surf carefully.":"這些水道比看起來深。衝浪的時候小心點。","Wooper loves puddles, and there are puddles everywhere. We are very happy here!":"烏波最喜歡水坑了，這裡到處都是。我們在這裡好開心！","Still happy. A little less, maybe.":"還是很開心。可能少了一點點。","If you stand still long enough in the marsh, a Wooper will sit on your foot.":"在濕地裡站著不動夠久的話，會有烏波坐到你腳上。","I am measuring the rain. Your battle will make an interesting data point.":"我在測量降雨量。你的對戰會是個有趣的數據。","An outlier! Fascinating.":"異常值！太有意思了。","It has rained here every day for the last three hundred days. I have the numbers.":"這裡過去三百天每天都在下雨。我有數據為證。","Electricity and water! Science says this is a bad idea. Let us test it!":"電和水！科學說這是個壞主意。來驗證一下吧！","The experiment failed. Science is satisfied.":"實驗失敗了。科學很滿意。","Do not try what I just did at home.":"我剛才做的事，千萬別在家裡嘗試。","Barboach! Barboach! Barboach! And one Gyarados, for luck!":"泥泥鰍！泥泥鰍！泥泥鰍！再加一隻暴鯉龍，討個吉利！","Not so lucky, then.":"看來也沒那麼吉利。","Barboach live in the mud. That is why they like this place.":"泥泥鰍住在泥裡。所以牠們喜歡這裡。","One for the day and one for the night. A collector needs both!":"一隻白天的，一隻晚上的。收藏家兩隻都得有！","My collection lost. It is still a very nice collection.":"我的收藏輸了。但還是很棒的收藏。","Eevee can become many things. I want them all. My wallet does not.":"伊布能進化成好多種。我全都想要。我的錢包可不想。","I guard this statue day and night. Mostly day. Nobody has tried to steal it yet.":"我日夜守著這座雕像。主要是白天。還沒有人想偷它。","Welcome to the Pokémon Mansion. The maids enjoy a battle, if you have the time. The young master and the young lady prefer to watch.":"歡迎光臨寶可夢屋。有空的話，女僕們很樂意和您對戰。少爺和小姐更喜歡在旁邊看。","A statue of a Pokémon nobody has ever seen. Mr. Backlot had it made from a picture in an old book.":"一座誰都沒見過的寶可夢的雕像。現慕先生照著一本舊書裡的圖畫請人做的。","Welcome, Master Trainer! May I offer you a battle with your tea?":"歡迎光臨，訓練家大人！要來一場對戰配茶嗎？","Thank you for the lesson.":"謝謝您的指教。","Our Clefairy all know Metronome. Anything can happen!":"我們的皮皮都會揮指。什麼都可能發生！","The second course is a battle. Please enjoy!":"第二道菜是對戰。請慢用！","I hope it was to your taste.":"希望合您的口味。","The young master is watching from upstairs. He loves a good battle.":"少爺在樓上看著。他最喜歡精彩的對戰了。","I have just finished the dusting. Now, a battle!":"我剛打掃完灰塵。現在，來對戰！","Everything is clean, and I am beaten.":"屋子乾淨了，我也輸了。","Encore! That is what Clefairy says when it likes something.":"再來一次！皮皮喜歡什麼的時候就會這麼說。","Only the finest battles in this house. Shall we?":"這座宅邸裡只有最高級的對戰。我們開始吧？","Very fine indeed.":"確實很高級。","There is one more of us. She is the strongest.":"我們還有一位。她是最強的。","I am the head maid. If you beat me, the young master and the young lady wish to meet you.":"我是女僕長。如果您贏了我，少爺和小姐想見見您。","Splendid. I shall tell them at once.":"太精彩了。我這就去告訴他們。","They are waiting for you in the hall. Do go and see them.":"他們在大廳等您。請過去吧。","You beat all five of our maids! Now you must battle my Blissey. It is only fair.":"你打敗了我們家的五位女僕！現在你得和我的幸福蛋對戰。這才公平。","My Blissey is the happiest Blissey in Sinnoh, even when it loses.":"我的幸福蛋是神奧最幸福的幸福蛋，輸了也一樣。","Come back any time. The maids always want another battle.":"隨時再來。女僕們總想再打一場。","The maids say you are very strong. My Blissey and I would like to see for ourselves.":"女僕們說你很強。我和我的幸福蛋想親眼看看。","How exciting! Nobody ever beats my Blissey.":"好刺激！從來沒有人贏過我的幸福蛋。","Father says I may have a battle every day, as long as I finish my lessons.":"爸爸說只要我做完功課，每天都可以對戰。","Mr. Backlot walks here every morning. Whatever he sees, he tells everyone about. Then it is my job to find it again.":"現慕先生每天早上都來這裡散步。他看到什麼都會告訴大家。然後我就得負責再找到它。","Route 212. North: Hearthome City. South: Pastoria City.":"212號道路。北：家緣市。南：濕原市。","The Pokémon Mansion. The home of Mr. Backlot. Visitors welcome, Pokémon most welcome.":"寶可夢屋。現慕先生的宅邸。歡迎來訪，更歡迎寶可夢。","Route 212. East: Pastoria City. Mind the rain, and the marsh.":"212號道路。東：濕原市。小心雨和濕地。","Route 212. West: Hearthome City, past the Pokémon Mansion.":"212號道路。西：家緣市，要經過寶可夢屋。","Welcome to Pal Park! Pokémon brought here from faraway lands run free in the park, and Trainers may catch them.":"歡迎來到夥伴公園！從遙遠的地方帶來的寶可夢會在園裡自由奔跑，訓練家可以捕捉牠們。","...But no Pokémon from faraway lands have arrived yet, so the park is not open. We are very sorry!":"……不過，還沒有從遙遠地方來的寶可夢，所以公園還沒開放。非常抱歉！","Trenton":"特倫頓","My float and me can go anywhere! Even to a battle!":"我和我的游泳圈哪裡都能去！連對戰也能去！","My float sprang a leak...":"我的游泳圈漏氣了……","The sea goes on and on down there. Grown-ups swim all the way to the next beach.":"往那邊，海一直一直延伸下去。大人們會一路游到下一片沙灘。","Mariel":"瑪麗爾","This sandbar is my secret island. You have to battle to visit!":"這片沙洲是我的秘密小島。想來玩就得先對戰！","Okay, you can visit. Just this once.":"好吧，你可以來玩。就這一次哦。","Marill and I build sandcastles here every day. The waves always win in the end.":"我和瑪力露每天都在這裡堆沙堡。最後總是被海浪沖掉。","I swim from Sandgem to Route 221 and back every morning. Today you are my warm-up!":"我每天早上都從真砂鎮游到221號道路再游回來。今天就拿你來熱身！","I need a longer warm-up.":"看來我得多熱身一會兒。","Swim east, and you will reach land. Then you can rest your Pokémon.":"往東游就能上岸。到時候可以讓你的寶可夢休息一下。","Vincent":"文森特","Out here, nobody can hear you lose. Shall we?":"在這片海上，沒人聽得到你輸掉的聲音。來吧？","Well, at least nobody heard that.":"唉，至少沒人聽到。","The islands out here are tiny, but people leave all kinds of things on them.":"這附近的小島都很小，可是總有人在上面留下各種東西。","A whole school of Goldeen! Can you keep up with us?":"一整群角金魚！你跟得上我們嗎？","We scattered like a school of fish.":"我們像魚群一樣被沖散了。","Goldeen love the warm water around the islands.":"角金魚最喜歡小島周圍溫暖的海水。","Erica":"艾麗卡","My Finneon glows at night. In the daytime, it battles!":"我的螢光魚晚上會發光。白天嘛，就來對戰！","Not even a glimmer of a chance.":"連一絲希望的微光都沒有。","Finneon swim in pairs. I am still looking for a second one.":"螢光魚都是成雙成對地游。我還在找第二隻。","Adrian":"阿德里安","Remoraid can shoot water like a cannon. Want to see?":"鐵炮魚能像大砲一樣噴水。想看看嗎？","Missed every shot!":"一發都沒打中！","Octillery grabbed my leg once. We have been friends ever since.":"有一次章魚桶纏住了我的腿。從那以後我們就成了朋友。","Katelyn":"凱特琳","My Medicham meditates on the waves. Do not break its focus!":"我的恰雷姆在浪上冥想。別打斷牠！","Its focus broke. So did mine.":"牠的專注被打斷了。我也是。","Medicham cannot swim, but it floats very calmly.":"恰雷姆不會游泳，可是浮得很平靜。","Claire":"克萊爾","Floatzel and I race the boats out here. Race me instead!":"我和浮潛鼬常在這裡跟船比賽。來跟我比吧！","You win the race. By a lot.":"比賽你贏了。贏了好多。","Route 221 is just ahead. There is a park at the end of it.":"前面就是221號道路。路的盡頭有一座公園。","Last stretch before the beach! Let us make it count!":"離沙灘只剩最後一段了！好好打一場吧！","I will float the rest of the way.":"剩下的路我就漂過去吧。","Fishermen line the beach here. Mind their lines.":"這片沙灘上都是釣魚的人。小心他們的魚線。","Vanessa":"瓦妮莎","Golduck taught me to swim. Now it teaches Trainers to lose!":"哥達鴨教會了我游泳。現在牠要教訓練家怎麼輸！","Golduck is holding its head. So am I.":"哥達鴨抱著頭。我也是。","Golduck always gets a headache when it battles. It still loves it.":"哥達鴨一對戰就頭痛。可牠還是很喜歡對戰。","Cory":"科里","Three Finneon on one line! Now watch them battle!":"一根魚線釣到三隻螢光魚！現在看牠們對戰吧！","They all got away from me...":"全都從我手裡溜走了……","With a good rod you can catch Finneon here. With a super rod, something much bigger.":"用好釣竿能在這裡釣到螢光魚。用厲害釣竿的話，能釣到大得多的傢伙。","My Togetic is the rarest thing in my collection. Want a closer look?":"我的波克基古是我收藏裡最稀有的。想近一點看看嗎？","A rare loss, too.":"這場敗仗也很稀有。","They say Pokémon from faraway lands come to the park at the end of this road. I am waiting at the gate!":"聽說從遙遠地方來的寶可夢會到這條路盡頭的公園。我要在大門口等著！","Jake":"傑克","I came all this way to train where nobody bothers me. You will do, though!":"我大老遠跑來，就是想在沒人打擾的地方修行。不過你來得正好！","That is the kind of battle I came for.":"我就是為了這種對戰才來的。","Staraptor and Girafarig make a strange pair. That is why they work.":"姆克鷹和麒麟奇是奇怪的組合。所以才合得來。","Shannon":"香農","The flowers here are lovely, and so is my team. Let me show you!":"這裡的花很美，我的隊伍也一樣。讓我給你看看！","Lovely, and beaten.":"美麗，但輸了。","Cherrim opens up whenever the sun comes out. Today it stayed shut.":"櫻花兒只要出太陽就會綻放。今天牠一直合著。","I brought my Pokémon all the way from another land to see the park. It seems I am a little early.":"我特地帶著寶可夢從別的地方來看這座公園。看來我來得早了點。","Route 221. East: Pal Park.":"221號道路。東：夥伴公園。","Micah & Brandi":"米卡和布蘭迪","Desiree & Landon":"德西蕾和蘭登","Deandre & Kendra":"迪安德烈和肯德拉","Eddie & Willie":"埃迪和威利","Terrell":"特雷爾","Clarice":"克拉麗斯","Brenden":"布倫登","Ruben":"魯本","Maxwell":"麥克斯韋","Armando":"阿曼多","...You are the Champion. I am Marley. I want to see the stone at the end of Route 224.":"……你是冠軍吧。我是米依。我想去看224號道路盡頭的石碑。","The fog out there is thick, and my Arcanine cannot clear it. I would rather not go alone. May I come with you?":"外面的霧很濃，我的風速狗沒辦法把霧吹散。我不太想一個人去。可以和你一起走嗎？","The Trainers in here like to battle in pairs. Arcanine and I will fight beside you, and I will see to your team.":"這裡的訓練家喜歡兩人一組對戰。我和風速狗會在你身邊一起戰鬥，也會照顧你的隊伍。","Arcanine knows the way by smell. I just follow Arcanine. And you.":"風速狗是靠鼻子認路的。我只要跟著風速狗。還有你。","Marley looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"米依照顧了你的寶可夢。牠們完全恢復了！","So this is the stone. They say a Pokémon covered in flowers comes here to give thanks.":"這就是那塊石碑啊。聽說有一隻全身開滿花的寶可夢會來這裡表達感謝。","I do not see it. Maybe it only comes when nobody is looking. ...That is all right.":"沒看到牠。也許牠只在沒人看的時候才來。……沒關係。","Thank you for walking with me. Sometimes I battle at the Battleground in the Survival Area. Come and find me.":"謝謝你陪我走這一趟。我有時會在生存區的對決場對戰。來找我吧。","Only Champions come this way. Let us see if you two deserve to!":"只有冠軍才會來這裡。看看你們兩個配不配！","You deserve it. Both of you.":"你們配。兩個都配。","The road east comes out by the sea. It is always foggy there.":"往東的路出去就是海邊。那裡總是有霧。","I have walked these caves since before the League was built. Show me what the new Champion can do.":"聯盟建起來之前，我就在這些洞窟裡走了。讓我看看新冠軍有多大本事。","The new Champion can do a great deal.":"新冠軍果然本事不小。","There is a stone at the end of Route 224. Nobody knows who carved it.":"224號道路盡頭有一塊石碑。沒人知道是誰刻的。","We saw two Trainers coming in our dreams. Here you are!":"我們在夢裡看到有兩位訓練家要來。你們來了！","Our dreams did not show us losing.":"夢裡可沒看到我們會輸。","The girl with you has a gentle mind. She worries more than she says.":"跟你一起的女孩心思很溫柔。她擔心的比她說出口的多。","I train here because nobody bothers me. You are bothering me. Battle!":"我在這裡修行，就是因為沒人打擾。你在打擾我。對戰！","Fine. Go on. Stop bothering me.":"好吧。走吧。別再打擾我了。","The exit area is ahead. More Trainers who want to be left alone.":"前面就是出口那一片。還有更多想清靜的訓練家。","A Champion in my training spot? Then it is a good day for a hard battle.":"冠軍跑到我修行的地方來了？那今天正適合打一場硬仗。","Hard, and short.":"硬仗，而且很短。","Magnezone loves this cave. All this metal in the rocks.":"自爆磁怪最喜歡這個洞窟了。岩石裡全是金屬。","Ghosts love the dark at the end of a cave. So do we.":"幽靈最喜歡洞窟深處的黑暗。我們也是。","The ghosts fled. So will we.":"幽靈逃走了。我們也要溜了。","Outside, the fog will feel like home to our Pokémon.":"到了外面，那片霧會讓我們的寶可夢像回到家一樣。","Two fists, two Trainers, two Pokémon! Hyah!":"兩隻拳頭，兩個訓練家，兩隻寶可夢！嘿呀！","Two losses. Hyah...":"兩場敗仗。嘿呀……","We train in the dark so we can fight blind. It is harder than it sounds.":"我們在黑暗裡修行，好練成閉著眼也能打。比聽起來難多了。","My birds flew in here and will not fly out. So I battle whoever comes by!":"我的鳥兒飛進來就不肯出去了。所以誰路過我就跟誰打！","Maybe they stay because of Trainers like you.":"也許牠們是為了你這樣的訓練家才留下的。","Murkrow likes shiny things. Watch your Badges.":"黑暗鴉喜歡亮晶晶的東西。看好你的徽章。","Dragons grow up in caves like this one. Mine are nearly grown!":"龍就是在這樣的洞窟裡長大的。我的龍快長大了！","Nearly is not enough, it seems.":"看來快長大還不夠。","One day my Gabite will be a Garchomp. Then we will talk again.":"總有一天我的尖牙陸鯊會變成烈咬陸鯊。到時候再說。","The last Trainer before the sea. Let me be a good memory of this cave.":"出海前的最後一位訓練家。讓我成為你對這個洞窟的美好回憶吧。","A good memory indeed.":"確實是美好的回憶。","Out there it is Route 224. Mind the fog, and mind the edge of the water.":"外面就是224號道路。小心霧，也小心水邊。","I came out here to see the stone, and got lost in the fog. A battle will clear my head!":"我是來看石碑的，結果在霧裡迷路了。打一場讓我清醒清醒！","My head is clear. My team is not.":"我是清醒了。我的隊伍可沒有。","Follow the road north. The stone is at the very end.":"沿著路往北走。石碑就在最盡頭。","I can see through the fog with my mind. I saw you coming!":"我能用心靈看穿濃霧。我早就看到你來了！","I did not see that, though.":"不過這個我沒看到。","Something gentle lives beyond the stone. I can feel it, but I cannot reach it.":"石碑那邊住著一個溫柔的存在。我感覺得到，卻夠不著。","I come here every year to read the stone. Every year someone challenges me on the way.":"我每年都來讀這塊石碑。每年都有人在半路上向我挑戰。","And every year I lose. It is a tradition now.":"然後每年都輸。現在都成傳統了。","The words on the stone are about thanks. Thanks for what, nobody agrees.":"石碑上的字是關於感謝的。至於感謝什麼，大家說法不一。","That stone is older than the League! I have been studying it for years!":"那塊石碑比聯盟還古老！我研究它好多年了！","Years of study, and one battle undoes me.":"研究了這麼多年，一場對戰就把我打垮了。","My Aerodactyl came out of an old Fossil. Old things are the best things.":"我的化石翼龍是從一塊古老的化石裡復活的。老東西才是好東西。","The last stretch to the stone. A Dragon Tamer guards it, at least today!":"到石碑的最後一段路。至少今天，由馴龍師來把守！","Go on, then. The stone is all yours.":"去吧。石碑歸你了。","Read the stone, then go home. That is how it works out here.":"讀完石碑就回家。這裡的規矩就是這樣。","A great white stone stands at the end of the road. Words are carved into it, worn almost smooth: \"Give thanks to the land, and the land gives back.\"":"路的盡頭立著一塊巨大的白色石碑。上面刻著幾乎被磨平的字：「感謝大地，大地便會回報。」","Now then, {player}. Your Pokédex, if you please.":"那麼，{player}，請把你的圖鑑給我。","...There. It will record the Pokémon of Sinnoh as well. Many of them evolve in ways you will not have seen before.":"……好了。現在它也能記錄神奧的寶可夢了。很多寶可夢的進化方式你恐怕從沒見過。","Hi! I am {assistant}, the professor's assistant. I help him by studying Pokémon all over Sinnoh.":"你好！我是博士的助手{assistant}。我在神奧各地研究寶可夢，幫博士的忙。","These are for you. You will need them to catch the Pokémon of Sinnoh!":"這些送給你。要抓神奧的寶可夢，少不了它們！","And I am off! I am going to see everything in Sinnoh before you do, {player}!":"那我先走啦！我要比你先看遍整個神奧，{player}！","North of Sandgem, Route 202 leads to Jubilife City. Once the road is cleared, your journey through Sinnoh begins there.":"真砂鎮北邊的202號道路通往祝慶市。等道路清理好了，你的神奧之旅就從那裡開始。","Sinnoh has Pokémon found nowhere else, and many that evolve in ways seen nowhere else. Study them well.":"神奧有別處見不到的寶可夢，也有很多以別處見不到的方式進化的寶可夢。好好研究吧。","And remember: Pokémon from other regions listen to you only up to the level your Sinnoh badges allow.":"還有，記住：來自其他地區的寶可夢，只會在你的神奧徽章允許的等級以內聽你的話。","The ship sails back south to Lilycove City in Hoenn. Would you like to go?":"這艘船會往南開回豐緣的水靜市。你要去嗎？","The ship sounded its horn and put out to sea.":"船鳴響汽笛，駛向了大海。","The ship sailed south for days and nights...":"船日夜不停地向南航行……","Professor Rowan? He left for Lake Verity early this morning, with his assistant.":"七灶博士？他今天一大早就帶著助手去心齊湖了。","Take Route 201 west out of town. The lake is at the far end of the route, past the way down to Twinleaf Town.":"出了鎮子往西走201號道路。湖就在道路的盡頭，過了往雙葉鎮的岔路就是。","Oh, and you will be staying in Twinleaf, with Barry's family. The professor arranged it all.":"對了，你會住在雙葉鎮的阿馴家。博士都安排好了。","The professor says a Pokédex is filled one meeting at a time. Let's both fill ours!":"博士說，圖鑑要靠一次次的相遇慢慢填滿。我們一起努力吧！","Prof. Rowan":"七灶博士","A tree came down across the road to Jubilife City in last night's storm. We are clearing it as fast as we can!":"昨晚的暴風雨把一棵樹颳倒在通往祝慶市的路上了。我們正在盡快清理！","Professor Rowan studies how Pokémon evolve. He looks stern, but nobody in Sinnoh cares more about Pokémon.":"七灶博士在研究寶可夢的進化。他看起來很嚴肅，但在神奧沒有人比他更愛護寶可夢。","The sea south of town is Route 219. The Pokémon that swim out there are a lot tougher than the ones on land.":"鎮子南邊的海是219號水路。在那裡游泳的寶可夢比陸地上的厲害多了。","The PCs in Sinnoh reach the same storage system as everywhere else. Your boxes are right where you left them.":"神奧的電腦也連著同一個存儲系統。你的盒子都還在原來的地方。","With the road north closed, the whole town is in here stocking up while we wait.":"北邊的路封了，全鎮的人都跑來這裡囤東西，一邊等著通路。","People in Sinnoh say three Pokémon sleep in three lakes. One of them is Lake Verity, just west of here.":"神奧流傳著三隻寶可夢沉睡在三座湖裡的說法。其中一座就是這裡西邊的心齊湖。","Professor Rowan frowns at everybody. But my Bidoof runs to him every time he walks past!":"七灶博士對誰都板著臉。可是每次他經過，我的大牙狸都會跑到他身邊！","Sandgem Town. A town that smells of the sea and the sand.":"真砂鎮。飄著海水與沙子氣味的小鎮。","Research notes: \"Some Pokémon evolve only beside a Trainer they trust. What is it that they feel?\"":"研究筆記：「有些寶可夢只有待在信任的訓練家身邊才會進化。牠們感受到的究竟是什麼？」","{player}! Cynthia was here, and she has told me all of it. A world behind our own, and you walked through it.":"{player}！竹蘭來過了，全都告訴我了。我們世界背後的世界，你竟然走了一趟。","In all my years I never thought to see the old stories proved. I shall be writing about this for the rest of my life.":"我這一輩子都沒想到能看到古老的傳說得到證實。這件事夠我寫到老了。","Team Galactic is finished, and the quakes around Mt. Coronet have stopped. I have told them to open the road east of Valor Lakefront again.":"銀河隊已經完了，天冠山一帶的地震也停了。我已經請他們重新開放立志湖畔東邊的路。","Sunyshore City lies at the end of it, and with it the last Gym in Sinnoh. Go on, then. There is still a journey to finish.":"路的盡頭是濱海市，那裡有神奧最後一個道館。去吧。你的旅程還沒有結束。","Hm! The Champion of Sinnoh, in my lab. Let me have a look at that Pokédex of yours.":"嗯！神奧的冠軍來我的研究所了。讓我看看你的圖鑑。","As I thought. Pokémon from Kanto to Sinnoh, all in one little machine. It has outgrown any one region.":"果然。從關都到神奧的寶可夢，全在這台小機器裡。一個地區已經裝不下它了。","{player}'s Pokédex was upgraded to the National Pokédex! It now lists every Pokémon known.":"{player}的圖鑑升級成了全國圖鑑！現在所有已知的寶可夢都會列出來。","Now listen. {uxie}, {mesprit} and {azelf} have gone home to their lakes, and each has a cave there. Lake Valor's you can walk to. For the other two you will have to Surf.":"聽好。{uxie}、{mesprit}和{azelf}都回到了各自的湖，每個湖都有一個洞穴。立志湖的走路就能到，另外兩個要用衝浪。","And the elder of Celestic Town has been asking for you. Something to do with the Spear Pillar. Do not keep her waiting.":"還有，神和鎮的長老一直在找你，好像和槍之柱有關。別讓她等太久。","{player}! Do you remember Jubilife City, when those two grunts would not leave me alone? We battled them side by side.":"{player}！你還記得在祝慶市，那兩個手下一直纏著我不放的時候嗎？我們並肩打敗了他們。","Since then you have battled beside so many people, and you became the Champion. I am proud I was your first partner!":"從那以後，你和好多人並肩作戰過，還成為了冠軍。我很驕傲自己是你第一個並肩作戰的夥伴！","One thing more. A Pokédex that has outgrown Sinnoh deserves a better way to fill it. Take this.":"還有一件事。一本已經超出神奧範圍的圖鑑，值得用更好的方法來填滿。收下這個吧。","Stand in tall grass and switch it on, and the grass around you will shake. Walk into a shaking patch and a Pokémon will be there.":"站在高草叢裡打開它，周圍的草叢就會搖晃。走進搖晃的草叢，就會有寶可夢在那裡等著。","Beat it or catch it, and new patches shake. Keep meeting the same kind and the chain grows. Some say a long chain turns up Pokémon of unusual colors.":"打倒或抓住它之後，又會有別的草叢搖晃。一直遇到同一種寶可夢，連鎖就會越來越長。聽說連鎖夠長，就會遇到顏色與眾不同的寶可夢。","Its battery charges as you walk: fifty steps between uses. Run away, or wander off, and the chain is broken.":"電池會在你走路時充電：每用一次要走五十步。逃跑或走遠了，連鎖就會中斷。","Is that all? You talk a lot for somebody so easy to beat.":"就這點本事？這麼容易就輸了，話倒是挺多。","Oh, it is you. I remember you from our building in Eterna. You have come all this way for nothing.":"哦，是你啊。我記得你，在百代市我們的大樓裡見過。你白跑這一趟了。","Uxie is already ours, the last of the three. Our boss will be very pleased.":"由克希已經是我們的了，三隻之中的最後一隻。老大一定會很滿意。","If you want to complain, you know where Veilstone is. I would not bother, if I were you.":"想抱怨的話，你知道帷幕市在哪裡。換作是我，就不會白費力氣。","Team Galactic left Lake Acuity, and took Uxie with them.":"銀河隊離開了睿智湖，把由克希也帶走了。","I could not wait for you, so I climbed the slope the hard way and ran straight into her.":"我等不及你，就硬是爬上了坡，結果正好撞上她。","And I lost. I said I would protect this lake, and I lost.":"然後我輸了。我說過要保護這座湖，卻輸了。","I am not strong enough yet. I am going away to train, {player}. Next time I see that Commander, I will win!":"我還不夠強。{player}，我要去修行了。下次再見到那個幹部，我一定會贏！","When you focus with your whole heart, even a blizzard feels warm. Now go and see what is going on at the lake!":"只要全心全意地集中精神，連暴風雪都會覺得溫暖。快去看看湖那邊發生了什麼吧！","A clear mind can copy any good idea. That is all Psych Up is.":"頭腦清醒，就能學來任何好主意。自我暗示就是這麼回事。","I came here to clear my mind, and I have found that I do not need this any more. Take it.":"我來這裡是為了讓頭腦清醒，現在發現已經用不上這個了。你拿去吧。","TM77 is Psych Up. It copies every stat change the foe has made.":"招式學習器77是自我暗示。牠能複製對手所有的能力變化。","You look frozen, dear! Sit by the fire for a while.":"孩子，你都凍僵了！來爐火邊坐一會兒吧。","There, all warm again. Come back whenever the cold gets to you.":"好了，又暖和起來了。覺得冷的時候隨時回來。","There you are, {player}! Took you long enough! Look at this slope: Lake Acuity is right up there!":"{player}，你總算來了！太慢了！看這道坡，睿智湖就在上面！","But the people around here say nobody gets up without the badge from the Snowpoint Gym. The town is just east of here.":"可是這裡的人說，沒有雪峰市道館的徽章就上不去。雪峰市就在東邊。","So go and win it! I will keep watch here. Nobody gets past me!":"所以快去贏下來吧！我在這裡守著，誰也別想過去！","The Gym is just east of here! Go on, I will keep watch on the slope.":"道館就在東邊！快去，這道坡我來守著。","Hey there, future Champion! Candice uses Ice Pokémon, and her Gym is all ice.":"嗨，未來的冠軍！小菘使用冰屬性寶可夢，她的道館也全是冰。","On the ice you slide until something stops you. Use the rocks to stop in the right place.":"在冰上會一直滑，直到被什麼東西擋住。利用岩石停在正確的位置吧。","Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel moves are what you want. Her Froslass is part Ghost, though, so Normal and Fighting moves do nothing to it.":"火、格鬥、岩石和鋼屬性的招式最有效。不過她的雪妖女也是幽靈屬性，一般和格鬥招式對牠沒用。","Up to level 60, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"在這裡，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢在60級以下都會聽你的話。","What focus! The Icicle Badge is yours.":"好專注！冰柱徽章是你的了。","{player} received the Icicle Badge from Candice!":"{player}從小菘那裡得到了冰柱徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 70 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，70級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算來自其他地區也一樣。","And take TM72, Avalanche. It hits twice as hard when the foe has already hurt the user that turn!":"再收下招式學習器72，雪崩。如果這回合已經被對手打傷，威力就會加倍！","With that badge you can go up the slope to Lake Acuity. People say they have seen strange grey uniforms up there.":"有了這枚徽章，你就能爬上坡去睿智湖了。聽說有人在那裡看到了奇怪的灰色制服。","Katherine":"凱瑟琳","My Noctowl sees everything on this road, day or night!":"我的貓頭夜鷹不分晝夜，這條路上什麼都看得見！","The birds here will not fly over the mountain. It is too high, even for them.":"這裡的鳥不會飛過那座山。對牠們來說也太高了。","Nick":"尼克","You did not see me! That is the whole point of being a ninja!":"你沒看見我吧！這就是忍者的意義！","Poison is the ninja way. Nobody sees it coming.":"毒就是忍者之道。誰也防不住。","Sean":"肖恩","I climb this road every morning. It builds strong legs!":"我每天早上都爬這條路。腿都練結實了！","My legs were fine. It was the rest of me.":"腿倒是沒問題。問題出在其他地方。","The cold on the far side of the mountain is good training, too.":"山那一邊的嚴寒也是很好的修行。","Bronzor were found in old tombs. I want to know why!":"有人在古墓裡發現過銅鏡怪。我想知道為什麼！","History repeats itself. So do my losses.":"歷史會重演，我的失敗也會。","The ruins in Celestic Town are the oldest I have ever seen.":"神和鎮的遺跡是我見過最古老的。","Bradley":"布拉德利","Fresh snow, and nobody on the slope but me!":"新雪！整條雪道都是我的！","I hit a tree. A very strong tree.":"我撞到樹了。一棵很強的樹。","All three of my Pokémon love the hail. Yours? Not so much.":"我的三隻寶可夢都喜歡冰雹。你的嘛，就不一定了。","Kaitlyn":"凱特琳","I can ski and battle at the same time. Watch!":"我能一邊滑雪一邊對戰。看好了！","Maybe not at the same time.":"看來還是不能同時做。","Snover grow tall on the snowfields around here.":"雪笠怪在這一帶的雪原上長得很高。","Philip":"菲利普","I train in the snow with bare feet. Feel my spirit!":"我光著腳在雪地裡修行。感受我的鬥志吧！","My spirit is fine. My feet are not.":"鬥志還在，腳不行了。","There is a lodge to the west, if you are cold. I am not. Not at all.":"覺得冷的話，西邊有間小屋。我可不冷。一點也不。","Blake":"布萊克","Only strong Trainers come this far north. Let us see about you.":"只有強大的訓練家才會來到這麼北邊。讓我看看你的實力。","The Gym in Snowpoint is no easier than this road.":"雪峰市的道館可不比這條路輕鬆。","My Tropius came from somewhere warm. It has grown tough here!":"我的熱帶龍來自溫暖的地方。在這裡牠變得很堅強！","It will want some fruit after that.":"這下牠要吃點水果了。","Tropius has never once complained about the snow.":"熱帶龍從來沒有抱怨過下雪。","Garrett":"加勒特","A team with no weak point. Go on, try and find one!":"一支沒有弱點的隊伍。來吧，試著找找看！","You found three.":"你找到了三個。","North of here the snow gets so thick you can hardly see.":"再往北，雪大得幾乎看不見路。","Fire, water and rock, right here in the snow. Ready?":"火、水和岩石，就在這片雪地上。準備好了嗎？","You were ready.":"看來你準備得很充分。","A balanced team is the best way to get through the north.":"想穿過北方，最好帶一支均衡的隊伍。","Three Snover! I named them Left, Right and Down the Hill!":"三隻雪笠怪！我給牠們取名叫左轉、右轉和衝下山！","All three went down the hill.":"三隻都衝下山了。","On a good day you can ski from here all the way to the lake.":"天氣好的時候，可以從這裡一路滑到湖邊。","Lexie":"萊克西","This is my mountain. Lost in the snow? Too bad!":"這是我的地盤。在雪裡迷路了？真可惜！","Glaceon can freeze the air around it. It is the perfect friend for a long winter.":"冰伊布能把周圍的空氣凍住。漫長的冬天有牠陪伴最好不過了。","Bjorn":"比約恩","Nobody comes up here! Finally, somebody to battle!":"這裡從來沒人來！終於有對手了！","I should have asked you to wait a bit.":"早知道就讓你等一下了。","Snowpoint City is just past the lakefront. You are nearly there.":"過了睿智湖畔就是雪峰市。你快到了。","Snowpoint Temple lies beyond this point. It is older than the town, and only the Gym Leader may go inside.":"再往前就是雪峰神殿。它比這座城市還古老，只有道館館主才能進去。","Our Gym Leader is the coolest person in Sinnoh. Get it? Coolest?":"我們的館主是神奧最酷的人。酷……懂了嗎？很冷的那種酷！","Up the slope from the lakefront there is a lake. Nobody goes up without the Gym badge.":"湖畔的坡上面有一座湖。沒有道館徽章的人是上不去的。","In hail, every Pokémon that is not an Ice type loses a little HP each turn. Ice types do not mind it at all!":"下冰雹時，除了冰屬性以外的寶可夢每回合都會損失一點HP。冰屬性完全不在乎！","Ice Heal is the best seller up here, for some reason.":"不知為什麼，這裡賣得最好的是解凍藥。","Ships from here go to a far island, but only for the very strongest Trainers.":"從這裡有船開往遙遠的小島，不過只載最強的訓練家。","My grandchildren have never seen the ground in this town. Only snow.":"我的孫子們從沒見過這座城市的地面，只見過雪。","Sergio":"塞爾吉奧","Sliding on the ice is the easy part. Now try me!":"在冰上滑還算簡單。現在來試試我吧！","I slipped up.":"我滑倒了。","Rocks stop you on the ice. Look for the one you need before you move.":"岩石能讓你在冰上停下來。動之前先找好需要的那塊。","Brenna":"布倫娜","Candice told me to focus, so I am focusing on you!":"小菘叫我集中精神，所以我要集中對付你！","I lost my focus.":"我分心了。","Every morning we all polish the ice for Candice.":"每天早上，我們都要幫小菘把冰打磨一遍。","My Sneasel are quick on the ice. Can you keep up?":"我的狃拉在冰上很快。你跟得上嗎？","You kept up.":"你跟上了。","If you fall back down, just climb up again. Nobody stays stuck here.":"滑回去了就再上來。在這裡沒有人會被困住。","Savannah":"薩凡納","Snorunt, Snorunt and Glalie: my frozen family!":"雪童子、雪童子和冰鬼護：我的冰凍一家人！","The family has melted.":"一家人都融化了。","Snorunt live in caves full of snow. They are shy, but mine are not.":"雪童子住在積滿雪的洞窟裡。牠們很怕生，不過我的不會。","You crossed all the ice. But Candice is behind me!":"你穿過了所有的冰。但小菘就在我身後！","My tusks were not enough.":"我的獠牙還不夠。","Candice is ready for you. Good luck!":"小菘已經準備好了。祝你好運！","Anton":"安東","Glalie froze a whole lake once. Well, a pond. A puddle!":"冰鬼護曾經凍住一整座湖。呃，一個池塘。一個水坑！","Not even a puddle.":"連水坑都沒凍住。","Ice is weak to Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel, but it hits Grass, Ground, Flying and Dragon hard.":"冰怕火、格鬥、岩石和鋼，但對草、地面、飛行和龍很有效。","Welcome to the coldest Gym in Sinnoh! I am Candice. I put my whole heart into everything: the ice, my Pokémon, even my scarf! Focus, now. Here we go!":"歡迎來到神奧最冷的道館！我是小菘。無論是冰、寶可夢，還是我的圍巾，我都全心投入！集中精神，我們開始吧！","Wow! You kept your head the whole way through!":"哇！你從頭到尾都沒有亂了陣腳！","Route 211. West: Mt. Coronet. East: Celestic Town.":"211號道路。西：天冠山。東：神和鎮。","Route 216. West, then north: Route 217. Hail is falling, so take care in battle!":"216號道路。往西再往北：217號道路。正在下冰雹，對戰時請小心！","A lodge for travellers. Come in and get warm!":"旅人小屋。請進來暖暖身子！","Route 217. North: Acuity Lakefront. South: Route 216.":"217號道路。北：睿智湖畔。南：216號道路。","North: Lake Acuity. East: Snowpoint City.":"北：睿智湖。東：雪峰市。","Lake Acuity. Its waters are said to be the home of a spirit of knowledge.":"睿智湖。傳說湖水中住著知識的精靈。","Snowpoint City. The town where the snow never melts.":"雪峰市。積雪永不融化的城市。","Snowpoint City Gym. Leader: Candice, who never lets the cold win.":"雪峰市道館。館主：絕不輸給嚴寒的小菘。","North: Snowpoint Temple. No entry.":"北：雪峰神殿。禁止進入。","Ahoy, Champion! Shall I take you to the Battle Zone?":"喂，冠軍！要我送你去對戰特區嗎？","The ship sailed out across the northern sea...":"船駛入了北方的海……","This ship goes to the Battle Zone, and only Trainers who have beaten the Pokémon League may board.":"這條船開往對戰特區，只有打敗過寶可夢聯盟的訓練家才能上船。","Snowpoint Harbor. The ship sails to the Battle Zone.":"雪峰市港口。此船開往對戰特區。","Candice told me a Trainer filling in the National Pokédex may enter the temple. Every floor below is ice, so mind your step.":"小菘說過，在完成全國圖鑑的訓練家可以進神殿。下面每一層都是冰，走路小心點。","Summer":"薩默","The river here is so pretty. Battling beside it is even better!":"這裡的河好漂亮。在河邊對戰就更棒了！","At least the view is nice.":"至少風景很美。","Marill float on the river like little balloons. So cute!":"瑪力露像小氣球一樣漂在河上。好可愛！","Nothing is biting today. You will have to do!":"今天一條魚都沒上鉤。只好拿你湊數了！","Still nothing biting...":"還是沒有魚上鉤……","The best fishing spot is under the bridge. Do not tell anyone.":"最好的釣點在橋下。別告訴別人哦。","Terry":"泰瑞","I am camping my way to Solaceon. Battle me on the road!":"我一路露營前往隨意鎮。在路上和我對戰吧！","Back to walking, then.":"那就繼續趕路吧。","Solaceon has a Day Care. You can leave a Pokémon there while you travel.":"隨意鎮有培育屋。旅行的時候可以把寶可夢寄放在那裡。","My Pokémon are the cutest in Sinnoh. Let me show you!":"我的寶可夢是神奧最可愛的。讓你見識一下！","Cute and strong are not the same thing...":"可愛和強大不是一回事啊……","Did you know Clefairy dance under the full moon on Mt. Coronet?":"你知道嗎？皮皮會在天冠山的滿月下跳舞哦。","Strange letter Pokémon float around inside the ruins. Every one of them has a different shape!":"遺跡裡飄著奇怪的文字寶可夢。每一隻的形狀都不一樣！","Life here is slow and peaceful. That is just how we like it in Solaceon.":"這裡的生活悠閒又平靜。我們隨意鎮的人就喜歡這樣。","Veilstone City is east of Route 210. Its Gym Leader, Maylene, fights with her own fists... and Fighting-type Pokémon!":"帷幕市在210號道路的東邊。那裡的道館館主阿李用自己的拳頭戰鬥……還有格鬥屬性的寶可夢！","It rains all the time on Route 215. Fire moves are weaker in the rain, you know.":"215號道路一直在下雨。下雨的時候，火屬性招式會變弱哦。","Grandpa says the ruins are older than any town in Sinnoh. Nobody knows who carved those letters.":"爺爺說，那座遺跡比神奧任何一個城鎮都古老。誰也不知道那些文字是誰刻的。","Every life began from one, and every thread still leads back to it.":"一切生命皆源於一，每一條線都仍通往那裡。","A crowd of Psyduck is holding its heads and blocking the path. They will not budge.":"一群可達鴨抱著頭，把路堵住了。牠們一動也不動。","Joel":"喬爾","I bent a spoon this morning. Now I will bend your will!":"我今天早上弄彎了一把湯匙。現在輪到你的意志了！","My spoon is straight again...":"我的湯匙又變直了……","Those Psyduck up north have terrible headaches. Something must be bothering them.":"北邊那些可達鴨頭痛得厲害。一定有什麼東西在困擾牠們。","A Champion of three regions? I have been waiting for someone like you!":"三個地區的冠軍？我一直在等你這樣的人！","Maylene in Veilstone is strong. Bring Flying or Psychic moves.":"帷幕市的阿李很強。帶上飛行或超能力屬性的招式吧。","This route is all grass and hills. Perfect for training!":"這條路上全是草地和山丘。最適合訓練了！","More training needed.":"還得多加訓練。","East of here is Route 215. Bring an umbrella. It never stops raining.":"往東是215號道路。帶把傘吧，那裡的雨從來不停。","Route 209. North: Solaceon Town. West: Hearthome City.":"209號道路。北：隨意鎮　西：家緣市","Solaceon Town. A quiet town where people and Pokémon live at an easy pace.":"隨意鎮。人與寶可夢悠閒生活的寧靜小鎮。","Solaceon Ruins. Please do not touch the carvings.":"隨意遺跡。請勿觸摸石刻。","A note on the shelf: \"Our cousins run the Day Care on Route 34 in Johto. A Pokémon left with one of us can be picked up at either!\"":"架子上的字條：「我們的表親在城都的34號道路經營培育屋。寄放在任何一邊的寶可夢，在兩邊都能領回！」","Letters are carved all over the wall. Together they seem to say: \"Every life began from one, and every thread still leads back to it.\"":"牆上刻滿了文字。連起來似乎在說：「一切生命皆源於一，每一條線都仍通往那裡。」","Route 210. South: Solaceon Town. East: Route 215 and Veilstone City.":"210號道路。南：隨意鎮　東：215號道路、帷幕市","Give them the {item}?":"要給牠們{item}嗎？","The Psyduck stopped holding their heads and waddled away, quacking happily!":"可達鴨們不再抱著頭，開心地嘎嘎叫著搖搖擺擺走了！","You cured them! Thank you, {player}. The road north is open again.":"你治好牠們了！謝謝你，{player}。往北的路又通了。","Could I ask one more favor? This Old Charm belongs to my grandmother, the elder of Celestic Town, past the fog to the west.":"能再拜託你一件事嗎？這個古代護符是我奶奶的。她是神和鎮的長老，穿過霧往西走就到了。","I hear Team Galactic has been seen near the ruins there. Please be careful.":"聽說有人在那裡的遺跡附近看到了銀河隊。請多加小心。","My Snorlax only ever left Snorlax Eggs here. Then I let it hold a Full Incense, and out came a Munchlax! Some Pokémon lay their baby only when one of the pair holds the right incense.":"我的卡比獸在這裡只會生下卡比獸的蛋。後來我讓牠帶著飽腹薰香，結果孵出了小卡比獸！有些寶可夢要兩隻之中有一隻帶著對的薰香，才會生下幼年寶可夢。","Graham":"格雷厄姆","Geneva":"吉內瓦","Stanley":"斯坦利","Mikayla":"米凱拉","Griffin":"格里芬","Felicia":"費利西婭","Saul":"索爾","Darien":"達里恩","Keenan & Kassandra":"基南和卡桑德拉","Skylar & Natasha":"斯凱勒和娜塔莎","Chelsey & Sterling":"切爾西和斯特林","Krystal & Ray":"克麗絲托和雷","Stefan & Jasmin":"斯特凡和賈絲明","Drake & Jarrett":"德雷克和賈勒特","Abel & Monique":"亞伯和莫妮克","Harlan & Kenny":"哈蘭和肯尼","Hey! I know you, you are the Champion! My big brother Flint told me all about you. I am Buck.":"嘿！我認識你，你就是冠軍！我哥哥大葉跟我講過你的事。我叫麥可。","This mountain is where I train. But people in Team Galactic uniforms came through here, and they went straight for the deepest room.":"我一直在這座山裡修行。可是有穿銀河隊制服的人從這裡經過，直奔最深處的房間去了。","Nobody messes with my mountain! I am going after them, and you are coming too.":"誰也別想在我的山上亂來！我要去追他們，你也一起來。","The Trainers in here like to fight in pairs, so we will fight as a pair as well. And after each battle I will see to your team.":"這裡的訓練家喜歡兩人一組，所以我們也搭檔上陣。每打完一場，我都會替你照顧隊伍。","Stay close! This mountain is hot, but my Claydol does not mind, and neither do I.":"跟緊我！這座山很熱，不過我的念力土偶不在乎，我也不在乎。","Buck's Claydol looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"麥可的念力土偶照顧了你的寶可夢。牠們完全恢復了！","Oh, it is you again. Do you ever stop following Team Galactic around?":"哦，又是你。你就不能別再跟著銀河隊了嗎？","We only came to see what Charon has been doing with the name of our team.":"我們只是來看看，冥王拿我們隊的名字幹了些什麼。","Hey! This is my mountain! Whatever you are up to down here, it stops now!":"喂！這是我的山！不管你們在這裡搞什麼，到此為止！","A friend of yours? Then two against two. We have been bored since the Spear Pillar.":"你的朋友？那就二對二吧。自從槍之柱之後，我們一直閒得發慌。","Wait, let me see to your team first. Right, {player}, together!":"等等，先讓我照顧一下你的隊伍。好，{player}，一起上！","Beaten again. Funny, I do not even mind this time.":"又輸了。真奇怪，這次我一點也不在意。","Cyrus wanted a whole new world. Charon only wants money. That is not what we signed up for.":"赤日想要的是一個全新的世界，冥王想要的只有錢。我們不是為了這個才加入的。","We are done. As of now, we have left Team Galactic.":"我們不幹了。從現在起，我們退出銀河隊。","Goodbye, Trainer. Try not to get burned.":"再見了，訓練家。小心別被燒著。","Fools! Who needs them? Look at this, children. The Magma Stone, the seal of this mountain!":"蠢貨！誰稀罕她們？孩子們，看看這個。火山鎮石，這座山的封印！","With it I shall wake what sleeps below, and the people of Sinnoh will pay anything to make the volcano sleep again!":"我要用它喚醒沉睡在下面的東西，到時候神奧的人為了讓火山重新睡去，花多少錢都願意！","Excuse me, sir. One small question.":"打擾一下，長官。有個小問題。","What is it now? Can you not see I am gloating?":"又怎麼了？沒看到我正在得意嗎？","Do you have the right to carry that stone? No? Then you are under arrest!":"你有資格拿著那塊石頭嗎？沒有？那你被捕了！","You! You have been carrying my bags for a month!":"你！你幫我提了一個月的行李！","And they were very heavy. Looker of the International Police, at your service. A fine disguise, no?":"而且還很重。國際警察帥哥，為您效勞。這身偽裝不錯吧？","Officers, take him away. And his friend.":"警官們，把他帶走。還有他的同夥。","He dropped it! So this is the Magma Stone. It is warm, and...":"他把它掉在這兒了！這就是火山鎮石啊。熱呼呼的，而且……","The whole room shook! Far below, something answered.":"整個房間都在搖晃！在很深的地下，有什麼回應了。","Whoa! I do not think it likes being moved! I am taking this to my grandfather, he will know what to do.":"哇！看來它不喜歡被人挪動！我把它拿去給爺爺，他肯定知道該怎麼辦。","Thanks for everything, {player}. Come and find me at home in the Survival Area!":"謝謝你的幫忙，{player}。到生存區的我家來找我吧！","Team Galactic is finished, my friend, and you helped to finish it. Now, the paperwork. There is always paperwork.":"銀河隊完了，我的朋友，這也有你的功勞。接下來是寫報告。永遠都有寫不完的報告。","The mountain is quiet again, but something is awake down there. Be careful, {player}.":"山又安靜下來了，但是下面有什麼東西醒了。小心點，{player}。","{player}! You made it. I showed the stone to Grandfather, and he went white.":"{player}！你來了。我把石頭拿給爺爺看，他臉都白了。","He says it holds down the heart of the mountain. So I ran all the way back and put it where it was.":"他說這塊石頭鎮著山的心臟。所以我一路跑回去，把它放回了原處。","The shaking stopped. But I felt something looking at me from the lava, in the deepest room. Something huge.":"搖晃停了。可是在最深處的房間，我感覺有什麼東西從岩漿裡看著我。是個很大的東西。","If anyone can face it, you can. Go and see!":"要是有人能面對牠，那就是你了。去看看吧！","Where the Magma Stone rests, {mon} rises from the lava. The air burns around it.":"在火山鎮石安放的地方，{mon}從岩漿中升起。周圍的空氣都在燃燒。","{mon} sank back into the lava. It may rise again.":"{mon}又沉回了岩漿裡。牠也許還會再升起來。","Stark Mountain breathed out, and the rumbling stopped at last.":"嚴酷山長長地吐了一口氣，轟鳴聲終於停了。","See the smoke up north? That is Stark Mountain. People say it has not slept in a long time.":"看到北邊的煙了嗎？那就是嚴酷山。聽說它已經很久沒有安睡了。","The wind off the sea keeps me sharp. Let us see how sharp you are.":"海風讓我保持敏銳。讓我看看你有多敏銳。","Not sharp enough, it seems.":"看來還不夠敏銳。","Past this beach it is the sea, and after the sea, the volcano.":"過了這片沙灘就是海，過了海就是火山。","My birds can see a Trainer coming from the other shore.":"我的鳥兒在對岸就能看見訓練家走過來。","Nothing flies over the volcano for long. The air is too hot.":"什麼都沒法在火山上空飛太久。空氣太燙了。","Only a Dragon Tamer comes this far out. So what are you?":"只有馴龍師才會走到這麼遠。那你是什麼人？","A Champion. I should have asked first.":"是冠軍啊。我該先問一聲的。","The dragons on Stark Mountain do not like visitors.":"嚴酷山的龍不喜歡客人。","I swim here every day. The current is the only thing that ever beats me.":"我每天都在這裡游泳。能贏我的只有海流。","Well, now there are two things.":"好吧，現在多了一個。","There is a little island out here. Nobody ever goes there.":"這片海上有個小島。從來沒人去。","These waters are mine! Any swimmer who comes through has to battle me!":"這片海是我的！游過這裡的都得跟我打一場！","Ow! I should have let you through!":"哎喲！早知道就讓你過去了！","The far shore is close. Follow the road north from there.":"對岸不遠了。上岸後沿著路往北走。","Ash in my hair, ash in my shoes. I am in a bad mood, so battle me.":"頭髮裡是灰，鞋子裡也是灰。我心情很差，來打一場吧。","Now I have ash in my pride.":"現在連自尊心都落滿灰了。","The ash falls every day. You stop noticing, more or less.":"火山灰每天都在落。久了也就不太在意了。","I walk this road barefoot, for the heat! Hyah!":"我光著腳走這條路，就為了感受熱度！嘿呀！","My feet are fine. My pride is burned.":"腳沒事。燒傷的是我的自尊心。","Do not step off the rock. That is not water down there.":"別踩到岩石外面去。下面那可不是水。","A ranger watches this road for rockfalls, lava and lost Trainers. Which are you?":"巡護員要看著這條路上的落石、岩漿和迷路的訓練家。你是哪一種？","Not lost at all. My mistake.":"一點也沒迷路。是我看錯了。","People in uniform went up the mountain last week. They did not say why.":"上週有穿制服的人上山去了。他們沒說要幹什麼。","One Pokémon. One battle. That is all I ever need.":"一隻寶可夢，一場對戰。我只需要這些。","One was not enough.":"一隻還不夠。","Stark Mountain is just ahead. It is hotter inside than you think.":"嚴酷山就在前面。裡面比你想的還要熱。","My Dragonite and I keep watch on this slope. Nobody gets up here by accident.":"我和我的快龍守著這片山坡。沒人會碰巧走到這裡。","Then you came on purpose. Good.":"那你是特意來的。很好。","If you are going in, take Full Heals. And respect the mountain.":"要進去的話，帶上萬靈藥。還有，要敬畏這座山。","Two of us, and this heat. Whoever you are, you picked a bad day!":"我們兩個人，再加上這股熱氣。不管你是誰，你挑錯日子了！","It was a bad day for us instead!":"挑錯日子的是我們！","With Buck beside you? No wonder.":"有麥可在你身邊？難怪。","We came here to train as a pair. You two will do nicely!":"我們是來練搭檔的。你們兩個正合適！","You two work well together.":"你們配合得真好。","Buck comes here every day. He knows this place better than anyone.":"麥可每天都來這裡。這地方他最熟了。","We saw this battle in our minds. We saw ourselves winning.":"我們在腦海裡看見了這場對戰。看見的是我們贏了。","Our minds must have been a little hot.":"大概是腦袋被烤熱了。","Something sleeps under this mountain. We can feel it dreaming.":"這座山下睡著什麼東西。我們能感覺到牠在做夢。","Wings and fists! Nothing gets past both!":"翅膀加拳頭！誰也過不了我們兩關！","You got past both.":"你兩關都過了。","Strange people in uniforms walked past here. Not even a hello.":"有一群穿制服的怪人從這裡走過去。連個招呼都不打。","This is as far as most Trainers get.":"大多數訓練家只能走到這裡。","But not you.":"但你不是。","Keep going. It only gets hotter.":"繼續走吧。只會越來越熱。","A dragon and a fighter. We cover each other's weak points!":"龍和格鬥家。我們互相彌補弱點！","You found them anyway!":"你還是找到了！","The way on is blocked by cracked rock. Break it, if you can.":"前面的路被裂開的岩石堵住了。有本事就打碎它。","Ice in a volcano? Yes. That is how tough we are.":"火山裡用冰系？沒錯。我們就是這麼硬氣。","It melted.":"化了。","The people in uniforms went through the last door. Watch out.":"那些穿制服的人走進最後那道門了。小心點。","I have seen Trainers come and go from this mountain for forty years.":"四十年來，我看著訓練家在這座山裡來來去去。","And there you go.":"你也要走了。","Go on, then. Whatever is at the bottom of this mountain, it has been waiting for a long time.":"去吧。不管這座山的最深處有什麼，牠已經等了很久了。","Route 226. East: the sea. Beyond it, the road to Stark Mountain.":"226號水路。東：大海。海的那邊是通往嚴酷山的路。","Route 227. North: Stark Mountain. Mind the ash.":"227號道路。北：嚴酷山。小心火山灰。","And Grandfather's Battleground is open to you now. The Gym Leaders come there to battle, and some days so do I!":"爺爺的對決場現在也向你開放了。道館館主們會去那裡對戰，有些日子我也會去！","Route 226. North: Route 227 to Stark Mountain. South: Route 228. West: the sea and the Survival Area.":"226號水路。北：227號道路通往嚴酷山。南：228號道路。西：大海和生存區。","Elite Four Flint":"四天王大葉","Brett":"布雷特","Alec":"亞歷克","Nicola":"妮可拉","Trey":"特雷","Luther":"路德","Thomas":"托馬斯","Conner":"康納","Holly":"霍莉","Janet":"珍妮特","Tiera":"蒂埃拉","Forrest":"福雷斯特","Jerry":"傑瑞","Meghan":"梅根","Lonnie":"朗尼","Zachery":"扎卡里","Route 222. West: Valor Lakefront. East: Sunyshore City.":"222號道路。西：立志湖畔。東：濱海市。","Sunyshore City ahead. The city that runs on the light of the sun.":"前方是濱海市。靠太陽光運轉的城市。","A level 43 Magikarp! Yes, I know. I have been fishing a long time.":"43級的鯉魚王！沒錯，我釣了很久的魚。","It splashed very well.":"牠躍得很好。","The sea here is the best in Sinnoh. Everybody who fishes says so.":"這裡的海是神奧最好的。釣魚的人都這麼說。","One Gyarados is all a real fisherman needs!":"真正的釣魚人只需要一隻暴鯉龍！","Maybe two would be better.":"也許兩隻更好。","I started with a Magikarp too. Everybody does.":"我也是從鯉魚王開始的。大家都一樣。","Everything I caught today is in this battle!":"今天釣到的全都上場了！","Now I have to catch them all again.":"這下又要重新釣了。","The fish do not care who wins.":"魚才不管誰贏。","You scared off a bite! You will pay for that!":"你嚇跑了上鉤的魚！你要付出代價！","I think I scared it off myself.":"好像是我自己嚇跑的。","Patience is the whole of fishing. I am working on it.":"釣魚全靠耐心。我還在練。","My Lopunny and I walk this road every day to stay beautiful.":"我和長耳兔每天都走這條路，保持美麗。","At least we still look good.":"至少我們還是很好看。","The sea air does wonders for fur.":"海風對毛髮特別好。","My Luxray cost more than your whole team, I expect. Shall we see?":"我的倫琴貓比你整支隊伍都貴吧。要試試嗎？","I shall have to buy a better one.":"看來得買一隻更好的。","Money cannot buy everything, Father says. He says it from his yacht.":"父親說，錢買不到一切。他是在自己的遊艇上說的。","I just came ashore, and I have not had a good fight in weeks!":"我剛上岸，已經好幾週沒好好打一場了！","That was worth the wait.":"這一場值得等。","Ships from Sunyshore sail all over the world.":"從濱海市出發的船開往世界各地。","This road was closed until today. Let me check that you are up to it.":"這條路今天才開放。讓我看看你夠不夠格。","You may pass. Drive safely. Or walk safely.":"可以通過了。注意行車安全。或者走路安全。","I heard a rumor that a great detective passed through here. Nobody saw him.":"聽說有個大偵探從這裡經過。誰也沒看見他。","My Mantyke rode on my ship all the way from the far side of the sea!":"我的小球飛魚坐著我的船，從大海那頭一路過來！","It is still only little.":"牠還小呢。","It will be a Mantine one day, when there is a Remoraid around.":"等身邊有鐵炮魚的時候，牠總有一天會變成巨翅飛魚。","I can swim as far as this ring lets me!":"這個泳圈能漂多遠，我就能游多遠！","The ring is losing air.":"泳圈漏氣了。","Do not tell my mum I came out this far.":"別告訴我媽我游到這麼遠。","My Remoraid squirts better than anybody's!":"我的鐵炮魚噴水噴得比誰都好！","It got water in my eyes.":"水進眼睛裡了。","I am going to swim to Sunyshore. One day.":"總有一天我要游到濱海市。","Welcome to the Pikachu Fan Club! We meet every day, and we talk about Pikachu. That is the whole club.":"歡迎來到皮卡丘粉絲俱樂部！我們每天聚會，聊皮卡丘。俱樂部就這麼點事。","One Pikachu is cute. Two Pikachu is twice as cute!":"一隻皮卡丘很可愛。兩隻皮卡丘就加倍可愛！","They are still cute.":"牠們還是很可愛。","Do you like Pikachu? You have to say yes in here.":"你喜歡皮卡丘嗎？在這裡你只能說喜歡。","Sunyshore City. The city that runs on the light of the sun.":"濱海市。靠太陽光運轉的城市。","Sunyshore Market, to the south. The beach is to the north.":"南邊是濱海市場。北邊是海灘。","Sunyshore City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Volkner. The shining star that lights the way.":"濱海市寶可夢道館。館主：電次。照亮道路的閃耀之星。","Vista Lighthouse. On a clear day you can see the Pokémon League from the top.":"瞭望燈塔。天氣晴朗時，從塔頂能看到寶可夢聯盟。","Our streets and rooftops are covered in solar panels. The whole city runs on sunshine.":"我們的街道和屋頂都鋪滿了太陽能板。整座城市都靠陽光運轉。","Volkner used to battle everybody who came. These days the lighthouse sees more of him than the Gym.":"電次以前來者不拒。現在他待在燈塔的時間比在道館還多。","Past this water lies Route 223, and at the end of it the Pokémon League. It is a long way, and the current is strong.":"這片水的那邊是223號道路，盡頭就是寶可夢聯盟。路很遠，水流也很急。","Volkner's Gym is the last one in Sinnoh. If you can beat him, the League is the only thing left.":"電次的道館是神奧最後一個。贏了他，就只剩下聯盟了。","Paralyze Heal sells very well here. I wonder why.":"解麻藥在這裡賣得特別好。不知道為什麼。","Welcome to the Sunyshore Market! The stalls are shut today. Everybody has gone to look at the sea.":"歡迎來到濱海市場！今天攤位都關了。大家都去看海了。","When I was young, you could see every star from here. Then we lit up the city, and now the stars are in the streets.":"我年輕的時候，在這裡能看到滿天星星。後來城市亮起來了，星星就跑到街上去了。","The lift goes to the top. Volkner is up there. He comes here to look at the sea and say nothing.":"電梯通到塔頂。電次就在上面。他來這裡看海，什麼也不說。","Through the viewer you can just see the Pokémon League, far across the sea.":"從望遠鏡裡能隱約看到大海遠處的寶可夢聯盟。","Through the viewer you can see the whole of Sunyshore City shining in the sun.":"從望遠鏡裡能看到整座濱海市在陽光下閃閃發亮。","I read all about Electric types, and now I will show you!":"電屬性的書我全讀過了，現在就讓你見識！","That was not in the book.":"書上沒寫這個。","The plates on the floor open some gates and shut others. Keep trying!":"地上的開關會打開一些閘門，關上另一些。多試試吧！","Three Magnemite are stronger than one. That is simple mathematics!":"三隻小磁怪比一隻強。這是簡單的數學！","I forgot to carry the one.":"我忘了進位。","A gate that is open now may be shut when you come back.":"現在開著的閘門，等你回來時可能就關了。","This next one is called \"Shock to the System\"!":"下一首歌叫《全身過電》！","My amp blew.":"我的音箱燒了。","Volkner played guitar with us once. He was bored by the second song.":"電次跟我們合奏過一次吉他。第二首歌他就膩了。","I have four Pikachu, and they are all my favorite!":"我有四隻皮卡丘，每一隻都是我的最愛！","They all did their best.":"牠們都盡力了。","I named them all Pikachu. It is easier.":"我給牠們都取名叫皮卡丘。這樣比較方便。","One Raichu, one chord, and that is all I need!":"一隻雷丘，一個和弦，這就夠了！","That was the wrong chord.":"這個和弦彈錯了。","The lights in here are powered by the Leader's Pokémon. That is what he tells us.":"這裡的燈是靠館主的寶可夢發電的。他是這麼跟我們說的。","Two Luxio, in perfect harmony!":"兩隻勒克貓，完美和聲！","We fell out of tune.":"我們跑調了。","Volkner has been smiling since he came back. It is a little frightening.":"電次回來之後一直在笑。有點嚇人。","You have come a long way through these gates. It ends here.":"你穿過這些閘門走了很遠。到此為止了。","I see why Volkner came back.":"我明白電次為什麼回來了。","The Leader is behind the last gate. You will need the right plates down to open it.":"館主在最後一道閘門後面。要踩對開關才打得開。","Nobody has reached this room in a long time. Let me welcome you.":"很久沒人走到這個房間了。讓我來歡迎你。","He will give you the battle he has been waiting for. Be ready for that.":"他會給你一場他等了很久的對戰。做好準備吧。","So you made it through. I built those gates because nobody was giving me a fight. Now show me that spark.":"你走到這裡了。我造那些閘門，是因為沒人能跟我好好打一場。來吧，讓我看看你的火花。","There it is. That is the spark I was missing!":"就是這個。這就是我一直缺少的火花！","I had forgotten how good this feels. Thank you. Now go on, somebody on the beach was asking for you.":"我都忘了這種感覺有多好。謝謝你。去吧，海灘上有人在找你。","Hey, you there! You look like you have been through something. Are you here for the Gym?":"喂，你！看起來經歷了不少事啊。你是來挑戰道館的嗎？","I am Flint, one of the Elite Four. Volkner is my friend, so let me warn you: he is not at his Gym.":"我是四天王大葉。電次是我的朋友，所以先提醒你：他不在道館。","He says nobody gives him a real battle any more, and he has stopped caring. He sits at the top of the lighthouse all day.":"他說再也沒人能跟他好好打一場，已經什麼都不在乎了。他整天都待在燈塔頂上。","Go up there and light a fire under him. I would do it myself, but he stopped listening to me a long time ago.":"上去給他點把火吧。我本想自己去，可他早就不聽我的了。","So Flint sent you. He does that.":"是大葉讓你來的吧。他總是這樣。","I have beaten everybody who came to my Gym, so I rebuilt it to make it harder, and then nobody came at all. I got bored of winning.":"來我道館的人我全贏了，所以我把道館改得更難，結果就沒人來了。贏也贏膩了。","But people say you went up against Team Galactic and came back. Your Pokémon do look like they have seen something.":"不過聽說你和銀河隊交過手，還活著回來了。你的寶可夢確實像是見過世面。","All right. If you can get through my gates, I will give you a battle. Let us see if you can make me feel anything.":"好吧。你要是能過我的閘門，我就跟你打一場。看看你能不能讓我有點感覺。","Volkner went back to his Gym.":"電次回道館去了。","Oh... {player}. It has been a long time since Olivine City. I came to see this sea with my own eyes.":"啊……{player}。自從淺蔥市一別，好久不見了。我是來親眼看看這片海的。","You have all eight badges of Sinnoh now? I can tell. Your Pokémon stand differently.":"你已經拿到神奧的八枚徽章了吧？看得出來。你的寶可夢站姿都不一樣了。","Then you will need this. There is a great waterfall on the way to the League.":"那你會需要這個。去聯盟的路上有一道大瀑布。","You already know the way of the Waterfall, I am sure. You will need it on the road to the League.":"你應該已經會用攀瀑了。去聯盟的路上用得著。","Route 223 starts across this water, and the Pokémon League is at the end of it. Whenever you are ready.":"223號道路就在這片水的對面，盡頭是寶可夢聯盟。等你準備好吧。","I will go back and watch the sea a little longer. Good luck, {player}.":"我再看一會兒海。祝你好運，{player}。","The doors are shut. A note says: \"Gone out. Do not wait.\" It is signed by Volkner.":"門關著。紙條上寫著：「出去了，別等。」署名是電次。","Hey there, future Champion! Volkner uses Electric Pokémon, and this is the last Gym in Sinnoh.":"嘿，未來的冠軍！電次使用電屬性寶可夢，這裡是神奧最後一個道館。","Each plate on the floor opens some gates and shuts others. Plates of the same power work the same gates, so watch what changes.":"地上每個開關都會打開一些閘門，關上另一些。有些開關控制同樣的閘門，要留意哪裡變了。","Ground moves are what you want. His Pokémon know a few surprises, so do not bring only one type!":"地面屬性的招式最有效。他的寶可夢有些意想不到的招式，別只帶一種屬性！","That is the best battle I have had in years. The Beacon Badge is yours.":"這是我這些年打得最痛快的一場。燈塔徽章是你的了。","{player} received the Beacon Badge from Volkner!":"{player}從電次那裡得到了燈塔徽章！","That is all eight. Every Pokémon will obey you now, wherever it comes from.":"八枚集齊了。現在無論來自哪裡的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And take TM57, Charge Beam. It can raise the user's Sp. Atk as it hits.":"再收下招式學習器57，充電光束。命中時可能提高使用者的特攻。","Somebody on the beach to the north was asking about you. Go and see.":"北邊海灘上有人在打聽你。去看看吧。","Words are carved deep into the wall: \"Far below sleeps the one that pulled the land into place. From rock, from ice and from iron it made three. When the three come home to it, it will stir.\"":"牆上深深刻著字：「在遙遠的地底，沉睡著把大地拉到原位的那一位。它用岩石、冰與鋼鐵造出了三位。當三位回到它身邊，它便會甦醒。」","A colossal statue sits in the cold. Three marks are carved at its feet: one of rock, one of ice, one of iron. It does not move.":"一座巨大的石像坐在寒氣之中。它腳下刻著三個記號：一個是岩石，一個是冰，一個是鋼鐵。石像一動也不動。","{rock}, {ice} and {steel} stir in their Poké Balls, as if something were calling them home.":"{rock}、{ice}和{steel}在精靈球裡躁動起來，好像有什麼在呼喚牠們回家。","Light flickers in the statue's eyes. {mon} is moving!":"石像的眼睛閃起了光。{mon}動起來了！","The light went out of its eyes. {mon} sits as still as stone again.":"牠眼中的光熄滅了。{mon}又像石頭一樣一動不動了。","The Clefairy is not worth this much trouble. Take it back, then.":"這隻皮皮不值得這麼麻煩。還給你就是了。","But remember this: Team Galactic is working toward a new world, and the boss does not like being kept waiting.":"不過你給我記住：銀河隊正在為新世界努力，首領可不喜歡等待。","Team Galactic left the Eterna Building, and the Clefairy ran straight home to the cycle shop.":"銀河隊撤出了百代大樓，皮皮直接跑回了自行車店。","Cycling Road starts at the south of town. Enjoy the ride, and watch the corners!":"自行車道從城市南邊開始。好好享受，轉彎小心！","You brought my Clefairy back! Thank you, thank you!":"你把我的皮皮帶回來了！謝謝你，謝謝你！","I wanted to give you a bike, but you already ride one from Kanto? Then take this. Clefairy loved to play with it.":"我本想送你一輛自行車，不過你已經有關都的了？那就收下這個吧。皮皮最喜歡拿它玩了。","A Moon Stone makes some Pokémon evolve. And with Team Galactic gone, Cycling Road is open again!":"月之石能讓某些寶可夢進化。而且銀河隊走了，自行車道也重新開放了！","A kid in our building? You must be lost. Let me show you the way out!":"小鬼跑進我們大樓了？你是迷路了吧。我來帶你出去！","You found the way in instead...":"結果你找到的是進來的路……","Commander Jupiter is upstairs. She is much scarier than me.":"歲星幹部在樓上。她可比我嚇人多了。","This is a Team Galactic building. Trespassers get battled!":"這裡是銀河隊的大樓。擅闖者一律對戰！","Trespasser one, Team Galactic zero.":"擅闖者一分，銀河隊零分。","We are only borrowing that Clefairy. It is for science! ...Probably.":"我們只是借用一下那隻皮皮。是為了科學！……大概吧。","Clefairy is shaking in the corner. It looks like it wants to go home.":"皮皮在角落裡發抖，看起來很想回家。","The Commander is busy. Nobody gets past me!":"幹部正忙著呢。誰也別想過去！","Somebody got past me...":"有人過去了……","Go on, then. Do not say I did not warn you.":"去吧。可別說我沒提醒你。","So you are the Trainer Mars told me about. I am Jupiter, a Commander of Team Galactic. That Clefairy is part of our research, and research does not stop for children.":"原來你就是夥星說的那個訓練家。我是銀河隊的幹部歲星。那隻皮皮是我們研究的一部分，研究可不會因為小孩子而停下。","Hmph. Mars was right about you.":"哼。夥星說得沒錯。","Clefairy is twirling happily around the shop.":"皮皮開心地在店裡轉圈圈。","Axel":"阿克塞爾","Downhill all the way! Can you keep up?":"一路下坡！你跟得上嗎？","You were faster...":"你比我快……","Let go of the pedals and the slope does the rest. Best road in Sinnoh!":"鬆開踏板，剩下的交給坡道。神奧最棒的路！","Kayla":"凱拉","My Luxio and I race down this road every morning!":"我和我的勒克貓每天早上都在這條路上比賽！","We lost the race...":"我們比輸了……","At the bottom of the road is Route 207. Oreburgh City is to the west of it.":"這條路的盡頭是207號道路，黑金市在它的西邊。","Brakes? Who needs brakes? Battle!":"煞車？誰要煞車啊？對戰吧！","Okay, maybe I need brakes.":"好吧，也許我需要煞車。","Mt. Coronet is east of Route 207. It splits Sinnoh right down the middle.":"天冠山在207號道路的東邊。它把神奧從正中間分開。","Last stop before the bottom. Let me see what you have got!":"到底之前的最後一站。讓我看看你的本事！","You have got a lot.":"你本事真大。","Hearthome City is on the other side of Mt. Coronet. Its Gym Leader uses Ghost types.":"家緣市在天冠山的另一邊。那裡的道館館主使用幽靈屬性。","I am heading into Mt. Coronet. First, a warm-up battle!":"我要進天冠山了。先來場熱身對戰吧！","Warmed up and worn out.":"熱身完，也累壞了。","Inside the mountain the air is cold and still. Strange people go in there, too.":"山裡的空氣又冷又靜。還有些奇怪的人會進去。","Maria":"瑪莉亞","My Ponyta loves running along this route. Let us run you over, too!":"我的小火馬最喜歡在這條道路上奔跑了。連你也一起撞飛！","Oops, we tripped.":"哎呀，我們絆倒了。","Ponyta's mane is made of fire, but it does not burn people it trusts.":"小火馬的鬃毛是火焰，但不會燒傷牠信任的人。","Route 206: Cycling Road. North: Eterna City. South: Route 207.":"206號道路：自行車道。北：百代市　南：207號道路","Route 207. East: Mt. Coronet. North: Cycling Road. South-west: Oreburgh City.":"207號道路。東：天冠山　北：自行車道　西南：黑金市","In my day I raised more dragons than I can count. There is one move I learned from them that I still pass on.":"我年輕時養過的龍多得數不清。從牠們身上學到的一個招式，我到現在還在傳授。","It is called {move}: the dragon calls down stars from the sky. Only a Dragon-type that trusts its Trainer with all its heart can learn it.":"它叫{move}：龍會從天上召來流星。只有全心全意信任訓練家的龍屬性寶可夢才學得會。","Shall I teach {move} to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的寶可夢{move}嗎？","Do come back and see this old woman again.":"有空再來看看我這個老太婆吧。","None of your Pokémon could learn {move} from me. Bring me a Dragon-type, dear.":"你的寶可夢沒有一隻能跟我學{move}。帶一隻龍屬性的來吧，孩子。","An Egg cannot learn a move yet. Let it hatch first.":"蛋還學不了招式。等牠孵化吧。","Only a Dragon-type can learn {move}.":"只有龍屬性的寶可夢才能學會{move}。","{mon} does not trust you with all its heart yet. Travel together a little longer.":"{mon}還沒有全心全意地信任你。再一起旅行一陣子吧。","{move} is the strongest of dragon moves, but it takes so much out of the user that its Sp. Atk falls sharply. Use it wisely.":"{move}是最強的龍之招式，但用了會大量消耗體力，特攻會大幅下降。要用在關鍵時刻哦。","You came all the way across this sand? Then you have earned something. I teach the ultimate moves.":"你穿過這片沙地一路走來？那你值得一點獎勵。我教的是究極招式。","Only the Pokémon a professor gives to a new Trainer, fully grown and fully devoted to their Trainer, can learn them.":"只有博士送給新手訓練家的寶可夢，在完全進化、並且對訓練家死心塌地之後，才學得會。","Shall I teach an ultimate move to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的寶可夢究極招式嗎？","That is fine. The sand and I will wait.":"沒關係。我和這片沙地都會等你。","I am sorry, but that Pokémon cannot learn an ultimate move.":"抱歉，這隻寶可夢學不了究極招式。","{mon} and you are not close enough yet. The ultimate moves come only from a perfect bond.":"你和{mon}的感情還不夠深。究極招式只會從完美的羈絆中誕生。","Shall {mon} learn {move}?":"要讓{mon}學會{move}嗎？","After such a move the user must rest for a turn. Choose the moment well.":"用了這種招式之後，下一回合必須休息。要挑好時機。","A list pinned to the shelf: the Pokémon who may learn an ultimate move.":"釘在書架上的名單：能學會究極招式的寶可夢。","{one}, {two}, {three} and {four}: {move}.":"{one}、{two}、{three}、{four}：{move}。","My grandmother raised dragons before I was born. Even now, a Dragon that loves its Trainer will listen to her.":"我出生前，奶奶就在養龍了。到現在，愛著訓練家的龍還是會聽她的話。","Hey, hey! Are you {player}? The Champion from Hoenn? My mom said you were coming! I am Barry!":"喂喂！你就是{player}嗎？豐緣的冠軍？我媽說你要來！我是阿馴！","Listen! Professor Rowan went to Lake Verity today. And they say a legendary Pokémon lives in that lake!":"聽我說！七灶博士今天去了心齊湖。聽說那座湖裡住著傳說中的寶可夢！","If we go now, maybe we will see it! The lake is at the west end of Route 201, north of town. Race you there!":"現在去的話，說不定能看到！湖在鎮子北邊201號道路的西頭。比比誰先到！","So this is Lake Verity... I do not see any legendary Pokémon. Hey, there are people down by the water!":"這裡就是心齊湖啊……沒看到什麼傳說中的寶可夢嘛。咦，水邊有人！","So. You must be {player}, the Trainer Birch wrote to me about. I am Rowan.":"嗯。你就是小田卷信裡提到的訓練家{player}吧。我是七灶。","I came to watch for the Pokémon of this lake today, but it would not show itself. Perhaps it does not care for visitors.":"我今天來這裡觀察湖中的寶可夢，但牠始終沒有現身。也許牠不喜歡有人打擾吧。","...We will talk another time. {assistant}, we are going back to the lab.":"……我們改天再談。{assistant}，回研究所了。","He is kind of scary... Hey, look! He left his briefcase behind!":"那個人有點嚇人……喂，你看！他把公事包落下了！","A wild Starly swooped down on you!":"野生的姆克兒俯衝了過來！","Whoa, it wants a fight! There are Poké Balls in the briefcase... Quick, take one!":"哇，牠想打架！公事包裡有精靈球……快，拿一個！","Then I will take {mon}! You keep that Starly busy!":"那我就選{mon}！你先拖住那隻姆克兒！","You did it! That Pokémon of yours is pretty good!":"你做到了！你那隻寶可夢還挺厲害的嘛！","Phew, it flew off. That was close!":"呼，牠飛走了。好險啊！","Uh-oh... We used the professor's Pokémon without asking. We had better take his briefcase back to him!":"糟了……我們沒問一聲就用了博士的寶可夢。還是趕快把公事包還給他吧！","There you are. I came back for my briefcase... and I see you have opened it.":"你們在這裡啊。我回來拿公事包……看來你們已經打開過了。","Hmm. That Pokémon fought for you, and it seems at ease by your side. A Pokémon knows a good Trainer.":"嗯。那隻寶可夢為你而戰，而且待在你身邊似乎很安心。寶可夢是能分辨好訓練家的。","Birch tells me you are the Champion of three regions. But Sinnoh is new to you, and so are its ways.":"小田卷說你是三個地區的冠軍。不過，神奧對你來說是個新地方，這裡的規矩也是。","A Pokémon trained to a high level in another region only listens to a Trainer who has earned Sinnoh's Gym badges. The more badges, the stronger the Pokémon that obey.":"在其他地區練到高等級的寶可夢，只聽擁有神奧道館徽章的訓練家的話。徽章越多，聽話的寶可夢就越強。","So keep that Pokémon, and raise it here. It will be your partner in Sinnoh.":"所以，那隻寶可夢就交給你了，在這裡好好培養牠吧。牠會是你在神奧的夥伴。","{player} received {mon} from Prof. Rowan!":"{player}從七灶博士那裡得到了{mon}！","Barry, you may keep yours as well. Now, both of you: come to my lab in Sandgem Town.":"阿馴，你也可以留下你的那隻。好了，你們兩個都到真砂鎮的研究所來。","{player}! Let us battle, right here! Just our new partners, one on one!":"{player}！我們就在這裡對戰吧！只用我們的新夥伴，一對一！","Argh, I lost! I am going to train until I am the strongest Trainer in Sinnoh, you will see!":"啊啊，我輸了！我要一直訓練，直到成為神奧最強的訓練家，你等著瞧！","I won! I beat a Champion! Well... a Champion with a brand-new Pokémon. It still counts!":"我贏了！我打敗了冠軍！嗯……雖然是帶著剛拿到的寶可夢的冠軍。但還是算數！","Come on, the professor is waiting! Race you to Sandgem!":"快走吧，博士在等我們！比比誰先到真砂鎮！","There you are! The lake is just through here. Come on, come on!":"你可來了！湖就在這邊。快點，快點！","Oh, hello! I am {assistant}, Professor Rowan's assistant.":"啊，你好！我是七灶博士的助手{assistant}。","The professor is studying Lake Verity right now, and he asked not to be disturbed.":"博士現在正在調查心齊湖，他交代過不要去打擾他。","Are you the Trainer from Hoenn? You are staying with Barry's family in Twinleaf Town, just south of here. Barry is dying to meet you!":"你就是從豐緣來的訓練家嗎？你會住在南邊雙葉鎮的阿馴家。阿馴可是很想見你呢！","{player}, you look worn out. Sit down and rest a while.":"{player}，你看起來累壞了。坐下來休息一會兒吧。","There you go! Off with you, and keep an eye on Barry for me, will you?":"好啦！去吧，幫我看著點阿馴，好嗎？","Oh! You must be {player}. Professor Rowan asked us to put you up while you are in Sinnoh. Welcome to Twinleaf!":"哎呀！你就是{player}吧。七灶博士拜託我們，在你待在神奧的期間讓你住在這裡。歡迎來到雙葉鎮！","Your room is upstairs. Make yourself at home.":"你的房間在樓上。就當是自己家吧。","Barry has been waiting for you all morning. He is outside somewhere... That boy never sits still!":"阿馴一整個早上都在等你。他就在外面哪裡……那孩子一刻也閒不下來！","Barry runs everywhere. Once he ran so fast he went right past his own front door!":"阿馴去哪裡都用跑的。有一次他跑得太快，連自己家門口都衝過頭了！","Our pond is small, but Psyduck still come to swim in it. Bring a Pokémon that can Surf and see for yourself.":"我們這裡的池塘雖小，可達鴨還是會來游泳。帶上會衝浪的寶可夢，自己來看看吧。","Lake Verity is a quiet place. They say a Pokémon lives deep under its water, though no one I know has ever seen it.":"心齊湖是個安靜的地方。聽說湖底深處住著一隻寶可夢，不過我認識的人誰也沒見過。","My big brother set out on his journey from Twinleaf last spring. Every Trainer in Sinnoh starts somewhere!":"我哥哥去年春天從雙葉鎮出發去旅行了。神奧的每個訓練家都是從某個地方起步的！","Twinleaf Town. Where new leaves open, two by two.":"雙葉鎮。新葉兩兩舒展的地方。","A tidy guest room. A note on the shelf says: \"Welcome to Sinnoh!\"":"整潔的客房。架子上的紙條寫著：「歡迎來到神奧！」","Route 201. East: Sandgem Town. South: Twinleaf Town. West: Lake Verity.":"201號道路。東：真砂鎮　南：雙葉鎮　西：心齊湖","Team Galactic got here first! I cannot get past them on my own.":"銀河隊先到了！我一個人過不去。","Commander Mars said nobody comes through here!":"夥星幹部說了，誰也不准過去！","She will not be happy...":"她不會高興的……","The lake is ours now.":"這座湖現在是我們的了。","You again? Commander Mars will take care of you!":"又是你？夥星幹部會收拾你的！","Commander, help!":"幹部，救命！","Fine. Go and see how far you get.":"好吧。看你能走多遠。","You again? I remember you from the windworks. This time I have a real reason to win. Let us see if you can stop me!":"又是你？我記得你，在山谷發電廠見過。這次我有非贏不可的理由。看你攔不攔得住我！","Not again!":"怎麼又輸了！","Oh, and Professor Rowan called for you, Champion. He says to come to his lab in Sandgem Town when you have rested.":"對了，七灶博士打過電話來，冠軍。他說你休息好了就去真砂鎮的研究所找他。","Barry ran off to some place called the Battle Zone. There is a ship from Snowpoint City, he says. He left without his lunch, of course.":"阿馴跑去一個叫對戰特區的地方了。他說雪峰市有船去。午飯當然又沒帶。","The next Gym is in Pastoria City, south past Route 214. Its Leader, Crasher Wake, splashes around with Water types!":"下一個道館在濕原市，往南經過214號道路就到。那裡的館主吉憲會用水屬性掀起大浪！","The door is locked. A sign says: \"Team Galactic HQ. Members only.\"":"門鎖著。牌子上寫著：「銀河隊總部。非成員禁止入內。」","The Game Corner. A sign says: \"Closed for renovations.\"":"遊戲城。牌子上寫著：「裝修中，暫停營業。」","Hey, Champion! Maylene uses Fighting-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！阿李使用格鬥屬性的寶可夢。","Flying and Psychic moves work great on them. And their Fighting moves cannot touch Ghost-type Pokémon!":"飛行和超能力屬性的招式對牠們效果絕佳。而且牠們的格鬥招式打不到幽靈屬性的寶可夢！","Watch out for her Lucario: it is part Steel, so Fire, Fighting and Ground moves are what you want. Up to level 35, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"小心她的路卡利歐：牠也是鋼屬性，所以要用火、格鬥或地面屬性的招式。在這裡，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢在35級以下都會聽話。","This is the Cobble Badge. You earned it, fair and square.":"這是圓石徽章。你堂堂正正地贏得了它。","{player} received the Cobble Badge from Maylene!":"{player}從阿李那裡得到了圓石徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 40 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，40級以下的寶可夢在神奧都會聽你的話，就算來自其他地區也一樣。","And take this. TM60 is Drain Punch: it hits the foe and heals the user by half the damage.":"還有這個。招式學習器60是吸取拳：攻擊對手，並回復造成傷害一半的HP。","Kirby":"柯比","Rain or shine, I train! Today it is rain. As always!":"不管下雨還是晴天，我都要訓練！今天下雨。和平常一樣！","I am soaked and beaten.":"我渾身濕透，還輸了。","Maylene trains in this rain too. She says it toughens the spirit.":"阿李也會在這場雨裡訓練。她說這能磨練心志。","Ella":"艾拉","My Meditite meditates under the falling rain. Its focus is perfect!":"我的瑪沙那在雨中冥想。牠的專注力無懈可擊！","Our focus slipped.":"我們的專注力斷了。","Meditite are part Psychic, so Psychic moves only hit them normally. Flying moves are what they fear.":"瑪沙那也是超能力屬性，所以超能力招式只能造成普通傷害。牠們怕的是飛行屬性的招式。","A Cool Trainer never lets a little rain stop a battle!":"精英訓練家才不會因為一點小雨就停止對戰！","Fire moves are weaker in the rain, and Water moves are stronger. Use that!":"下雨時，火屬性招式會變弱，水屬性招式會變強。好好利用吧！","Veilstone is just ahead. Get past my fists first!":"帷幕市就在前面。先過了我這雙拳頭再說！","My fists are tired.":"我的拳頭累了。","Maylene's Lucario reads the aura of its foes. You cannot hide anything from it.":"阿李的路卡利歐能讀取對手的波導。在牠面前什麼都藏不住。","Rocks slid onto Route 214 in the rain. The way south is closed for now.":"因為下雨，214號道路發生了落石。往南的路暫時封閉了。","This is the headquarters of Team Galactic. Members only. Go away, kid!":"這裡是銀河隊的總部。非成員禁止入內。小鬼，走開！","Team Galactic built their headquarters right here in town. Nobody knows what they do in there.":"銀河隊把總部蓋在了城裡。誰也不知道他們在裡面做什麼。","Maylene trains in the mountains around the city. She is strong, but very kind.":"阿李在城市周圍的山裡修行。她很強，但人非常溫柔。","Fighting types hit hard, but Flying and Psychic moves send them flying. Remember that in the Gym.":"格鬥屬性打得很狠，但飛行和超能力招式能把牠們打飛。到道館可要記住這一點。","The Veilstone Store has everything a Trainer needs, all on one floor!":"帷幕百貨裡有訓練家需要的一切，全都在同一層！","When I was young, the meteorites glowed on clear nights. Or maybe I only dreamed it.":"我年輕時，隕石會在晴朗的夜裡發光。也可能只是我做的夢吧。","In this Gym we train body and spirit. Show me yours!":"我們在這座道館鍛鍊身體和心靈。讓我看看你的吧！","My spirit needs more training.":"我的心靈還需要更多鍛鍊。","Maylene once broke a boulder with one punch. I have seen it!":"阿李曾經一拳打碎過一塊巨石。我親眼看到的！","Darcy":"達茜","I train every day with Maylene. Let me see what you have got!":"我每天都和阿李一起訓練。讓我看看你有多少本事！","You have got a lot!":"你本事真不小！","Croagunk is Poison and Fighting. Psychic moves hit it four times as hard!":"不良蛙是毒和格鬥屬性。超能力招式對牠有四倍的效果！","Jeffery":"傑弗里","Hiyah! A battle is the best training there is!":"嘿呀！對戰就是最好的訓練！","Hiyah... ow.":"嘿呀……好痛。","Flying moves come from above. Fighting types hate that.":"飛行招式是從上方來的。格鬥屬性最討厭這個了。","Maylene is right behind me. You will have to beat me first!":"阿李就在我身後。你得先打敗我！","Go on. She is ready for you.":"去吧。她已經準備好了。","Riolu can sense feelings. Mine knew I was going to lose before I did.":"利歐路能感知情緒。我的利歐路比我還早知道我會輸。","Welcome to the Veilstone Gym. I am Maylene, the Gym Leader. I train with my Pokémon, side by side, every single day. A Champion of three regions... Then I will give you everything I have!":"歡迎來到帷幕道館。我是道館館主阿李。我每一天都和我的寶可夢並肩訓練。三個地區的冠軍……那我就拿出我的全部力量！","I lost... But I am not sad. That battle made me stronger, too.":"我輸了……但我並不難過。這場對戰也讓我變得更強了。","Route 215. East: Veilstone City. West: Route 210.":"215號道路。東：帷幕市　西：210號道路","Veilstone City. A city carved out of the rock, where stones fell from the sky.":"帷幕市。在岩石中開鑿出的城市，天上曾有石頭落在這裡。","A meteorite. Long ago stones fell from the sky here, and the city grew up around them.":"隕石。很久以前，石頭從天而降落在這裡，城市就圍繞著它們發展起來。","A meteorite. Some say these stones came from a world beyond our own.":"隕石。有人說，這些石頭來自我們世界之外的另一個世界。","The door of the warehouse is locked.":"倉庫的門鎖著。","Team Galactic Warehouse. Authorized members only.":"銀河隊倉庫。非授權成員禁止入內。","Wesley":"韋斯利","Ricardo":"里卡多","Francisco":"弗朗西斯科","Miranda":"米蘭達","Aubree":"奧布麗","Crystal":"克麗絲朵","Cassandra":"卡桑德拉","Zachariah":"撒迦利亞","Bryce":"布萊斯","Miles":"邁爾斯","Hana":"花","Clinton":"克林頓","Omar":"奧馬爾","Sydney":"悉妮","Clayton":"克萊頓","Al & Kay":"阿爾和凱","Jo & Pat":"喬和帕特","Ondrej":"翁德雷","Valencia":"瓦倫西亞","The League is a long swim from here. Are you sure you can make it?":"從這裡游到聯盟可遠了。你真游得到嗎？","You swim better than I thought.":"你比我想的會游。","I swim this way every morning, and I have never once reached the waterfall.":"我每天早上都游這條路，一次也沒游到瀑布。","Nobody crosses my stretch of water for free!":"誰也別想白白穿過我這片水！","Fine. It is free.":"好吧。免費。","The current gets stronger from here on. So do I!":"從這裡開始水流變急了。我也變強了！","The current was not on my side.":"水流沒站在我這邊。","I do not swim with this Gyarados. I swim away from it.":"我不是和這隻暴鯉龍一起游，我是在躲牠。","It is not happy with either of us now.":"現在牠對我們兩個都不高興。","We all travel together. It saves on swimming!":"我們一起行動。這樣能少游點！","We will drift home.":"我們漂回家吧。","My Lumineon lights up the deep water. Look at it glow!":"我的霓虹魚能照亮深水。看牠發光！","It glowed so nicely.":"牠發的光真好看。","They say the League can be seen from the top of the waterfall.":"聽說從瀑布頂上能看到聯盟。","A swimmer needs friends who can float!":"游泳的人需要會浮的朋友！","They floated very well.":"牠們浮得很好。","I came all this way to get away from people, and here you are!":"我游這麼遠就是為了躲開人，結果你來了！","Well, now you can go.":"好了，你可以走了。","Seaking is the queen of the water, and I am her friend!":"金魚王是水中女王，我是她的朋友！","Her horn was not enough.":"她的角也沒能贏。","I can see a very long way from out here. I saw you coming!":"從這裡能看得很遠。我早看到你來了！","The waterfall is right behind me. You will have to get past me first!":"瀑布就在我身後。你得先過我這一關！","Go on, climb it.":"去吧，爬上去吧。","You will need Waterfall to get up there, and a strong Pokémon that knows it.":"要上去得用攀瀑，還要有會這招的強壯寶可夢。","I live on this island, and I do not get many visitors. Let us battle!":"我住在這座小島上，很少有人來。來打一場吧！","I should get out more.":"我該多出去走走。","Every Trainer who goes to the League goes past my island. Few of them stop to talk.":"去聯盟的訓練家都會經過我的島。很少有人停下來說話。","Victory Road. Only Trainers with all eight badges of Sinnoh may enter.":"冠軍之路。只有集齊神奧八枚徽章的訓練家才能進入。","Beyond this cave stands the Pokémon League of Sinnoh. It has turned back more Trainers than I can count.":"穿過這個洞窟就是神奧的寶可夢聯盟。被它擋回去的訓練家數都數不清。","I got as far as the second floor of Victory Road. Bring strong Pokémon, and something that can push boulders.":"我走到冠軍之路二樓就不行了。要帶強壯的寶可夢，還要有能推大石的。","An officer stands in the way. \"Only Trainers with all eight badges of Sinnoh may enter Victory Road.\"":"一名警官擋在路上。「只有集齊神奧八枚徽章的訓練家才能進入冠軍之路。」","I saw you coming in a vision. In the vision, I won.":"我在幻象裡看到你來了。幻象裡是我贏了。","I must have been looking at it upside down.":"大概是我把它看反了。","Up the ladder and over the rocks. That much I can see.":"爬上梯子，越過岩石。這個我還是看得到的。","One Pokémon, four arms, no mercy!":"一隻寶可夢，四條手臂，毫不留情！","All four arms are tired.":"四條手臂都累了。","I have been training in this cave for a year. I still have not found the way out.":"我在這個洞窟修行一年了。到現在還沒找到出口。","If you cannot beat me, you have no business at the League.":"贏不了我的話，你去聯盟也沒用。","You have business at the League.":"你確實有資格去聯盟。","The Elite Four are stronger than anybody in this cave. Remember that.":"四天王比這個洞窟裡的任何人都強。記住這一點。","My birds do not like caves, and neither do I. So let us be quick!":"我的鳥不喜歡洞窟，我也不喜歡。速戰速決吧！","That was quick.":"確實夠快的。","There is daylight at the end of this passage. We are nearly out.":"這條通道盡頭有亮光。快出去了。","I have walked this road more times than you have years. Show me what you have learned.":"我走這條路的次數比你的年紀還多。讓我看看你學到了什麼。","You have learned a great deal.":"你學到了不少。","Every Trainer walks this road alone, in the end. Or with their Pokémon, which is the same.":"到頭來，每個訓練家都是獨自走這條路。或者說和寶可夢一起走，這是一回事。","The Champion trains Dragons. I mean to be ready for her, and so should you!":"冠軍在訓練龍。我要做好準備，你也該如此！","I am not ready.":"我還沒準備好。","If you think my Gabite is frightening, wait until you see what it grows into.":"要是覺得我的尖牙陸鯊嚇人，等著看牠進化吧。","That rock wall has stopped better Trainers than you!":"那道石牆攔住過比你更強的訓練家！","Maybe not better.":"也許沒有更強。","There is a plate in the floor. Something heavy on it might do something.":"地上有一塊機關板。在上面放點重東西，也許會有用。","You got through the wall? Then you are worth my time.":"你過了石牆？那就值得我花時間。","You are worth more than that.":"你不止值這些。","Rest when you can. The League will not wait for you to be ready.":"能休息就休息。聯盟不會等你準備好的。","At my age you stop trying to reach the League. You just enjoy the road.":"到了我這個年紀，就不再想著去聯盟了。只管享受這條路。","I enjoyed that.":"打得很開心。","I hope you enjoy the road as well. It goes by quickly.":"希望你也能享受這條路。它過得很快。","We came to the League together, and we fight together. Two against two!":"我們一起來到聯盟，也一起戰鬥。二對二！","We lost together, too.":"輸也一起輸了。","If one of us goes through those doors, we both do.":"我們要過那扇門，就兩個人一起過。","Water and fire, side by side. Nobody expects that!":"水和火並肩作戰。誰也想不到吧！","You expected that.":"你想到了。","You will have to Surf across the lake. The ladder is on the far side.":"你得用衝浪穿過湖。梯子在對岸。","You crossed the lake for this? I admire that. I will still beat you.":"你穿過湖就為了這個？佩服。不過我還是會贏的。","I admire that as well.":"這個我也佩服。","I trained in Blackthorn City once. Dragons are the same everywhere: they do not listen.":"我在煙墨市修行過。龍到哪兒都一樣：不聽話。","My Absol feels a disaster coming. I think it means you.":"我的阿勃梭魯感覺到災難要來了。我想說的就是你。","It meant me.":"原來是說我。","The ladder behind me goes up to the last part of the cave.":"我身後的梯子通往洞窟的最後一段。","Nobody has made it this far today. Let me fix that.":"今天還沒人走到這裡。我來解決這件事。","Somebody has.":"有人走到了。","You are nearly there. I can almost smell the fresh air from here.":"快到了。在這裡幾乎能聞到外面的空氣了。","The Pokémon League of Sinnoh. Trainers who reach this place have already come a long way.":"神奧寶可夢聯盟。能走到這裡的訓練家，已經走過了漫長的路。","Five battles in a row, and no way back once you start. That is the League. I am just here to look at it.":"連打五場，一旦開始就不能回頭。這就是聯盟。我只是來看看。","There you are, {player}! I got here first! I got lost twice in Victory Road, but I still got here first!":"你來了，{player}！我先到的！雖然在冠軍之路迷路了兩次，但還是我先到的！","Since the Spear Pillar I have thought about nothing else. If I cannot beat you, I have no business going through those doors.":"從槍之柱之後，我滿腦子都是這件事。如果贏不了你，我就沒資格走進那扇門。","All six of them are ready. This is the real one, {player}. Here we go!":"六隻全都準備好了。這才是真正的對決，{player}。來吧！","...That was everything I had. And you are still standing.":"……我已經用盡全力了。而你還站著。","All right. I get it. You are the one who goes first through those doors, and I will be right behind you. You had better not lose in there!":"好吧，我明白了。先走進那扇門的是你，我會緊跟在後面。你要是在裡面輸了，我絕不放過你！","This part of Victory Road is for Trainers who are filling in the National Pokédex. Come back when you have one.":"冠軍之路的這一片是給在完成全國圖鑑的訓練家走的。等你有了再來吧。","Big Sofa":"大沙發","Small Sofa":"小沙發","Bed":"床","Night Table":"床頭櫃","Audio System":"音頻系統","Bookshelf":"書架","Rack":"行李架","Houseplant":"盆栽","PC Desk":"個人電腦桌","Music Box":"音樂盒","Pokémon Bust":"寶可夢雕塑","Silver Pokémon Bust":"銀色寶可夢雕塑","Piano":"鋼琴","Guest Set":"會務桌","Wall Clock":"掛鐘","Masterpiece":"名畫","Tea Set":"茶具","Chandelier":"吊燈","Order the Rack first.":"要先訂購行李架。","Order the Guest Set first.":"要先訂購會務桌。","Win at least once at every facility of the Battle Frontier ({n} of {all} so far).":"在對戰開拓區的每個設施都至少贏過一次（目前 {n} / {all}）。","Earn a Silver Symbol at the Battle Frontier.":"在對戰開拓區得到一個銀色象徵。","Enter the Hall of Fame 10 times ({n} so far).":"登錄殿堂 10 次（目前 {n} 次）。","Win 50 battles at the Battleground ({n} so far).":"在對決場贏 50 場對戰（目前 {n} 場）。","Pick berries from trees 50 times ({n} so far).":"從樹上摘 50 次樹果（目前 {n} 次）。","Hatch 30 Eggs ({n} so far).":"孵化 30 個蛋（目前 {n} 個）。","Walk {max} steps ({n} so far).":"走 {max} 步（目前 {n} 步）。","Villa owner":"別墅主人","Ah, you must be the Trainer everyone in the Battle Zone talks about. I have been hoping you would come by.":"啊，你就是對戰特區裡大家都在談論的那位訓練家吧。我一直盼著你會來。","This villa is mine. I came to Sinnoh to look for rare stones, and now I have found every one I wanted.":"這棟別墅是我的。我來神奧是為了找稀有的石頭，現在想要的都找齊了。","So I am going home, and the villa needs someone new. It should belong to a strong Trainer. Here: it is yours, and it costs you nothing!":"所以我要回去了，別墅需要一位新主人。它應該屬於一位強大的訓練家。拿去吧，它是你的了，一分錢都不用花！","{player} became the owner of the villa!":"{player}成為了別墅的主人！","It is a little empty inside. There is a furniture catalog on the table; I am afraid nothing in it is cheap. Farewell!":"裡面有點空。桌上有一本家具目錄，只是恐怕上面沒有便宜的東西。再會了！","A big, bright room that smells of the sea. Only a table stands in the middle, with a thick catalog on it.":"寬敞明亮的房間，帶著海的氣味。中間只放著一張桌子，上面有一本厚厚的目錄。","A thick furniture catalog. Whatever you order is delivered right away.":"一本厚厚的家具目錄。訂購的東西馬上就會送到。","Furniture catalog":"家具目錄","The {item} cannot be ordered yet. {need}":"{item}現在還不能訂購。{need}","Order the {item} for {price}?":"要用{price}訂購{item}嗎？","The {item} was delivered!":"{item}送到了！","A big, soft bed. Will you rest for a while?":"又大又軟的床。要休息一下嗎？","{player} slept well. Your Pokémon are full of energy!":"{player}睡得很好。寶可夢們都精神飽滿！","A cooking show: today, a cake made with Oran Berries. It looks delicious.":"烹飪節目：今天做的是橙橙果蛋糕。看起來很好吃。","The news: a Trainer has been winning one battle after another in the Battle Zone.":"新聞：有一位訓練家在對戰特區接連獲勝。","A nature programme about the Pokémon that live deep in the sea.":"介紹深海寶可夢的自然節目。","{player} turned on the TV.":"{player}打開了電視。","The wall clock says {time}.":"掛鐘顯示 {time}。","A table for receiving guests. A tea set is laid out, ready for visitors.":"接待客人用的桌子。上面擺好了茶具，隨時可以招待客人。","A table for receiving guests.":"接待客人用的桌子。","{player}'s villa. The sea is right outside the door.":"{player}的別墅。一出門就是大海。","So the villa found its owner at last! I knew someone would come.":"別墅終於有主人了！我就知道會有人來的。","A big, soft sofa. From here you can hear the waves.":"又大又軟的沙發。坐在這裡能聽見海浪聲。","A small sofa, just right for one. It is very comfortable.":"剛好坐一個人的小沙發。非常舒服。","A lamp glows softly on the night table.":"床頭櫃上的檯燈發出柔和的光。","The audio system plays a lively tune.":"音頻系統放起了輕快的曲子。","Books about Pokémon from every region. One of them is all about the Pokémon of the Resort Area.":"介紹各地區寶可夢的書。其中有一本專門講名勝區的寶可夢。","A rack for bags and boxes. Everything has its place.":"放包和箱子的行李架。東西都擺得整整齊齊。","A big houseplant with glossy leaves.":"葉子油亮的大盆栽。","The music box plays a gentle melody.":"音樂盒奏起了溫柔的旋律。","A stone statue of a Pokémon. It looks proud of itself.":"寶可夢的石雕。看起來很神氣。","A statue of a Pokémon, tinted silver. It shines in the light.":"銀色的寶可夢雕塑。在光線下閃閃發亮。","{player} played a few notes on the piano.":"{player}彈了幾個音。","A famous painting of green hills under a bright sun. It must be worth a fortune.":"畫著陽光下綠色山丘的名畫。一定價值連城。","So this is the villa I have heard about. I came to see the Pokémon of the Resort Area.":"原來這就是傳聞中的別墅。我是來看名勝區的寶可夢的。","A fine bookshelf, too. Read about the Pokémon of other regions: there is always more to learn.":"書架也很不錯。多讀讀其他地區寶可夢的書吧，要學的東西永遠學不完。","The rocks along this beach are something else. Some of them came up from very deep down.":"這片海灘的岩石真了不起。有些是從很深的地底來的。","Your houseplant looks so happy! Plants can tell when someone takes care of them.":"你的盆栽看起來好開心！植物知道有人在照顧它們。","I ran here from Veilstone this morning! The sand is great for training your legs.":"我今天早上從帷幕市一路跑過來的！沙灘最適合鍛鍊腿力了。","Hah! My boy Roark told me about this villa. Sea air is good for an old fossil hunter like me!":"哈！我兒子瓢太跟我說過這棟別墅。海邊的空氣對我這把老骨頭的化石獵人最好了！","Whoa, so this is your villa? It is huge! I am going to have an even bigger one someday, just you wait!":"哇，這就是你的別墅？好大啊！總有一天我會有一棟更大的，你等著瞧！","I only came to look. Next time we meet, we battle! Got it?":"我只是來看看。下次見面就來對戰！聽到了嗎？","Hi! I heard you got a villa, so I had to see it. This sofa is so comfortable!":"嗨！聽說你有了別墅，我一定要來看看。這張沙發好舒服！","Professor Rowan says even a Champion needs somewhere to rest.":"七灶博士說，就算是冠軍也需要一個休息的地方。","So this is your villa! You really have grown up, haven't you?":"原來這就是你的別墅！你真的長大了呢。","Eat properly, even on holiday. And come home to Twinleaf now and then!":"就算在度假也要好好吃飯。偶爾也要回雙葉鎮的家看看哦！","Flint said I should get out of Sunyshore for a day... It is quiet here. Quiet is good.":"大葉說我該離開濱海市一天……這裡很安靜。安靜挺好。","Ha! Some place you have here! I told Volkner a change of scenery would fire him up.":"哈！你這地方真不錯！我就跟電次說過，換個環境能讓他燃起來。","...The sea is nice. I will give him that much.":"……大海不錯。這點我承認。","Maylene and I came to train on the beach! Focus, focus!":"我和阿李來海灘訓練了！集中，集中！","Candice says the sand is good for footwork. I think she just wanted to see the sea.":"小菘說沙灘能練步法。我看她只是想來看海吧。","Bonjour! What an elegant villa. It would be perfect for a dance party, non?":"Bonjour！多麼優雅的別墅。用來開舞會再合適不過了，non？","WAHAHA! A villa right by the sea! Crasher Wake approves! The waves here are just right!":"哇哈哈！就在海邊的別墅！吉憲認可了！這裡的浪剛剛好！","It is so warm here! Snowpoint is lovely, but a little sunshine is good for focus too.":"這裡好暖和啊！雪峰市很美，不過曬曬太陽對集中精神也有好處。","I thought I heard a piano... This villa suits you.":"我好像聽到了鋼琴聲……這棟別墅很適合你。","When I want to forget about battles for a while, I play too. Not very well, I am afraid.":"想暫時忘掉對戰的時候，我也會彈一彈。只是彈得不怎麼好。","Reginald & Lorenzo":"雷金納德和洛倫佐","Cassidy & Wayne":"卡西迪和阿偉","Tori & Diego":"托莉和迭戈","Ana & Parker":"安娜和帕克","Terry & Gerald":"泰瑞和傑拉德","Oh! Somebody is here! I am Mira. I came in to look for strong Pokémon, and now I cannot find the way out.":"哎！有人在！我是麥兒。我進來找厲害的寶可夢，結果找不到出去的路了。","Please, can I come with you? My Kadabra and I will help in battles, and I will look after your team!":"求求你，我可以跟你一起走嗎？我和我的勇基拉會在對戰裡幫忙，我也會照顧你的隊伍！","It is so dark in here. Please do not go too fast!":"這裡好黑啊。拜託別走太快！","Mira looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"麥兒照顧了你的寶可夢。牠們完全恢復了！","The way out! I can feel the wind! Thank you, thank you!":"是出口！我感覺到風了！謝謝你，謝謝你！","I will train until I am never lost again, in caves or in battles. One day I will battle you, and then you will see.":"我要好好修行，再也不迷路，不管是在洞窟裡還是在對戰裡。總有一天我要和你對戰，到時候你就知道了。","Two Hikers in a cave. This is where we feel at home!":"兩個登山男在洞窟裡。這裡就是我們的家！","Home is where you lose, apparently.":"看來在家裡也會輸。","This cave goes round and round. Keep heading up and you will find the way out.":"這個洞窟繞來繞去的。一直往上走就能找到出口。","We got lost together, so we might as well battle together!":"我們是一起迷路的，那就一起對戰吧！","Lost and beaten. What a day.":"又迷路又輸了。今天真倒楣。","If you see a girl with pink hair, she was looking for the way out too.":"要是看到一個粉色頭髮的女孩，她也在找出口。","We came in here for a picnic. It was too dark to see the sandwiches!":"我們是來野餐的。太黑了，連三明治都看不見！","At least we can see who won.":"至少看得清是誰贏了。","The mouth is just up there. You can feel the breeze.":"洞口就在上面。能感覺到風。","Camping in a cave is the best. No rain, no sun, no way out!":"在洞窟裡露營最棒了。沒有雨，沒有太陽，也沒有出口！","Not the best, then.":"看來也沒那麼棒。","We have been in here three days. We are fine. Probably.":"我們在這裡待了三天了。我們沒事。大概吧。","A collector and a ruin maniac. We both came looking for something rare!":"收藏家和遺跡迷。我們都是來找稀有東西的！","Rare, and strong. That was you.":"又稀有又強。原來是你。","There is another cave under the Cycling Road. That is where the rare one lives.":"自行車道下面還有一個洞窟。稀有的那隻就住在那裡。"},"zh-Hant",""]);
